{"openapi":"3.1.0","info":{"title":"Eckari capability API","version":"registry-5a21aa0a8dd1e910","description":"Eckari is the machine-native utility layer for capabilities agents do not already have. Every route is a provider-neutral capability with channel pricing for Eckari account keys and accountless x402 payment.","contact":{"name":"Eckari","url":"https://eckari.com"},"x-guidance":"Every operation is a deterministic capability. Call GET routes with the documented path/query parameters. Pay per call either with an Eckari account key (Authorization: Bearer ek_live_…) or accountlessly via x402: an unpaid request returns HTTP 402 with a PAYMENT-REQUIRED header (x402 v2, Base USDC); retry with PAYMENT-SIGNATURE. Responses are {data, meta} with provenance (meta.source) and freshness (meta.freshness). Use x-eckari-capability.discovery.use_when / do_not_use_when to pick the right operation; resolve a company name to a company number with the search operation before calling per-company operations."},"servers":[{"url":"https://api.eckari.com"}],"tags":[{"name":"company_information"},{"name":"domain_intelligence"},{"name":"foreign_exchange"},{"name":"location"},{"name":"logistics"},{"name":"weather"}],"paths":{"/v1/companies/uk/{company_number}/accounts":{"get":{"operationId":"company_uk_accounts","summary":"Check UK company accounts due dates on Companies House","description":"Return the accounts filing status of a UK company from the Companies House register — the accounting reference date, the last accounts filed (type and period), the next accounts due date and a derived overdue flag. This is the filing position, not the financial statements: no turnover, profit or balance-sheet figures are published here.\n\n**Use when:**\n- When are this UK company's accounts due?\n- Are company 00445790's accounts overdue?\n- You need the accounting reference date (ARD) of a UK company, from which the register derives its filing periods.\n- What type of accounts did this company last file and for what period?\n- You are scheduling compliance follow-ups or detecting dormant companies (accounts type dormant).\n\n**Do not use when:**\n- You need financial figures (turnover, profit, balance sheet) — not on the public register API.\n- You need the list of filed documents — use company.uk.filings with category accounts.\n- You only need whether the company is active — use company.uk.status.\n- If the user has asked you to inspect a specific website, page or URL, use your browsing tool instead — this capability only returns the Companies House Public Data API record.","tags":["company_information"],"parameters":[{"name":"company_number","in":"path","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string","description":"Companies House company number, also called the company registration number (CRN). Accepted shapes are the register's own — 1-8 digits (zero-padded to 8, e.g. 445790 → 00445790), one letter + 7 digits (R0000001), two letters + 6 digits (SC002180, NI000001, OC123456, OE000001), or the registered-society suffix forms (two letters + 5 digits + 1 letter; two letters + 4 digits + 2 letters). Case-insensitive; surrounding whitespace is ignored (which is why maxLength is 10); internal spaces and punctuation are not accepted. Any other value (for example PROBE) is rejected as INVALID_INPUT before payment and before any upstream call.","minLength":1,"maxLength":10,"pattern":"^\\s*(?:[0-9]{1,8}|[A-Za-z][0-9]{7}|[A-Za-z]{2}[0-9]{6}|[A-Za-z]{2}[0-9]{5}[A-Za-z]|[A-Za-z]{2}[0-9]{4}[A-Za-z]{2})\\s*$"},"description":"Companies House company number, also called the company registration number (CRN). Accepted shapes are the register's own — 1-8 digits (zero-padded to 8, e.g. 445790 → 00445790), one letter + 7 digits (R0000001), two letters + 6 digits (SC002180, NI000001, OC123456, OE000001), or the registered-society suffix forms (two letters + 5 digits + 1 letter; two letters + 4 digits + 2 letters). Case-insensitive; surrounding whitespace is ignored (which is why maxLength is 10); internal spaces and punctuation are not accepted. Any other value (for example PROBE) is rejected as INVALID_INPUT before payment and before any upstream call."}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful capability result","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","required":["data","meta"],"properties":{"data":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/company_uk_accounts_output"},"meta":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ResponseMeta"}}},"examples":{"accounts_position":{"summary":"accounts_position","value":{"data":{"company_number":"00445790","company_name":"TESCO PLC","has_accounts_information":true,"accounting_reference_date":{"day":26,"month":2},"last_accounts":{"type":"group","period_start_on":"2025-02-27","period_end_on":"2026-02-28","made_up_to":"2026-02-28"},"next_accounts":{"period_start_on":"2026-03-01","period_end_on":"2027-02-26","due_on":"2027-08-26","is_overdue":false}},"meta":{"capability":"company.uk.accounts","version":"2.0.0","source":"companies_house","freshness":"live"}}}}}}},"400":{"description":"Invalid input (INVALID_INPUT)","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"401":{"description":"Authentication failed (AUTHENTICATION_REQUIRED, INVALID_API_KEY)","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"402":{"description":"Payment required (PAYMENT_REQUIRED, PAYMENT_FAILED, BUDGET_EXCEEDED, BILLING_REQUIRED). x402 challenge headers are attached.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"403":{"description":"Forbidden (PROJECT_DISABLED, CAPABILITY_NOT_ALLOWED)","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"404":{"description":"Not found (NOT_FOUND)","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"422":{"description":"Unprocessable (UNSUPPORTED_REGION, AMBIGUOUS_IDENTIFIER)","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"429":{"description":"Upstream rate limited (UPSTREAM_RATE_LIMITED)","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"500":{"description":"Internal error (INTERNAL_ERROR)","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"503":{"description":"Unavailable (UPSTREAM_UNAVAILABLE, CAPABILITY_UNAVAILABLE, LICENCE_RESTRICTED)","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}}},"security":[{"eckariApiKey":[]},{"x402":[]}],"x-payment-info":{"price":{"mode":"fixed","currency":"USD","amount":"0.003"},"protocols":[{"x402":{}}]},"x-eckari-capability":{"id":"company.uk.accounts","version":"2.0.0","lifecycle":"beta","pricing":{"currency":"USD","account":{"enabled":true,"unit_price":"0.002"},"x402":{"enabled":true,"unit_price":"0.003"}},"discovery":{"title":"Check UK company accounts due dates on Companies House","description":"Return the accounts filing status of a UK company from the Companies House register — the accounting reference date, the last accounts filed (type and period), the next accounts due date and a derived overdue flag. This is the filing position, not the financial statements: no turnover, profit or balance-sheet figures are published here.","use_when":["When are this UK company's accounts due?","Are company 00445790's accounts overdue?","You need the accounting reference date (ARD) of a UK company, from which the register derives its filing periods.","What type of accounts did this company last file and for what period?","You are scheduling compliance follow-ups or detecting dormant companies (accounts type dormant)."],"do_not_use_when":["You need financial figures (turnover, profit, balance sheet) — not on the public register API.","You need the list of filed documents — use company.uk.filings with category accounts.","You only need whether the company is active — use company.uk.status.","If the user has asked you to inspect a specific website, page or URL, use your browsing tool instead — this capability only returns the Companies House Public Data API record."],"synonyms":["uk company accounts due date","overdue accounts companies house","accounting reference date","accounts filing status uk company","last accounts filed uk company","uk annual accounts status","uk company accounting reference date","filing deadline check uk company","uk company accounts due","uk company accounts overdue","companies house next accounts due","uk dormant company check","uk micro-entity accounts type","kyb accounts compliance uk"],"category":"company_information","region":"GB","tags":["uk","companies-house","company","kyb","accounts"],"related_capabilities":["company.uk.filings","company.uk.profile","company.uk.status"]},"cache_policy":{"mode":"none"},"provenance":{"sources":["companies_house"],"freshness":"live"}}}},"/v1/companies/uk/{company_number}/charges":{"get":{"operationId":"company_uk_charges","summary":"List UK company charges and mortgages from Companies House","description":"Charges registered against a UK company at Companies House — mortgages, debentures and other security — with dates, classification, particulars and the persons entitled. Register-wide outstanding/satisfied/part-satisfied counts lead the answer, and each charge carries a derived is_outstanding because the register records discharge under two status keys.\n\n**Use when:**\n- Establish whether a UK company has outstanding security over its assets, and who holds it.\n- Does this UK company have any outstanding charges or mortgages?\n- You need to know whether a UK company has secured borrowing, or who the secured lenders are.\n- Who holds security over company 00445790?\n- List the debentures registered against this limited company.\n- Has this company satisfied its registered charges?\n- You need charge status and dates for a credit or due-diligence decision.\n\n**Do not use when:**\n- You need insolvency proceedings — not currently supported (see the resource flags on company.uk.profile).\n- You need financial figures — not on the register.\n- You only need whether the company is active — use company.uk.status.\n- You would filter on status == \"satisfied\" yourself — the register uses two terminal keys and a part-satisfied one; read is_outstanding, or ask for status=outstanding.\n- If the user has asked you to inspect a specific website, page or URL, use your browsing tool instead — this capability only returns the Companies House Public Data API record.","tags":["company_information"],"parameters":[{"name":"company_number","in":"path","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string","description":"Companies House company number, also called the company registration number (CRN). Accepted shapes are the register's own — 1-8 digits (zero-padded to 8, e.g. 445790 → 00445790), one letter + 7 digits (R0000001), two letters + 6 digits (SC002180, NI000001, OC123456, OE000001), or the registered-society suffix forms (two letters + 5 digits + 1 letter; two letters + 4 digits + 2 letters). Case-insensitive; surrounding whitespace is ignored (which is why maxLength is 10); internal spaces and punctuation are not accepted. Any other value (for example PROBE) is rejected as INVALID_INPUT before payment and before any upstream call.","minLength":1,"maxLength":10,"pattern":"^\\s*(?:[0-9]{1,8}|[A-Za-z][0-9]{7}|[A-Za-z]{2}[0-9]{6}|[A-Za-z]{2}[0-9]{5}[A-Za-z]|[A-Za-z]{2}[0-9]{4}[A-Za-z]{2})\\s*$"},"description":"Companies House company number, also called the company registration number (CRN). Accepted shapes are the register's own — 1-8 digits (zero-padded to 8, e.g. 445790 → 00445790), one letter + 7 digits (R0000001), two letters + 6 digits (SC002180, NI000001, OC123456, OE000001), or the registered-society suffix forms (two letters + 5 digits + 1 letter; two letters + 4 digits + 2 letters). Case-insensitive; surrounding whitespace is ignored (which is why maxLength is 10); internal spaces and punctuation are not accepted. Any other value (for example PROBE) is rejected as INVALID_INPUT before payment and before any upstream call."},{"name":"status","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"string","enum":["outstanding","satisfied","all"],"description":"Which charges to return. Default `all`. `outstanding` returns the charges that are still security over the company (everything the register has not marked satisfied or fully-satisfied, including part-satisfied); `satisfied` returns the discharged ones. The register offers no server-side filter, so Eckari applies it after reading up to three register pages of 100 charges — read page.has_more rather than items.length."},"description":"Which charges to return. Default `all`. `outstanding` returns the charges that are still security over the company (everything the register has not marked satisfied or fully-satisfied, including part-satisfied); `satisfied` returns the discharged ones. The register offers no server-side filter, so Eckari applies it after reading up to three register pages of 100 charges — read page.has_more rather than items.length."},{"name":"detail","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"string","enum":["summary","full"],"description":"How much of each charge to return. Default summary. `full` adds the four members the register populates only for particular filings — acquired_on, resolved_on, assets_ceased_released and more_than_four_persons_entitled — which are null on the great majority of charges."},"description":"How much of each charge to return. Default summary. `full` adds the four members the register populates only for particular filings — acquired_on, resolved_on, assets_ceased_released and more_than_four_persons_entitled — which are null on the great majority of charges."},{"name":"limit","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"integer","description":"Maximum charges to return per page (1-100). Default 3: a charge carries free-text particulars, secured details and the persons entitled, so it is several times the size of an officer or a filing row - the register-wide counts and page.total still describe the whole register.","minimum":1,"maximum":100},"description":"Maximum charges to return per page (1-100). Default 3: a charge carries free-text particulars, secured details and the persons entitled, so it is several times the size of an officer or a filing row - the register-wide counts and page.total still describe the whole register."},{"name":"offset","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"integer","description":"Zero-based index into the register's charge list (not into the filtered result). Pass back page.next_offset from the previous response to page.","minimum":0,"maximum":10000},"description":"Zero-based index into the register's charge list (not into the filtered result). Pass back page.next_offset from the previous response to page."}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful capability result","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","required":["data","meta"],"properties":{"data":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/company_uk_charges_output"},"meta":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ResponseMeta"}}},"examples":{"outstanding_and_fully_satisfied_charges":{"summary":"outstanding_and_fully_satisfied_charges","value":{"data":{"company_number":"00445790","query":{"status":"all","detail":"summary"},"outstanding_count":2,"satisfied_count":7,"part_satisfied_count":0,"items":[{"id":"5QU1lSudRI2jTIfUv_AOVxfLxVE","charge_number":9,"charge_code":null,"status":"outstanding","is_outstanding":true,"created_on":"2009-11-04","delivered_on":"2009-11-06","satisfied_on":null,"classification":[{"type":"charge-description","description":"Account security agreement"}],"particulars":[{"type":"short-particulars","description":"Right title benefit and interest in and to the account being the euro designated account in the name of the company with sort code 40-05-15 account number 67851117, and the deposit. See image for full details.","flags":[]}],"secured_details":[{"type":"amount-secured","description":"All sums due or to become due under the terms of the aforementioned instrument creating or evidencing the charge"}],"persons_entitled":[{"name":"Tesco Trustee Company of Ireland Limited as Trustee of the Tesco Ireland Limited Senior Executive Pension Scheme"}]},{"id":"co-_yIXMvPnNBqPuNZqOcwFwqtM","charge_number":8,"charge_code":null,"status":"outstanding","is_outstanding":true,"created_on":"2009-11-04","delivered_on":"2009-11-06","satisfied_on":null,"classification":[{"type":"charge-description","description":"Account security agreement"}],"particulars":[{"type":"short-particulars","description":"Right title benefit and interest in and to the account being the euro designated account in the name of the company with sort code 40-05-15 account number 67851125, and the deposit. See image for full details.","flags":[]}],"secured_details":[{"type":"amount-secured","description":"All sums due or to become due under the terms of the aforementioned instrument creating or evidencing the charge"}],"persons_entitled":[{"name":"Tesco Ireland Pension Trustees Limited as Trustee of the Tesco Ireland Limited Pension Plan"}]},{"id":"tgY95yhyQRDPJUDlFArt5RgNDy8","charge_number":7,"charge_code":null,"status":"fully-satisfied","is_outstanding":false,"created_on":"2009-03-27","delivered_on":"2009-03-27","satisfied_on":"2009-11-25","classification":[{"type":"charge-description","description":"Account security agreement"}],"particulars":[{"type":"short-particulars","description":"All present and future right title benefit and interest in and to the account and the deposit see image for full details.","flags":[]}],"secured_details":[{"type":"amount-secured","description":"All monies due or to become due from the company to the chargee under the terms of the aforementioned instrument creating or evidencing the charge"}],"persons_entitled":[{"name":"Tesco Ireland Pension Trustees Limited as Trustee of the Tesco Ireland Limited Executive Scheme"}]}],"page":{"limit":3,"offset":0,"returned":3,"total":9,"has_more":true,"next_offset":3}},"meta":{"capability":"company.uk.charges","version":"3.1.0","source":"companies_house","freshness":"live"}}},"outstanding_security_only":{"summary":"outstanding_security_only","value":{"data":{"company_number":"00445790","query":{"status":"outstanding","detail":"summary"},"outstanding_count":2,"satisfied_count":7,"part_satisfied_count":0,"items":[{"id":"5QU1lSudRI2jTIfUv_AOVxfLxVE","charge_number":9,"charge_code":null,"status":"outstanding","is_outstanding":true,"created_on":"2009-11-04","delivered_on":"2009-11-06","satisfied_on":null,"classification":[{"type":"charge-description","description":"Account security agreement"}],"particulars":[{"type":"short-particulars","description":"Right title benefit and interest in and to the account being the euro designated account in the name of the company with sort code 40-05-15 account number 67851117, and the deposit. See image for full details.","flags":[]}],"secured_details":[{"type":"amount-secured","description":"All sums due or to become due under the terms of the aforementioned instrument creating or evidencing the charge"}],"persons_entitled":[{"name":"Tesco Trustee Company of Ireland Limited as Trustee of the Tesco Ireland Limited Senior Executive Pension Scheme"}]},{"id":"co-_yIXMvPnNBqPuNZqOcwFwqtM","charge_number":8,"charge_code":null,"status":"outstanding","is_outstanding":true,"created_on":"2009-11-04","delivered_on":"2009-11-06","satisfied_on":null,"classification":[{"type":"charge-description","description":"Account security agreement"}],"particulars":[{"type":"short-particulars","description":"Right title benefit and interest in and to the account being the euro designated account in the name of the company with sort code 40-05-15 account number 67851125, and the deposit. See image for full details.","flags":[]}],"secured_details":[{"type":"amount-secured","description":"All sums due or to become due under the terms of the aforementioned instrument creating or evidencing the charge"}],"persons_entitled":[{"name":"Tesco Ireland Pension Trustees Limited as Trustee of the Tesco Ireland Limited Pension Plan"}]}],"page":{"limit":2,"offset":0,"returned":2,"total":2,"has_more":false,"next_offset":null}},"meta":{"capability":"company.uk.charges","version":"3.1.0","source":"companies_house","freshness":"live"}}}}}}},"400":{"description":"Invalid input (INVALID_INPUT)","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"401":{"description":"Authentication failed (AUTHENTICATION_REQUIRED, INVALID_API_KEY)","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"402":{"description":"Payment required (PAYMENT_REQUIRED, PAYMENT_FAILED, BUDGET_EXCEEDED, BILLING_REQUIRED). x402 challenge headers are attached.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"403":{"description":"Forbidden (PROJECT_DISABLED, CAPABILITY_NOT_ALLOWED)","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"404":{"description":"Not found (NOT_FOUND)","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"422":{"description":"Unprocessable (UNSUPPORTED_REGION, AMBIGUOUS_IDENTIFIER)","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"429":{"description":"Upstream rate limited (UPSTREAM_RATE_LIMITED)","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"500":{"description":"Internal error (INTERNAL_ERROR)","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"503":{"description":"Unavailable (UPSTREAM_UNAVAILABLE, CAPABILITY_UNAVAILABLE, LICENCE_RESTRICTED)","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}}},"security":[{"eckariApiKey":[]},{"x402":[]}],"x-payment-info":{"price":{"mode":"fixed","currency":"USD","amount":"0.006"},"protocols":[{"x402":{}}]},"x-eckari-capability":{"id":"company.uk.charges","version":"3.1.0","lifecycle":"beta","pricing":{"currency":"USD","account":{"enabled":true,"unit_price":"0.005"},"x402":{"enabled":true,"unit_price":"0.006"}},"discovery":{"title":"List UK company charges and mortgages from Companies House","description":"Charges registered against a UK company at Companies House — mortgages, debentures and other security — with dates, classification, particulars and the persons entitled. Register-wide outstanding/satisfied/part-satisfied counts lead the answer, and each charge carries a derived is_outstanding because the register records discharge under two status keys.","use_when":["Establish whether a UK company has outstanding security over its assets, and who holds it.","Does this UK company have any outstanding charges or mortgages?","You need to know whether a UK company has secured borrowing, or who the secured lenders are.","Who holds security over company 00445790?","List the debentures registered against this limited company.","Has this company satisfied its registered charges?","You need charge status and dates for a credit or due-diligence decision."],"do_not_use_when":["You need insolvency proceedings — not currently supported (see the resource flags on company.uk.profile).","You need financial figures — not on the register.","You only need whether the company is active — use company.uk.status.","You would filter on status == \"satisfied\" yourself — the register uses two terminal keys and a part-satisfied one; read is_outstanding, or ask for status=outstanding.","If the user has asked you to inspect a specific website, page or URL, use your browsing tool instead — this capability only returns the Companies House Public Data API record."],"synonyms":["uk company charges","companies house charges","registered mortgages uk company","debentures registered against company","charge holder lookup uk company","security interests uk company","secured lenders uk company","floating charge check uk company","uk company liens and encumbrances","outstanding security uk company","companies house mortgage register","credit due diligence uk company"],"category":"company_information","region":"GB","tags":["uk","companies-house","company","kyb","charges"],"related_capabilities":["company.uk.profile","company.uk.filings","company.uk.status"]},"cache_policy":{"mode":"none"},"provenance":{"sources":["companies_house"],"freshness":"live"}}}},"/v1/companies/uk/{company_number}/directors":{"get":{"operationId":"company_uk_directors","summary":"List UK company directors from the Companies House officers register","description":"Directors of a UK company from the Companies House officers register — the register of directors, secretaries and LLP members — including corporate and nominee directors, with appointment and resignation dates, nationality, country of residence, occupation, month/year of birth and correspondence address. role and include_resigned widen it.\n\n**Use when:**\n- Identify who is legally responsible for a UK company - the directors on the Companies House officers register.\n- Who are the directors of this UK company?\n- You need the officers of a UK company - the officers register holds directors, secretaries and LLP members, and role selects which.\n- You need the current directors of a UK company by company number.\n- List the directors of company 00445790.\n- You need to check whether a named person is currently a director of the company.\n- Who runs this limited company? (directors on the register)\n- Has anyone resigned as a director recently?\n- You need the company secretary or the LLP members instead (role=secretary, role=llp_member).\n- You need appointment and resignation history for KYC, onboarding or due diligence.\n\n**Do not use when:**\n- You need beneficial owners / persons with significant control — use company.uk.owners.\n- You only need whether the company is active — use company.uk.status.\n- You would read officer_status/is_active as a statement about the company — it describes the register entry only; a dissolved company's officers are reported inactive (not resigned), so check company.uk.status for the company itself.\n- You need the company profile (type, SIC codes, address) — use company.uk.profile.\n- You want to search for a person across all companies (officer search) — not supported.\n- If the user has asked you to inspect a specific website, page or URL, use your browsing tool instead — this capability only returns the Companies House Public Data API record.","tags":["company_information"],"parameters":[{"name":"company_number","in":"path","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string","description":"Companies House company number, also called the company registration number (CRN). Accepted shapes are the register's own — 1-8 digits (zero-padded to 8, e.g. 445790 → 00445790), one letter + 7 digits (R0000001), two letters + 6 digits (SC002180, NI000001, OC123456, OE000001), or the registered-society suffix forms (two letters + 5 digits + 1 letter; two letters + 4 digits + 2 letters). Case-insensitive; surrounding whitespace is ignored (which is why maxLength is 10); internal spaces and punctuation are not accepted. Any other value (for example PROBE) is rejected as INVALID_INPUT before payment and before any upstream call.","minLength":1,"maxLength":10,"pattern":"^\\s*(?:[0-9]{1,8}|[A-Za-z][0-9]{7}|[A-Za-z]{2}[0-9]{6}|[A-Za-z]{2}[0-9]{5}[A-Za-z]|[A-Za-z]{2}[0-9]{4}[A-Za-z]{2})\\s*$"},"description":"Companies House company number, also called the company registration number (CRN). Accepted shapes are the register's own — 1-8 digits (zero-padded to 8, e.g. 445790 → 00445790), one letter + 7 digits (R0000001), two letters + 6 digits (SC002180, NI000001, OC123456, OE000001), or the registered-society suffix forms (two letters + 5 digits + 1 letter; two letters + 4 digits + 2 letters). Case-insensitive; surrounding whitespace is ignored (which is why maxLength is 10); internal spaces and punctuation are not accepted. Any other value (for example PROBE) is rejected as INVALID_INPUT before payment and before any upstream call."},{"name":"role","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"string","enum":["director","secretary","llp_member","all"],"description":"Which appointments to return. Default `director` — the capability's name is its contract. The register encodes the office in officer_role, so the filter is a substring test on it: `director` matches director, corporate-director, nominee-director and corporate-nominee-director; `secretary` matches secretary, corporate-secretary, nominee-secretary and corporate-nominee-secretary; `llp_member` matches llp-member, llp-designated-member and their corporate- forms; `all` returns every appointment the register lists, including managing officers, general partners, judicial factors and the EEIG/SE organ roles. Filtering is applied after the register read, so read page.has_more rather than items.length."},"description":"Which appointments to return. Default `director` — the capability's name is its contract. The register encodes the office in officer_role, so the filter is a substring test on it: `director` matches director, corporate-director, nominee-director and corporate-nominee-director; `secretary` matches secretary, corporate-secretary, nominee-secretary and corporate-nominee-secretary; `llp_member` matches llp-member, llp-designated-member and their corporate- forms; `all` returns every appointment the register lists, including managing officers, general partners, judicial factors and the EEIG/SE organ roles. Filtering is applied after the register read, so read page.has_more rather than items.length."},{"name":"include_resigned","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"boolean","description":"Include resigned officers. Default false."},"description":"Include resigned officers. Default false."},{"name":"limit","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"integer","description":"Maximum officers to return per page (1-100). Default 5. Eckari reads up to three register pages of 100 entries to fill this after the role and resigned filters are applied; if the limit is still unmet, page.has_more is true and page.next_offset says where to resume.","minimum":1,"maximum":100},"description":"Maximum officers to return per page (1-100). Default 5. Eckari reads up to three register pages of 100 entries to fill this after the role and resigned filters are applied; if the limit is still unmet, page.has_more is true and page.next_offset says where to resume."},{"name":"offset","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"integer","description":"Zero-based index into the register's own officer list (not into the filtered result). Pass back page.next_offset from the previous response to page.","minimum":0,"maximum":10000},"description":"Zero-based index into the register's own officer list (not into the filtered result). Pass back page.next_offset from the previous response to page."}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful capability result","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","required":["data","meta"],"properties":{"data":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/company_uk_directors_output"},"meta":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ResponseMeta"}}},"examples":{"active_directors_first_page":{"summary":"active_directors_first_page","value":{"data":{"company_number":"00445790","query":{"role":"director","include_resigned":false},"officer_totals":{"active":11,"inactive":0,"resigned":63},"items":[{"name":"BETHELL, Melissa","role":"director","officer_status":"active","is_active":true,"appointed_on":"2018-09-24","resigned_on":null,"nationality":"British","country_of_residence":"United Kingdom","occupation":null,"date_of_birth":{"month":9,"year":1974},"address":{"care_of":null,"premises":"Tesco House","address_line_1":"Shire Park","address_line_2":"Kestrel Way","po_box":null,"locality":"Welwyn Garden City","region":null,"postal_code":"AL7 1GA","country":"United Kingdom"},"identification":null},{"name":"BODSON, Bertrand Jean Francois","role":"director","officer_status":"active","is_active":true,"appointed_on":"2021-06-01","resigned_on":null,"nationality":"Belgian","country_of_residence":"England","occupation":null,"date_of_birth":{"month":6,"year":1975},"address":{"care_of":null,"premises":"Tesco House","address_line_1":"Shire Park","address_line_2":"Kestrel Way","po_box":null,"locality":"Welwyn Garden City","region":null,"postal_code":"AL7 1GA","country":"United Kingdom"},"identification":null},{"name":"FAIRBAIRN, Carolyn Julie","role":"director","officer_status":"active","is_active":true,"appointed_on":"2023-09-01","resigned_on":null,"nationality":"British","country_of_residence":"United Kingdom","occupation":null,"date_of_birth":{"month":12,"year":1960},"address":{"care_of":null,"premises":null,"address_line_1":"Tesco House, Shire Park","address_line_2":"Kestrel Way","po_box":null,"locality":"Welwyn Garden City","region":null,"postal_code":"AL7 1GA","country":"United Kingdom"},"identification":null}],"page":{"limit":3,"offset":0,"returned":3,"total":null,"has_more":true,"next_offset":4}},"meta":{"capability":"company.uk.directors","version":"3.1.0","source":"companies_house","freshness":"live"}}},"company_secretary":{"summary":"company_secretary","value":{"data":{"company_number":"00445790","query":{"role":"secretary","include_resigned":false},"officer_totals":{"active":11,"inactive":0,"resigned":63},"items":[{"name":"TAYLOR, Christopher Jon","role":"secretary","officer_status":"active","is_active":true,"appointed_on":"2025-04-14","resigned_on":null,"nationality":null,"country_of_residence":null,"occupation":null,"date_of_birth":null,"address":{"care_of":null,"premises":null,"address_line_1":"Tesco House, Shire Park","address_line_2":"Kestrel Way","po_box":null,"locality":"Welwyn Garden City","region":null,"postal_code":"AL7 1GA","country":"United Kingdom"},"identification":null}],"page":{"limit":1,"offset":0,"returned":1,"total":null,"has_more":false,"next_offset":null}},"meta":{"capability":"company.uk.directors","version":"3.1.0","source":"companies_house","freshness":"live"}}}}}}},"400":{"description":"Invalid input (INVALID_INPUT)","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"401":{"description":"Authentication failed (AUTHENTICATION_REQUIRED, INVALID_API_KEY)","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"402":{"description":"Payment required (PAYMENT_REQUIRED, PAYMENT_FAILED, BUDGET_EXCEEDED, BILLING_REQUIRED). x402 challenge headers are attached.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"403":{"description":"Forbidden (PROJECT_DISABLED, CAPABILITY_NOT_ALLOWED)","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"404":{"description":"Not found (NOT_FOUND)","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"422":{"description":"Unprocessable (UNSUPPORTED_REGION, AMBIGUOUS_IDENTIFIER)","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"429":{"description":"Upstream rate limited (UPSTREAM_RATE_LIMITED)","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"500":{"description":"Internal error (INTERNAL_ERROR)","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"503":{"description":"Unavailable (UPSTREAM_UNAVAILABLE, CAPABILITY_UNAVAILABLE, LICENCE_RESTRICTED)","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}}},"security":[{"eckariApiKey":[]},{"x402":[]}],"x-payment-info":{"price":{"mode":"fixed","currency":"USD","amount":"0.005"},"protocols":[{"x402":{}}]},"x-eckari-capability":{"id":"company.uk.directors","version":"3.1.0","lifecycle":"beta","pricing":{"currency":"USD","account":{"enabled":true,"unit_price":"0.004"},"x402":{"enabled":true,"unit_price":"0.005"}},"discovery":{"title":"List UK company directors from the Companies House officers register","description":"Directors of a UK company from the Companies House officers register — the register of directors, secretaries and LLP members — including corporate and nominee directors, with appointment and resignation dates, nationality, country of residence, occupation, month/year of birth and correspondence address. role and include_resigned widen it.","use_when":["Identify who is legally responsible for a UK company - the directors on the Companies House officers register.","Who are the directors of this UK company?","You need the officers of a UK company - the officers register holds directors, secretaries and LLP members, and role selects which.","You need the current directors of a UK company by company number.","List the directors of company 00445790.","You need to check whether a named person is currently a director of the company.","Who runs this limited company? (directors on the register)","Has anyone resigned as a director recently?","You need the company secretary or the LLP members instead (role=secretary, role=llp_member).","You need appointment and resignation history for KYC, onboarding or due diligence."],"do_not_use_when":["You need beneficial owners / persons with significant control — use company.uk.owners.","You only need whether the company is active — use company.uk.status.","You would read officer_status/is_active as a statement about the company — it describes the register entry only; a dissolved company's officers are reported inactive (not resigned), so check company.uk.status for the company itself.","You need the company profile (type, SIC codes, address) — use company.uk.profile.","You want to search for a person across all companies (officer search) — not supported.","If the user has asked you to inspect a specific website, page or URL, use your browsing tool instead — this capability only returns the Companies House Public Data API record."],"synonyms":["uk company directors","companies house officers","company directors lookup uk","who are the directors of a uk company","director search by company number","board members companies house","company secretary lookup uk","llp members lookup uk","uk corporate officers","kyc director verification uk","uk company officer appointments","uk company director resignations"],"category":"company_information","region":"GB","tags":["uk","companies-house","company","kyb","directors"],"related_capabilities":["company.uk.owners","company.uk.profile","company.uk.status","company.uk.filings"]},"cache_policy":{"mode":"none"},"provenance":{"sources":["companies_house"],"freshness":"live"}}}},"/v1/companies/uk/{company_number}/filings":{"get":{"operationId":"company_uk_filings","summary":"List UK company filing history from Companies House","description":"Return the filing history of a UK company from the Companies House register — accounts, confirmation statements, officer appointments, address and capital changes, resolutions and mortgages — most recent first, optionally filtered by category, with date, form type (AA, CS01, AP01, TM01), the readable register description, registrar annotations and a document_url for every filed image.\n\n**Use when:**\n- What has this UK company filed recently?\n- When did company 00445790 last file accounts or a confirmation statement?\n- Show the filing history for this company.\n- List officer appointment or termination filings for this limited company.\n- You need a link to the filed document (PDF) for a register filing.\n- You are building a due-diligence timeline of register events for a UK company.\n\n**Do not use when:**\n- You need the current directors themselves rather than the filing events — use company.uk.directors.\n- You need accounts due dates and the last accounts summary — use company.uk.accounts.\n- You need registered charges or mortgages — use company.uk.charges.\n- You only need whether the company is active — use company.uk.status.\n- You need the document bytes themselves — Eckari returns the register's document_url, not the file.\n- If the user has asked you to inspect a specific website, page or URL, use your browsing tool instead — this capability only returns the Companies House Public Data API record.","tags":["company_information"],"parameters":[{"name":"company_number","in":"path","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string","description":"Companies House company number. Accepted shapes are the register's own — 1-8 digits (zero-padded to 8, e.g. 445790 → 00445790), one letter + 7 digits (R0000001), two letters + 6 digits (SC002180, NI000001, OC123456, OE000001), or the registered-society suffix forms (two letters + 5 digits + 1 letter; two letters + 4 digits + 2 letters). Case-insensitive; surrounding whitespace is ignored (which is why maxLength is 10); internal spaces and punctuation are not accepted. Any other value (for example PROBE) is rejected as INVALID_INPUT before payment and before any upstream call.","minLength":1,"maxLength":10,"pattern":"^\\s*(?:[0-9]{1,8}|[A-Za-z][0-9]{7}|[A-Za-z]{2}[0-9]{6}|[A-Za-z]{2}[0-9]{5}[A-Za-z]|[A-Za-z]{2}[0-9]{4}[A-Za-z]{2})\\s*$"},"description":"Companies House company number. Accepted shapes are the register's own — 1-8 digits (zero-padded to 8, e.g. 445790 → 00445790), one letter + 7 digits (R0000001), two letters + 6 digits (SC002180, NI000001, OC123456, OE000001), or the registered-society suffix forms (two letters + 5 digits + 1 letter; two letters + 4 digits + 2 letters). Case-insensitive; surrounding whitespace is ignored (which is why maxLength is 10); internal spaces and punctuation are not accepted. Any other value (for example PROBE) is rejected as INVALID_INPUT before payment and before any upstream call."},{"name":"category","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"string","description":"Optional comma-separated register categories to include (e.g. accounts, address, annual-return, capital, change-of-name, incorporation, liquidation, miscellaneous, mortgage, officers, resolution, confirmation-statement). The applied value is echoed back as query.category.","maxLength":200,"pattern":"^[a-z-]+(,[a-z-]+)*$"},"description":"Optional comma-separated register categories to include (e.g. accounts, address, annual-return, capital, change-of-name, incorporation, liquidation, miscellaneous, mortgage, officers, resolution, confirmation-statement). The applied value is echoed back as query.category."},{"name":"detail","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"string","enum":["summary","full"],"description":"How much of each filing to return. Default summary: the readable description, its source, the register's annotations, the form type and the document URL. `full` adds the register's raw description_key and description_values for reconciliation against a register capture."},"description":"How much of each filing to return. Default summary: the readable description, its source, the register's annotations, the form type and the document URL. `full` adds the register's raw description_key and description_values for reconciliation against a register capture."},{"name":"limit","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"integer","description":"Maximum filings to return per page (1-100). Default 5.","minimum":1,"maximum":100},"description":"Maximum filings to return per page (1-100). Default 5."},{"name":"offset","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"integer","description":"Zero-based index into the register's filing list for the applied category filter. Nothing is filtered out after reading, so page.has_more is simply offset + returned < page.total; pass back page.next_offset.","minimum":0,"maximum":10000},"description":"Zero-based index into the register's filing list for the applied category filter. Nothing is filtered out after reading, so page.has_more is simply offset + returned < page.total; pass back page.next_offset."}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful capability result","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","required":["data","meta"],"properties":{"data":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/company_uk_filings_output"},"meta":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ResponseMeta"}}},"examples":{"recent_filings_full_live_response":{"summary":"recent_filings_full_live_response","value":{"data":{"company_number":"00445790","query":{"category":null,"detail":"summary"},"filing_history_status":"filing-history-available","is_filing_history_available":true,"items":[{"transaction_id":"MzUzNjI5NTk0OWFkaXF6a2N4","date":"2026-08-06","category":"capital","subcategory":null,"type":"SH03","description":"Purchase of own shares.","description_source":"enumeration","annotations":[{"annotation":"Clarification HMRC confirmation received that appropriate Stamp Duty has been paid for this transaction.","date":"2026-08-06","description":"annotation"}],"pages":4,"paper_filed":true,"has_document":true,"document_url":"https://find-and-update.company-information.service.gov.uk/company/00445790/filing-history/MzUzNjI5NTk0OWFkaXF6a2N4/document?format=pdf"},{"transaction_id":"MzUzNjI5NTk1OWFkaXF6a2N4","date":"2026-08-06","category":"capital","subcategory":null,"type":"SH03","description":"Purchase of own shares.","description_source":"enumeration","annotations":[{"annotation":"Clarification HMRC confirmation received that appropriate Stamp Duty has been paid for this transaction.","date":"2026-08-06","description":"annotation"}],"pages":4,"paper_filed":true,"has_document":true,"document_url":"https://find-and-update.company-information.service.gov.uk/company/00445790/filing-history/MzUzNjI5NTk1OWFkaXF6a2N4/document?format=pdf"},{"transaction_id":"MzUzNjI5NTk3MWFkaXF6a2N4","date":"2026-08-06","category":"capital","subcategory":null,"type":"SH03","description":"Purchase of own shares.","description_source":"enumeration","annotations":[{"annotation":"Clarification HMRC confirmation received that appropriate Stamp Duty has been paid for this transaction.","date":"2026-08-06","description":"annotation"}],"pages":4,"paper_filed":true,"has_document":true,"document_url":"https://find-and-update.company-information.service.gov.uk/company/00445790/filing-history/MzUzNjI5NTk3MWFkaXF6a2N4/document?format=pdf"}],"page":{"limit":3,"offset":0,"returned":3,"total":8367,"has_more":true,"next_offset":3}},"meta":{"capability":"company.uk.filings","version":"3.0.0","source":"companies_house","freshness":"live"}}}}}}},"400":{"description":"Invalid input (INVALID_INPUT)","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"401":{"description":"Authentication failed (AUTHENTICATION_REQUIRED, INVALID_API_KEY)","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"402":{"description":"Payment required (PAYMENT_REQUIRED, PAYMENT_FAILED, BUDGET_EXCEEDED, BILLING_REQUIRED). x402 challenge headers are attached.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"403":{"description":"Forbidden (PROJECT_DISABLED, CAPABILITY_NOT_ALLOWED)","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"404":{"description":"Not found (NOT_FOUND)","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"422":{"description":"Unprocessable (UNSUPPORTED_REGION, AMBIGUOUS_IDENTIFIER)","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"429":{"description":"Upstream rate limited (UPSTREAM_RATE_LIMITED)","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"500":{"description":"Internal error (INTERNAL_ERROR)","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"503":{"description":"Unavailable (UPSTREAM_UNAVAILABLE, CAPABILITY_UNAVAILABLE, LICENCE_RESTRICTED)","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}}},"security":[{"eckariApiKey":[]},{"x402":[]}],"x-payment-info":{"price":{"mode":"fixed","currency":"USD","amount":"0.005"},"protocols":[{"x402":{}}]},"x-eckari-capability":{"id":"company.uk.filings","version":"3.0.0","lifecycle":"beta","pricing":{"currency":"USD","account":{"enabled":true,"unit_price":"0.004"},"x402":{"enabled":true,"unit_price":"0.005"}},"discovery":{"title":"List UK company filing history from Companies House","description":"Return the filing history of a UK company from the Companies House register — accounts, confirmation statements, officer appointments, address and capital changes, resolutions and mortgages — most recent first, optionally filtered by category, with date, form type (AA, CS01, AP01, TM01), the readable register description, registrar annotations and a document_url for every filed image.","use_when":["What has this UK company filed recently?","When did company 00445790 last file accounts or a confirmation statement?","Show the filing history for this company.","List officer appointment or termination filings for this limited company.","You need a link to the filed document (PDF) for a register filing.","You are building a due-diligence timeline of register events for a UK company."],"do_not_use_when":["You need the current directors themselves rather than the filing events — use company.uk.directors.","You need accounts due dates and the last accounts summary — use company.uk.accounts.","You need registered charges or mortgages — use company.uk.charges.","You only need whether the company is active — use company.uk.status.","You need the document bytes themselves — Eckari returns the register's document_url, not the file.","If the user has asked you to inspect a specific website, page or URL, use your browsing tool instead — this capability only returns the Companies House Public Data API record."],"synonyms":["companies house filing history","uk company filings","documents filed at companies house","annual accounts filed","confirmation statement filed","confirmation statement history","annual return","recent filings","statutory filings uk","corporate filings united kingdom","companies house forms","filing events by company number","register filing timeline","kyb filing history","due diligence filings uk","officer appointment filings"],"category":"company_information","region":"GB","tags":["uk","companies-house","company","kyb","filings"],"related_capabilities":["company.uk.accounts","company.uk.charges","company.uk.profile","company.uk.status"]},"cache_policy":{"mode":"none"},"provenance":{"sources":["companies_house"],"freshness":"live"}}}},"/v1/companies/uk/{company_number}/owners":{"get":{"operationId":"company_uk_owners","summary":"List UK company beneficial owners (PSC) from Companies House","description":"An empty items list is never the same as \"no owner\": ownership_status and the filed PSC statements/exemptions explain why the register discloses none. Returns the persons with significant control (PSCs) for a UK company — the individuals, entities or legal persons that own or control it — each nature of control carrying the register code and its official text, with dates and public identification. The UK statutory beneficial-ownership (UBO) record.\n\n**Use when:**\n- Who owns this UK company?\n- You need beneficial ownership / UBO / controlling parties for KYB, AML, onboarding or supplier due diligence.\n- Who controls company 00445790?\n- Which shareholders own more than 25% of this company?\n- You need to know whether a specific person or entity controls the company.\n- You need ownership bands or voting-rights control information.\n- You need to know why a company discloses no PSC — exempt listed company, no registrable person, PSC not identified or super-secure.\n\n**Do not use when:**\n- You need directors/officers rather than owners — use company.uk.directors.\n- You only need whether the company is active — use company.uk.status.\n- You would read items[].is_active as a statement about the company — it means the register records no cessation date for that PSC entry, and a dissolved company can still list one; check company.uk.status for the company itself.\n- You need sanctions screening — is_sanctioned is a register declaration filed for overseas-entity beneficial owners only, never an Eckari screening result.\n- You need the full shareholder register (all shareholders, any percentage) — not published by the register.\n- You expect every company to have a PSC — some lawfully have none (a statement is filed, or the company is an exempt listed company) and an empty items list with a non-empty ownership_status is a valid result.\n- If the user has asked you to inspect a specific website, page or URL, use your browsing tool instead — this capability only returns the Companies House Public Data API record.","tags":["company_information"],"parameters":[{"name":"company_number","in":"path","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string","description":"Companies House company number. Accepted shapes are the register's own — 1-8 digits (zero-padded to 8, e.g. 445790 → 00445790), one letter + 7 digits (R0000001), two letters + 6 digits (SC002180, NI000001, OC123456, OE000001), or the registered-society suffix forms (two letters + 5 digits + 1 letter; two letters + 4 digits + 2 letters). Case-insensitive; surrounding whitespace is ignored (which is why maxLength is 10); internal spaces and punctuation are not accepted. Any other value (for example PROBE) is rejected as INVALID_INPUT before payment and before any upstream call.","minLength":1,"maxLength":10,"pattern":"^\\s*(?:[0-9]{1,8}|[A-Za-z][0-9]{7}|[A-Za-z]{2}[0-9]{6}|[A-Za-z]{2}[0-9]{5}[A-Za-z]|[A-Za-z]{2}[0-9]{4}[A-Za-z]{2})\\s*$"},"description":"Companies House company number. Accepted shapes are the register's own — 1-8 digits (zero-padded to 8, e.g. 445790 → 00445790), one letter + 7 digits (R0000001), two letters + 6 digits (SC002180, NI000001, OC123456, OE000001), or the registered-society suffix forms (two letters + 5 digits + 1 letter; two letters + 4 digits + 2 letters). Case-insensitive; surrounding whitespace is ignored (which is why maxLength is 10); internal spaces and punctuation are not accepted. Any other value (for example PROBE) is rejected as INVALID_INPUT before payment and before any upstream call."},{"name":"include_ceased","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"boolean","description":"Include PSCs whose control has ceased. Default false."},"description":"Include PSCs whose control has ceased. Default false."},{"name":"limit","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"integer","description":"Maximum PSCs to return per page (1-100). Default 10. Eckari reads up to three register pages of 100 entries to fill this after the ceased filter is applied; if the limit is still unmet, page.has_more is true and page.next_offset says where to resume.","minimum":1,"maximum":100},"description":"Maximum PSCs to return per page (1-100). Default 10. Eckari reads up to three register pages of 100 entries to fill this after the ceased filter is applied; if the limit is still unmet, page.has_more is true and page.next_offset says where to resume."},{"name":"offset","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"integer","description":"Zero-based index into the register's own PSC list (not into the filtered result). Pass back page.next_offset from the previous response to page.","minimum":0,"maximum":10000},"description":"Zero-based index into the register's own PSC list (not into the filtered result). Pass back page.next_offset from the previous response to page."}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful capability result","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","required":["data","meta"],"properties":{"data":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/company_uk_owners_output"},"meta":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ResponseMeta"}}},"examples":{"exempt_listed_company_full_live_response":{"summary":"exempt_listed_company_full_live_response","value":{"data":{"company_number":"00445790","query":{"include_ceased":false},"active_count":0,"ceased_count":0,"items":[],"page":{"limit":10,"offset":0,"returned":0,"total":0,"has_more":false,"next_offset":null},"statements":[],"active_statement_count":0,"exemptions":[{"exemption_type":"disclosure-transparency-rules-chapter-five-applies","description":"This is a traded, DTR5 issuing company. Therefore it may be exempt from updating its PSC information.","exempt_from":"2017-06-07","exempt_to":"2023-02-02","is_current":false},{"exemption_type":"psc-exempt-as-trading-on-uk-regulated-market","description":"The company has been or is exempt from the requirement to obtain information of its PSC, as it has voting shares admitted to trading on a UK regulated market.","exempt_from":"2018-06-18","exempt_to":null,"is_current":true}],"ownership_status":"exempt_listed_company"},"meta":{"capability":"company.uk.owners","version":"3.0.0","source":"companies_house","freshness":"live"}}},"individual_psc":{"summary":"individual_psc","value":{"data":{"company_number":"01234567","query":{"include_ceased":false},"active_count":1,"ceased_count":0,"items":[{"name":"Ms Jane Doe","kind":"individual-person-with-significant-control","is_active":true,"notified_on":"2016-04-06","ceased_on":null,"natures_of_control":[{"code":"ownership-of-shares-75-to-100-percent","description":"The person holds, directly or indirectly, more than 75% of the shares in the company."},{"code":"voting-rights-75-to-100-percent","description":"The person holds, directly or indirectly, more than 75% of the voting rights in the company."}],"nationality":"British","country_of_residence":"England","date_of_birth":{"month":6,"year":1975},"address":{"care_of":null,"premises":"1","address_line_1":"Example Street","address_line_2":null,"po_box":null,"locality":"London","region":null,"postal_code":"EC1A 1AA","country":"England"},"identification":null,"is_sanctioned":null}],"page":{"limit":10,"offset":0,"returned":1,"total":1,"has_more":false,"next_offset":null},"statements":[],"active_statement_count":0,"exemptions":[],"ownership_status":"pscs_listed"},"meta":{"capability":"company.uk.owners","version":"3.0.0","source":"companies_house","freshness":"live"}}}}}}},"400":{"description":"Invalid input (INVALID_INPUT)","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"401":{"description":"Authentication failed (AUTHENTICATION_REQUIRED, INVALID_API_KEY)","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"402":{"description":"Payment required (PAYMENT_REQUIRED, PAYMENT_FAILED, BUDGET_EXCEEDED, BILLING_REQUIRED). x402 challenge headers are attached.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"403":{"description":"Forbidden (PROJECT_DISABLED, CAPABILITY_NOT_ALLOWED)","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"404":{"description":"Not found (NOT_FOUND)","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"422":{"description":"Unprocessable (UNSUPPORTED_REGION, AMBIGUOUS_IDENTIFIER)","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"429":{"description":"Upstream rate limited (UPSTREAM_RATE_LIMITED)","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"500":{"description":"Internal error (INTERNAL_ERROR)","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"503":{"description":"Unavailable (UPSTREAM_UNAVAILABLE, CAPABILITY_UNAVAILABLE, LICENCE_RESTRICTED)","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}}},"security":[{"eckariApiKey":[]},{"x402":[]}],"x-payment-info":{"price":{"mode":"fixed","currency":"USD","amount":"0.008"},"protocols":[{"x402":{}}]},"x-eckari-capability":{"id":"company.uk.owners","version":"3.0.0","lifecycle":"beta","pricing":{"currency":"USD","account":{"enabled":true,"unit_price":"0.006"},"x402":{"enabled":true,"unit_price":"0.008"}},"discovery":{"title":"List UK company beneficial owners (PSC) from Companies House","description":"An empty items list is never the same as \"no owner\": ownership_status and the filed PSC statements/exemptions explain why the register discloses none. Returns the persons with significant control (PSCs) for a UK company — the individuals, entities or legal persons that own or control it — each nature of control carrying the register code and its official text, with dates and public identification. The UK statutory beneficial-ownership (UBO) record.","use_when":["Who owns this UK company?","You need beneficial ownership / UBO / controlling parties for KYB, AML, onboarding or supplier due diligence.","Who controls company 00445790?","Which shareholders own more than 25% of this company?","You need to know whether a specific person or entity controls the company.","You need ownership bands or voting-rights control information.","You need to know why a company discloses no PSC — exempt listed company, no registrable person, PSC not identified or super-secure."],"do_not_use_when":["You need directors/officers rather than owners — use company.uk.directors.","You only need whether the company is active — use company.uk.status.","You would read items[].is_active as a statement about the company — it means the register records no cessation date for that PSC entry, and a dissolved company can still list one; check company.uk.status for the company itself.","You need sanctions screening — is_sanctioned is a register declaration filed for overseas-entity beneficial owners only, never an Eckari screening result.","You need the full shareholder register (all shareholders, any percentage) — not published by the register.","You expect every company to have a PSC — some lawfully have none (a statement is filed, or the company is an exempt listed company) and an empty items list with a non-empty ownership_status is a valid result.","If the user has asked you to inspect a specific website, page or URL, use your browsing tool instead — this capability only returns the Companies House Public Data API record."],"synonyms":["uk company owners","persons with significant control","psc lookup companies house","beneficial owner uk company","ubo lookup uk","psc register companies house","who owns this uk company","ultimate beneficial owner united kingdom","kyb ownership structure uk","uk company controlling parties","beneficial ownership registry uk","register of overseas entities beneficial owners","uk psc significant influence","uk shareholders over 25 percent"],"category":"company_information","region":"GB","tags":["uk","companies-house","company","kyb","psc"],"related_capabilities":["company.uk.directors","company.uk.profile","company.uk.status"]},"cache_policy":{"mode":"none"},"provenance":{"sources":["companies_house"],"freshness":"live"}}}},"/v1/companies/uk/{company_number}":{"get":{"operationId":"company_uk_profile","summary":"Get UK company profile from Companies House","description":"Return the core registered profile of a UK company from the Companies House register: name, status with derived is_active and is_striking_off, type, jurisdiction, incorporation and cessation dates, SIC codes with their official UK SIC 2007 descriptions, registered office address, previous names, and the accounts and confirmation-statement summary. One call for the standard KYB company record.\n\n**Use when:**\n- You have a UK company number and need the standard registered record.\n- Give me the registered details of UK company 00445790.\n- When was this UK company incorporated and what type of company is it?\n- What are the SIC codes and registered office of this company?\n- Show the previous names of this limited company.\n- You are building a KYB or due-diligence summary and want one call for the profile.\n\n**Do not use when:**\n- You only need to know if the company is active — use company.uk.status (cheaper).\n- You need officers, owners, filings or charges — use company.uk.directors, company.uk.owners, company.uk.filings or company.uk.charges.\n- You only have a name — use company.uk.search first.\n- If the user has asked you to inspect a specific website, page or URL, use your browsing tool instead — this capability only returns the Companies House Public Data API record.","tags":["company_information"],"parameters":[{"name":"company_number","in":"path","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string","description":"Companies House company number, also called the company registration number (CRN). Accepted shapes are the register's own — 1-8 digits (zero-padded to 8, e.g. 445790 → 00445790), one letter + 7 digits (R0000001), two letters + 6 digits (SC002180, NI000001, OC123456, OE000001), or the registered-society suffix forms (two letters + 5 digits + 1 letter; two letters + 4 digits + 2 letters). Case-insensitive; surrounding whitespace is ignored (which is why maxLength is 10); internal spaces and punctuation are not accepted. Any other value (for example PROBE) is rejected as INVALID_INPUT before payment and before any upstream call.","minLength":1,"maxLength":10,"pattern":"^\\s*(?:[0-9]{1,8}|[A-Za-z][0-9]{7}|[A-Za-z]{2}[0-9]{6}|[A-Za-z]{2}[0-9]{5}[A-Za-z]|[A-Za-z]{2}[0-9]{4}[A-Za-z]{2})\\s*$"},"description":"Companies House company number, also called the company registration number (CRN). Accepted shapes are the register's own — 1-8 digits (zero-padded to 8, e.g. 445790 → 00445790), one letter + 7 digits (R0000001), two letters + 6 digits (SC002180, NI000001, OC123456, OE000001), or the registered-society suffix forms (two letters + 5 digits + 1 letter; two letters + 4 digits + 2 letters). Case-insensitive; surrounding whitespace is ignored (which is why maxLength is 10); internal spaces and punctuation are not accepted. Any other value (for example PROBE) is rejected as INVALID_INPUT before payment and before any upstream call."}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful capability result","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","required":["data","meta"],"properties":{"data":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/company_uk_profile_output"},"meta":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ResponseMeta"}}},"examples":{"public_limited_company":{"summary":"public_limited_company","value":{"data":{"company_number":"00445790","company_name":"TESCO PLC","status":"active","status_detail":null,"is_active":true,"is_striking_off":false,"type":"plc","subtype":null,"jurisdiction":"england-wales","date_of_creation":"1947-11-27","date_of_cessation":null,"can_file":true,"undeliverable_registered_office_address":false,"registered_office_is_in_dispute":false,"sic_codes":[{"code":"47110","description":"Retail sale in non-specialised stores with food, beverages or tobacco predominating"}],"registered_office_address":{"care_of":null,"premises":null,"address_line_1":"Tesco House, Shire Park","address_line_2":"Kestrel Way","po_box":null,"locality":"Welwyn Garden City","region":null,"postal_code":"AL7 1GA","country":"United Kingdom"},"registered_office_single_line":"Tesco House, Shire Park, Kestrel Way, Welwyn Garden City, AL7 1GA, United Kingdom","previous_company_names":[{"name":"TESCO STORES (HOLDINGS) PUBLIC LIMITED COMPANY","effective_from":"1981-12-14","ceased_on":"1983-08-25"},{"name":"TESCO STORES (HOLDINGS) LIMITED","effective_from":"1947-11-27","ceased_on":"1981-12-14"}],"confirmation_statement":{"last_made_up_to":"2026-06-18","next_due":"2027-07-02","next_made_up_to":"2027-06-18","is_overdue":false},"accounts":{"accounting_reference_date":{"day":26,"month":2},"last_accounts":{"type":"group","period_start_on":"2025-02-27","period_end_on":"2026-02-28","made_up_to":"2026-02-28"},"next_accounts":{"period_start_on":"2026-03-01","period_end_on":"2027-02-26","due_on":"2027-08-26","is_overdue":false}},"resources":{"officers":true,"persons_with_significant_control":true,"persons_with_significant_control_statements":false,"persons_with_significant_control_exemptions":true,"filing_history":true,"charges":true,"insolvency":false}},"meta":{"capability":"company.uk.profile","version":"3.0.0","source":"companies_house","freshness":"live"}}}}}}},"400":{"description":"Invalid input (INVALID_INPUT)","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"401":{"description":"Authentication failed (AUTHENTICATION_REQUIRED, INVALID_API_KEY)","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"402":{"description":"Payment required (PAYMENT_REQUIRED, PAYMENT_FAILED, BUDGET_EXCEEDED, BILLING_REQUIRED). x402 challenge headers are attached.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"403":{"description":"Forbidden (PROJECT_DISABLED, CAPABILITY_NOT_ALLOWED)","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"404":{"description":"Not found (NOT_FOUND)","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"422":{"description":"Unprocessable (UNSUPPORTED_REGION, AMBIGUOUS_IDENTIFIER)","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"429":{"description":"Upstream rate limited (UPSTREAM_RATE_LIMITED)","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"500":{"description":"Internal error (INTERNAL_ERROR)","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"503":{"description":"Unavailable (UPSTREAM_UNAVAILABLE, CAPABILITY_UNAVAILABLE, LICENCE_RESTRICTED)","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}}},"security":[{"eckariApiKey":[]},{"x402":[]}],"x-payment-info":{"price":{"mode":"fixed","currency":"USD","amount":"0.004"},"protocols":[{"x402":{}}]},"x-eckari-capability":{"id":"company.uk.profile","version":"3.0.0","lifecycle":"beta","pricing":{"currency":"USD","account":{"enabled":true,"unit_price":"0.003"},"x402":{"enabled":true,"unit_price":"0.004"}},"discovery":{"title":"Get UK company profile from Companies House","description":"Return the core registered profile of a UK company from the Companies House register: name, status with derived is_active and is_striking_off, type, jurisdiction, incorporation and cessation dates, SIC codes with their official UK SIC 2007 descriptions, registered office address, previous names, and the accounts and confirmation-statement summary. One call for the standard KYB company record.","use_when":["You have a UK company number and need the standard registered record.","Give me the registered details of UK company 00445790.","When was this UK company incorporated and what type of company is it?","What are the SIC codes and registered office of this company?","Show the previous names of this limited company.","You are building a KYB or due-diligence summary and want one call for the profile."],"do_not_use_when":["You only need to know if the company is active — use company.uk.status (cheaper).","You need officers, owners, filings or charges — use company.uk.directors, company.uk.owners, company.uk.filings or company.uk.charges.","You only have a name — use company.uk.search first.","If the user has asked you to inspect a specific website, page or URL, use your browsing tool instead — this capability only returns the Companies House Public Data API record."],"synonyms":["uk company lookup","companies house company profile","company details by company number","companies house api","uk company information","company registration details uk","corporate profile united kingdom","kyb company data uk","uk business entity details","company incorporation date lookup","company details","company record","company overview","sic codes lookup","entity profile","business profile uk"],"category":"company_information","region":"GB","tags":["uk","companies-house","company","kyb","profile"],"related_capabilities":["company.uk.status","company.uk.directors","company.uk.owners","company.uk.filings","company.uk.registered_office"]},"cache_policy":{"mode":"none"},"provenance":{"sources":["companies_house"],"freshness":"live"}}}},"/v1/companies/uk/{company_number}/registered-office":{"get":{"operationId":"company_uk_registered_office","summary":"Get UK registered office address from Companies House","description":"Return the current registered office address of a UK company from the Companies House register as structured fields (premises, address lines, locality, region, postcode, country) plus a single-line rendering for correspondence, address matching and verification. This is the statutory registered address, not a trading or branch address.\n\n**Use when:**\n- What is the registered office address of company 00445790?\n- Where is this UK company registered?\n- Give me the postcode of this limited company's registered office.\n- You need to verify or match a UK company's official address for onboarding or correspondence.\n- You need the registered address only and do not want to pay for the full profile.\n\n**Do not use when:**\n- You need the whole registered profile as well — use company.uk.profile (it already includes this address).\n- You need officer correspondence addresses — use company.uk.directors.\n- You need trading, branch or head-office addresses — not held on the register.\n- You only have a company name, not a number — use company.uk.search first.\n- If the user has asked you to inspect a specific website, page or URL, use your browsing tool instead — this capability only returns the Companies House Public Data API record.","tags":["company_information"],"parameters":[{"name":"company_number","in":"path","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string","description":"Companies House company number, also called the company registration number (CRN). Accepted shapes are the register's own — 1-8 digits (zero-padded to 8, e.g. 445790 → 00445790), one letter + 7 digits (R0000001), two letters + 6 digits (SC002180, NI000001, OC123456, OE000001), or the registered-society suffix forms (two letters + 5 digits + 1 letter; two letters + 4 digits + 2 letters). Case-insensitive; surrounding whitespace is ignored (which is why maxLength is 10); internal spaces and punctuation are not accepted. Any other value (for example PROBE) is rejected as INVALID_INPUT before payment and before any upstream call.","minLength":1,"maxLength":10,"pattern":"^\\s*(?:[0-9]{1,8}|[A-Za-z][0-9]{7}|[A-Za-z]{2}[0-9]{6}|[A-Za-z]{2}[0-9]{5}[A-Za-z]|[A-Za-z]{2}[0-9]{4}[A-Za-z]{2})\\s*$"},"description":"Companies House company number, also called the company registration number (CRN). Accepted shapes are the register's own — 1-8 digits (zero-padded to 8, e.g. 445790 → 00445790), one letter + 7 digits (R0000001), two letters + 6 digits (SC002180, NI000001, OC123456, OE000001), or the registered-society suffix forms (two letters + 5 digits + 1 letter; two letters + 4 digits + 2 letters). Case-insensitive; surrounding whitespace is ignored (which is why maxLength is 10); internal spaces and punctuation are not accepted. Any other value (for example PROBE) is rejected as INVALID_INPUT before payment and before any upstream call."}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful capability result","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","required":["data","meta"],"properties":{"data":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/company_uk_registered_office_output"},"meta":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ResponseMeta"}}},"examples":{"registered_office":{"summary":"registered_office","value":{"data":{"company_number":"00445790","company_name":"TESCO PLC","address":{"care_of":null,"po_box":null,"premises":null,"address_line_1":"Tesco House, Shire Park","address_line_2":"Kestrel Way","locality":"Welwyn Garden City","region":null,"postal_code":"AL7 1GA","country":"United Kingdom"},"single_line":"Tesco House, Shire Park, Kestrel Way, Welwyn Garden City, AL7 1GA, United Kingdom"},"meta":{"capability":"company.uk.registered_office","version":"2.0.0","source":"companies_house","freshness":"live"}}}}}}},"400":{"description":"Invalid input (INVALID_INPUT)","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"401":{"description":"Authentication failed (AUTHENTICATION_REQUIRED, INVALID_API_KEY)","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"402":{"description":"Payment required (PAYMENT_REQUIRED, PAYMENT_FAILED, BUDGET_EXCEEDED, BILLING_REQUIRED). x402 challenge headers are attached.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"403":{"description":"Forbidden (PROJECT_DISABLED, CAPABILITY_NOT_ALLOWED)","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"404":{"description":"Not found (NOT_FOUND)","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"422":{"description":"Unprocessable (UNSUPPORTED_REGION, AMBIGUOUS_IDENTIFIER)","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"429":{"description":"Upstream rate limited (UPSTREAM_RATE_LIMITED)","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"500":{"description":"Internal error (INTERNAL_ERROR)","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"503":{"description":"Unavailable (UPSTREAM_UNAVAILABLE, CAPABILITY_UNAVAILABLE, LICENCE_RESTRICTED)","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}}},"security":[{"eckariApiKey":[]},{"x402":[]}],"x-payment-info":{"price":{"mode":"fixed","currency":"USD","amount":"0.003"},"protocols":[{"x402":{}}]},"x-eckari-capability":{"id":"company.uk.registered_office","version":"2.0.0","lifecycle":"beta","pricing":{"currency":"USD","account":{"enabled":true,"unit_price":"0.002"},"x402":{"enabled":true,"unit_price":"0.003"}},"discovery":{"title":"Get UK registered office address from Companies House","description":"Return the current registered office address of a UK company from the Companies House register as structured fields (premises, address lines, locality, region, postcode, country) plus a single-line rendering for correspondence, address matching and verification. This is the statutory registered address, not a trading or branch address.","use_when":["What is the registered office address of company 00445790?","Where is this UK company registered?","Give me the postcode of this limited company's registered office.","You need to verify or match a UK company's official address for onboarding or correspondence.","You need the registered address only and do not want to pay for the full profile."],"do_not_use_when":["You need the whole registered profile as well — use company.uk.profile (it already includes this address).","You need officer correspondence addresses — use company.uk.directors.","You need trading, branch or head-office addresses — not held on the register.","You only have a company name, not a number — use company.uk.search first.","If the user has asked you to inspect a specific website, page or URL, use your browsing tool instead — this capability only returns the Companies House Public Data API record."],"synonyms":["registered office address","company address uk","companies house address lookup","registered address postcode","where is this company registered","registered address by company number","uk business address lookup","official company address","company address verification","corporate registered address united kingdom","kyb address check","company postcode lookup","registered office by crn","entity address uk"],"category":"company_information","region":"GB","tags":["uk","companies-house","company","kyb","address"],"related_capabilities":["company.uk.profile","company.uk.status","company.uk.search"]},"cache_policy":{"mode":"none"},"provenance":{"sources":["companies_house"],"freshness":"live"}}}},"/v1/companies/uk/search":{"get":{"operationId":"company_uk_search","summary":"Search Companies House for UK companies by name","description":"Search the UK Companies House register by name or keyword and return matching companies with company number, register status and a derived is_active, type, incorporation and cessation dates and the register's one-line address snippet. Use this first when you only have a name, then call the per-company capabilities with the returned company_number. Ordering is the register's own, echoed as match_rank — a position, not a relevance score.\n\n**Use when:**\n- Look up a UK company by name.\n- You have a company name or keyword but not the company number.\n- Find the Companies House number for \"Acme Trading Ltd\".\n- Which UK companies are called Acme Widgets?\n- You need to disambiguate several similarly named UK companies before requesting details.\n- You need to confirm that a UK company exists at all.\n- Resolve a business name to a company registration number (CRN).\n\n**Do not use when:**\n- You already have the company number — call company.uk.profile or company.uk.status directly.\n- You need directors, owners, filings or charges for a known company — call company.uk.directors, company.uk.owners, company.uk.filings or company.uk.charges.\n- You need the full registered office address of a result — call company.uk.profile or company.uk.registered_office with the returned company_number; each item carries only the register's one-line address_snippet.\n- You are searching for a person or officer rather than a company (not supported).\n- You want to take items[0] as \"the\" company without checking it — ordering is the register's own search ranking and Eckari adds no relevance score, so a loosely related company can outrank the one you meant. Compare company_name (and address_snippet or status) before using the number.\n- If the user has asked you to inspect a specific website, page or URL, use your browsing tool instead — this capability only returns the Companies House Public Data API record.","tags":["company_information"],"parameters":[{"name":"q","in":"query","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string","description":"Company name or keyword to search for.","minLength":2,"maxLength":200},"description":"Company name or keyword to search for."},{"name":"limit","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"integer","description":"Maximum results to return (1-50). Default 10.","minimum":1,"maximum":50},"description":"Maximum results to return (1-50). Default 10."},{"name":"offset","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"integer","description":"Zero-based offset into the register's result set for paging. Pass back page.next_offset from the previous response; page.has_more says whether there is one.","minimum":0,"maximum":10000},"description":"Zero-based offset into the register's result set for paging. Pass back page.next_offset from the previous response; page.has_more says whether there is one."}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful capability result","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","required":["data","meta"],"properties":{"data":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/company_uk_search_output"},"meta":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ResponseMeta"}}},"examples":{"search_by_name_full_live_response":{"summary":"search_by_name_full_live_response","value":{"data":{"query":{"q":"Tesco plc"},"items":[{"match_rank":1,"company_number":"00445790","company_name":"TESCO PLC","status":"active","is_active":true,"type":"plc","date_of_creation":"1947-11-27","date_of_cessation":null,"address_snippet":"Tesco House, Shire Park, Kestrel Way, Welwyn Garden City, United Kingdom, AL7 1GA"},{"match_rank":2,"company_number":"09384423","company_name":"KFORD TYRES (GORNAL) LTD","status":"active","is_active":true,"type":"ltd","date_of_creation":"2015-01-12","date_of_cessation":null,"address_snippet":"2 Dawley Brook Road, Kingswinford, England, DY6 7BD"},{"match_rank":3,"company_number":"05888957","company_name":"TESCO AQUA (FINCO2) LIMITED","status":"dissolved","is_active":false,"type":"ltd","date_of_creation":"2006-07-27","date_of_cessation":"2025-11-12","address_snippet":"1 More London Place, London, SE1 2AF"},{"match_rank":4,"company_number":"BR008975","company_name":"TESCO AQUA (1LP) LIMITED","status":"closed","is_active":false,"type":"uk-establishment","date_of_creation":"2006-08-09","date_of_cessation":null,"address_snippet":"New Tesco House, Cheshunt, Delamare Road, EN8 9SL"},{"match_rank":5,"company_number":"06969533","company_name":"TESCO ATRATO DEPOT PROPCO LIMITED","status":"active","is_active":true,"type":"ltd","date_of_creation":"2009-07-22","date_of_cessation":null,"address_snippet":"Tesco House, Shire Park, Kestrel Way, Welwyn Garden City, United Kingdom, AL7 1GA"}],"page":{"limit":5,"offset":0,"returned":5,"total":356,"has_more":true,"next_offset":5}},"meta":{"capability":"company.uk.search","version":"2.0.0","source":"companies_house","freshness":"live"}}}}}}},"400":{"description":"Invalid input (INVALID_INPUT)","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"401":{"description":"Authentication failed (AUTHENTICATION_REQUIRED, INVALID_API_KEY)","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"402":{"description":"Payment required (PAYMENT_REQUIRED, PAYMENT_FAILED, BUDGET_EXCEEDED, BILLING_REQUIRED). x402 challenge headers are attached.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"403":{"description":"Forbidden (PROJECT_DISABLED, CAPABILITY_NOT_ALLOWED)","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"404":{"description":"Not found (NOT_FOUND)","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"422":{"description":"Unprocessable (UNSUPPORTED_REGION, AMBIGUOUS_IDENTIFIER)","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"429":{"description":"Upstream rate limited (UPSTREAM_RATE_LIMITED)","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"500":{"description":"Internal error (INTERNAL_ERROR)","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"503":{"description":"Unavailable (UPSTREAM_UNAVAILABLE, CAPABILITY_UNAVAILABLE, LICENCE_RESTRICTED)","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}}},"security":[{"eckariApiKey":[]},{"x402":[]}],"x-payment-info":{"price":{"mode":"fixed","currency":"USD","amount":"0.002"},"protocols":[{"x402":{}}]},"x-eckari-capability":{"id":"company.uk.search","version":"2.0.0","lifecycle":"beta","pricing":{"currency":"USD","account":{"enabled":true,"unit_price":"0.0015"},"x402":{"enabled":true,"unit_price":"0.002"}},"discovery":{"title":"Search Companies House for UK companies by name","description":"Search the UK Companies House register by name or keyword and return matching companies with company number, register status and a derived is_active, type, incorporation and cessation dates and the register's one-line address snippet. Use this first when you only have a name, then call the per-company capabilities with the returned company_number. Ordering is the register's own, echoed as match_rank — a position, not a relevance score.","use_when":["Look up a UK company by name.","You have a company name or keyword but not the company number.","Find the Companies House number for \"Acme Trading Ltd\".","Which UK companies are called Acme Widgets?","You need to disambiguate several similarly named UK companies before requesting details.","You need to confirm that a UK company exists at all.","Resolve a business name to a company registration number (CRN)."],"do_not_use_when":["You already have the company number — call company.uk.profile or company.uk.status directly.","You need directors, owners, filings or charges for a known company — call company.uk.directors, company.uk.owners, company.uk.filings or company.uk.charges.","You need the full registered office address of a result — call company.uk.profile or company.uk.registered_office with the returned company_number; each item carries only the register's one-line address_snippet.","You are searching for a person or officer rather than a company (not supported).","You want to take items[0] as \"the\" company without checking it — ordering is the register's own search ranking and Eckari adds no relevance score, so a loosely related company can outrank the one you meant. Compare company_name (and address_snippet or status) before using the number.","If the user has asked you to inspect a specific website, page or URL, use your browsing tool instead — this capability only returns the Companies House Public Data API record."],"synonyms":["uk company search","companies house search","find company number by name","company name lookup uk","uk business registry search","resolve company name to registration number","business registry search united kingdom","uk entity search","uk corporate registry search","crn lookup","company registration number lookup","uk business registration lookup","companies house lookup","kyb company search uk","find a uk limited company by name"],"category":"company_information","region":"GB","tags":["uk","companies-house","company","kyb","search"],"related_capabilities":["company.uk.status","company.uk.profile","company.uk.directors","company.uk.owners"]},"cache_policy":{"mode":"none"},"provenance":{"sources":["companies_house"],"freshness":"live"}}}},"/v1/companies/uk/{company_number}/status":{"get":{"operationId":"company_uk_status","summary":"Check UK company status on Companies House","description":"Return the current legal status of a UK company from the Companies House register — active, dissolved, liquidation, administration, receivership, voluntary-arrangement and others — with status detail, cessation date, a derived is_active (true for the live-on-the-register statuses active, open and registered) and a derived is_striking_off for an active company with a proposal to strike off. One call, one authoritative register answer.\n\n**Use when:**\n- Is this UK company still active?\n- You need a yes/no on whether a UK entity is live on the register before doing business, paying an invoice or continuing a workflow.\n- Has company 00445790 been dissolved or struck off?\n- Is this limited company in liquidation or administration?\n- Is there a proposal to strike this company off the register?\n- You are monitoring a list of UK companies for status changes.\n- Does this UK company still legally exist?\n\n**Do not use when:**\n- You need the full registered profile (type, SIC codes, incorporation date) — use company.uk.profile.\n- You need directors or officers — use company.uk.directors.\n- You need owners / persons with significant control — use company.uk.owners.\n- You only have a company name — use company.uk.search first.\n- The identifier is a UK establishment (BR…) or a registered overseas entity (OE…) and you need more than liveness — those entities use the register's own status vocabulary (open, closed, registered, removed) rather than active/dissolved, so read status directly rather than relying on is_active alone.\n- If the user has asked you to inspect a specific website, page or URL, use your browsing tool instead — this capability only returns the Companies House Public Data API record.","tags":["company_information"],"parameters":[{"name":"company_number","in":"path","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string","description":"Companies House company number, also called the company registration number (CRN), e.g. 00445790, SC123456, NI000001, BR008975. Accepted shapes are the register's own — 1-8 digits (zero-padded to 8, e.g. 445790 → 00445790), one letter + 7 digits (R0000001), two letters + 6 digits (SC002180, NI000001, OC123456, OE000001), or the registered-society suffix forms (two letters + 5 digits + 1 letter; two letters + 4 digits + 2 letters). Case-insensitive; surrounding whitespace is ignored (which is why maxLength is 10); internal spaces and punctuation are not accepted. Any other value (for example PROBE) is rejected as INVALID_INPUT before payment and before any upstream call.","minLength":1,"maxLength":10,"pattern":"^\\s*(?:[0-9]{1,8}|[A-Za-z][0-9]{7}|[A-Za-z]{2}[0-9]{6}|[A-Za-z]{2}[0-9]{5}[A-Za-z]|[A-Za-z]{2}[0-9]{4}[A-Za-z]{2})\\s*$"},"description":"Companies House company number, also called the company registration number (CRN), e.g. 00445790, SC123456, NI000001, BR008975. Accepted shapes are the register's own — 1-8 digits (zero-padded to 8, e.g. 445790 → 00445790), one letter + 7 digits (R0000001), two letters + 6 digits (SC002180, NI000001, OC123456, OE000001), or the registered-society suffix forms (two letters + 5 digits + 1 letter; two letters + 4 digits + 2 letters). Case-insensitive; surrounding whitespace is ignored (which is why maxLength is 10); internal spaces and punctuation are not accepted. Any other value (for example PROBE) is rejected as INVALID_INPUT before payment and before any upstream call."}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful capability result","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","required":["data","meta"],"properties":{"data":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/company_uk_status_output"},"meta":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ResponseMeta"}}},"examples":{"active_company":{"summary":"active_company","value":{"data":{"company_number":"00445790","company_name":"TESCO PLC","status":"active","status_detail":null,"is_active":true,"is_striking_off":false,"date_of_cessation":null},"meta":{"capability":"company.uk.status","version":"3.0.0","source":"companies_house","freshness":"live"}}}}}}},"400":{"description":"Invalid input (INVALID_INPUT)","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"401":{"description":"Authentication failed (AUTHENTICATION_REQUIRED, INVALID_API_KEY)","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"402":{"description":"Payment required (PAYMENT_REQUIRED, PAYMENT_FAILED, BUDGET_EXCEEDED, BILLING_REQUIRED). x402 challenge headers are attached.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"403":{"description":"Forbidden (PROJECT_DISABLED, CAPABILITY_NOT_ALLOWED)","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"404":{"description":"Not found (NOT_FOUND)","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"422":{"description":"Unprocessable (UNSUPPORTED_REGION, AMBIGUOUS_IDENTIFIER)","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"429":{"description":"Upstream rate limited (UPSTREAM_RATE_LIMITED)","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"500":{"description":"Internal error (INTERNAL_ERROR)","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"503":{"description":"Unavailable (UPSTREAM_UNAVAILABLE, CAPABILITY_UNAVAILABLE, LICENCE_RESTRICTED)","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}}},"security":[{"eckariApiKey":[]},{"x402":[]}],"x-payment-info":{"price":{"mode":"fixed","currency":"USD","amount":"0.003"},"protocols":[{"x402":{}}]},"x-eckari-capability":{"id":"company.uk.status","version":"3.0.0","lifecycle":"beta","pricing":{"currency":"USD","account":{"enabled":true,"unit_price":"0.002"},"x402":{"enabled":true,"unit_price":"0.003"}},"discovery":{"title":"Check UK company status on Companies House","description":"Return the current legal status of a UK company from the Companies House register — active, dissolved, liquidation, administration, receivership, voluntary-arrangement and others — with status detail, cessation date, a derived is_active (true for the live-on-the-register statuses active, open and registered) and a derived is_striking_off for an active company with a proposal to strike off. One call, one authoritative register answer.","use_when":["Is this UK company still active?","You need a yes/no on whether a UK entity is live on the register before doing business, paying an invoice or continuing a workflow.","Has company 00445790 been dissolved or struck off?","Is this limited company in liquidation or administration?","Is there a proposal to strike this company off the register?","You are monitoring a list of UK companies for status changes.","Does this UK company still legally exist?"],"do_not_use_when":["You need the full registered profile (type, SIC codes, incorporation date) — use company.uk.profile.","You need directors or officers — use company.uk.directors.","You need owners / persons with significant control — use company.uk.owners.","You only have a company name — use company.uk.search first.","The identifier is a UK establishment (BR…) or a registered overseas entity (OE…) and you need more than liveness — those entities use the register's own status vocabulary (open, closed, registered, removed) rather than active/dissolved, so read status directly rather than relying on is_active alone.","If the user has asked you to inspect a specific website, page or URL, use your browsing tool instead — this capability only returns the Companies House Public Data API record."],"synonyms":["uk company status","companies house status check","check if uk company is active","dissolved company check","verify uk company","company legal status uk","kyb status check","uk company good standing check","validate uk company registration number","companies house proposal to strike off","uk company liquidation status","uk company administration status","uk company existence verification","companies house registration validity","is this uk company still registered"],"category":"company_information","region":"GB","tags":["uk","companies-house","company","kyb","status"],"related_capabilities":["company.uk.profile","company.uk.search","company.uk.directors","company.uk.accounts"]},"cache_policy":{"mode":"none"},"provenance":{"sources":["companies_house"],"freshness":"live"}}}},"/v1/companies/us/{id}/filings":{"get":{"operationId":"company_us_filings","summary":"List SEC EDGAR filings for a US company by ticker or CIK","description":"Return the recent EDGAR filing history of a US company identified by stock ticker (AAPL) or CIK, optionally filtered by form type and filing date and paged. It is the company's own EDGAR index, so it also holds filings third parties made about it (SCHEDULE 13G, Forms 3/4/5, UPLOAD). Each entry carries the accession number, form, dates, 8-K items, XBRL flags, size and sec.gov links.\n\n**Use when:**\n- List every 8-K on this ticker's EDGAR index this year, with links to the documents.\n- You have a ticker or CIK and need the SEC filings on that company's EDGAR index.\n- You need the accession numbers and document links for a company's filings.\n- Which 8-K items did this company report?\n- You are monitoring a company for new SEC filings since a given date.\n- You need the ownership and insider filings (Forms 3, 4, 5 and SCHEDULE 13G) that sit on this company's EDGAR index.\n- You need to page through a company's recent EDGAR history.\n\n**Do not use when:**\n- You need to know who submitted a filing — EDGAR's submissions index carries no filer identity, so a Form 4 or SCHEDULE 13G here tells you the filing exists, not who made it.\n- You only need the newest 10-K/10-Q/8-K — use company.us.filings.latest, which is cheaper.\n- You need company details rather than filings — use company.us.profile.\n- You have a company name rather than a ticker or CIK — tickers are matched exactly and names never; use company.us.resolve first.\n- The company is UK registered — use company.uk.filings.\n- If the user has asked you to inspect a specific website, page or URL, use your browsing tool instead — this capability only returns the SEC EDGAR record.","tags":["company_information"],"parameters":[{"name":"id","in":"path","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string","description":"SEC CIK or exchange ticker symbol. All digits is read as a CIK (leading zeros and an EDGAR CIK prefix are both accepted: 320193, 0000320193, CIK0000320193); anything else is read as a ticker (1-10 characters starting with a letter) and matched exactly, case-insensitively, against the SEC listed-security index — AAPL, aapl and BRK-B all work. Company names are not accepted: resolve one with company.us.resolve. A ticker with no SEC index entry returns NOT_FOUND, which is not a billable result.","minLength":1,"maxLength":13,"pattern":"^(?:(?:[Cc][Ii][Kk])?[0-9]{1,10}|[A-Za-z][A-Za-z0-9.-]{0,9})$"},"description":"SEC CIK or exchange ticker symbol. All digits is read as a CIK (leading zeros and an EDGAR CIK prefix are both accepted: 320193, 0000320193, CIK0000320193); anything else is read as a ticker (1-10 characters starting with a letter) and matched exactly, case-insensitively, against the SEC listed-security index — AAPL, aapl and BRK-B all work. Company names are not accepted: resolve one with company.us.resolve. A ticker with no SEC index entry returns NOT_FOUND, which is not a billable result."},{"name":"form","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"string","description":"Comma-separated EDGAR form types to keep, e.g. \"10-K,10-Q,8-K\". Matching is exact and case-insensitive; omit to return every form.","maxLength":200,"pattern":"^[A-Za-z0-9 ,/.-]+$"},"description":"Comma-separated EDGAR form types to keep, e.g. \"10-K,10-Q,8-K\". Matching is exact and case-insensitive; omit to return every form."},{"name":"since","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"string","format":"date","description":"Keep only filings with a filing_date on or after this ISO date (YYYY-MM-DD).","pattern":"^[0-9]{4}-[0-9]{2}-[0-9]{2}$"},"description":"Keep only filings with a filing_date on or after this ISO date (YYYY-MM-DD)."},{"name":"limit","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"integer","description":"Maximum number of filings to return from the filtered set. Defaults to 5 so a first call stays small; raise it explicitly when you need more.","minimum":1,"maximum":100,"default":5},"description":"Maximum number of filings to return from the filtered set. Defaults to 5 so a first call stays small; raise it explicitly when you need more."},{"name":"offset","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"integer","description":"Zero-based offset into the filtered set, for paging. Pass page.next_offset from the previous response.","minimum":0,"default":0},"description":"Zero-based offset into the filtered set, for paging. Pass page.next_offset from the previous response."}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful capability result","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","required":["data","meta"],"properties":{"data":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/company_us_filings_output"},"meta":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ResponseMeta"}}},"examples":{"apple_annual_reports_by_ticker_live_2026-08-18":{"summary":"apple_annual_reports_by_ticker_live_2026-08-18","value":{"data":{"cik":"0000320193","name":"Apple Inc.","query":{"id":"AAPL","matched_by":"ticker","form":"10-K","since":null},"has_more_history":true,"items":[{"accession_number":"0000320193-25-000079","form":"10-K","filing_date":"2025-10-31","report_date":"2025-09-27","act":"34","file_number":"001-36743","item_codes":[],"primary_document":"aapl-20250927.htm","primary_doc_description":"10-K","is_xbrl":true,"is_inline_xbrl":true,"size_bytes":9392337,"document_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/320193/000032019325000079/aapl-20250927.htm","index_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/320193/000032019325000079/0000320193-25-000079-index.htm"},{"accession_number":"0000320193-24-000123","form":"10-K","filing_date":"2024-11-01","report_date":"2024-09-28","act":"34","file_number":"001-36743","item_codes":[],"primary_document":"aapl-20240928.htm","primary_doc_description":"10-K","is_xbrl":true,"is_inline_xbrl":true,"size_bytes":9759333,"document_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/320193/000032019324000123/aapl-20240928.htm","index_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/320193/000032019324000123/0000320193-24-000123-index.htm"}],"page":{"limit":2,"offset":0,"returned":2,"total":11,"has_more":true,"next_offset":2}},"meta":{"capability":"company.us.filings","version":"3.0.0","source":"sec_edgar","freshness":"near_live"}}},"apple_8k_since_by_cik_live_2026-08-18":{"summary":"apple_8k_since_by_cik_live_2026-08-18","value":{"data":{"cik":"0000320193","name":"Apple Inc.","query":{"id":"0000320193","matched_by":"cik","form":"8-K","since":"2026-01-01"},"has_more_history":false,"items":[{"accession_number":"0000320193-26-000018","form":"8-K","filing_date":"2026-07-30","report_date":"2026-07-30","act":"34","file_number":"001-36743","item_codes":["2.02","9.01"],"primary_document":"aapl-20260730.htm","primary_doc_description":"8-K","is_xbrl":true,"is_inline_xbrl":true,"size_bytes":417360,"document_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/320193/000032019326000018/aapl-20260730.htm","index_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/320193/000032019326000018/0000320193-26-000018-index.htm"}],"page":{"limit":1,"offset":0,"returned":1,"total":6,"has_more":true,"next_offset":1}},"meta":{"capability":"company.us.filings","version":"3.0.0","source":"sec_edgar","freshness":"near_live"}}}}}}},"400":{"description":"Invalid input (INVALID_INPUT)","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"401":{"description":"Authentication failed (AUTHENTICATION_REQUIRED, INVALID_API_KEY)","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"402":{"description":"Payment required (PAYMENT_REQUIRED, PAYMENT_FAILED, BUDGET_EXCEEDED, BILLING_REQUIRED). x402 challenge headers are attached.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"403":{"description":"Forbidden (PROJECT_DISABLED, CAPABILITY_NOT_ALLOWED)","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"404":{"description":"Not found (NOT_FOUND)","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"422":{"description":"Unprocessable (UNSUPPORTED_REGION, AMBIGUOUS_IDENTIFIER)","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"429":{"description":"Upstream rate limited (UPSTREAM_RATE_LIMITED)","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"500":{"description":"Internal error (INTERNAL_ERROR)","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"503":{"description":"Unavailable (UPSTREAM_UNAVAILABLE, CAPABILITY_UNAVAILABLE, LICENCE_RESTRICTED)","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}}},"security":[{"eckariApiKey":[]},{"x402":[]}],"x-payment-info":{"price":{"mode":"fixed","currency":"USD","amount":"0.005"},"protocols":[{"x402":{}}]},"x-eckari-capability":{"id":"company.us.filings","version":"3.0.0","lifecycle":"beta","pricing":{"currency":"USD","account":{"enabled":true,"unit_price":"0.004"},"x402":{"enabled":true,"unit_price":"0.005"}},"discovery":{"title":"List SEC EDGAR filings for a US company by ticker or CIK","description":"Return the recent EDGAR filing history of a US company identified by stock ticker (AAPL) or CIK, optionally filtered by form type and filing date and paged. It is the company's own EDGAR index, so it also holds filings third parties made about it (SCHEDULE 13G, Forms 3/4/5, UPLOAD). Each entry carries the accession number, form, dates, 8-K items, XBRL flags, size and sec.gov links.","use_when":["List every 8-K on this ticker's EDGAR index this year, with links to the documents.","You have a ticker or CIK and need the SEC filings on that company's EDGAR index.","You need the accession numbers and document links for a company's filings.","Which 8-K items did this company report?","You are monitoring a company for new SEC filings since a given date.","You need the ownership and insider filings (Forms 3, 4, 5 and SCHEDULE 13G) that sit on this company's EDGAR index.","You need to page through a company's recent EDGAR history."],"do_not_use_when":["You need to know who submitted a filing — EDGAR's submissions index carries no filer identity, so a Form 4 or SCHEDULE 13G here tells you the filing exists, not who made it.","You only need the newest 10-K/10-Q/8-K — use company.us.filings.latest, which is cheaper.","You need company details rather than filings — use company.us.profile.","You have a company name rather than a ticker or CIK — tickers are matched exactly and names never; use company.us.resolve first.","The company is UK registered — use company.uk.filings.","If the user has asked you to inspect a specific website, page or URL, use your browsing tool instead — this capability only returns the SEC EDGAR record."],"synonyms":["sec filings list","sec filings by ticker","edgar filings for a stock symbol","edgar filing history","10-K filings","10-Q filings","8-K filings","accession number lookup","sec filing search by form","company filing history us","annual report filings","quarterly report filings","current report 8-k items","xbrl filing flags","proxy statement filings","sec document links","filings since date"],"category":"company_information","region":"US","tags":["us","sec","edgar","filings","disclosure"],"related_capabilities":["company.us.filings.latest","company.us.profile","company.us.resolve","company.uk.filings"]},"cache_policy":{"mode":"none"},"provenance":{"sources":["sec_edgar"],"freshness":"near_live"}}}},"/v1/companies/us/{id}/filings/latest":{"get":{"operationId":"company_us_filings_latest","summary":"Latest 10-K, 10-Q or 8-K for a US company by ticker or CIK","description":"Give a stock ticker (AAPL) or CIK and get the most recent EDGAR filing of each requested form — by default the latest 10-K, 10-Q and 8-K — with filing and report dates and a direct sec.gov link to each primary document. Request other forms (4, SCHEDULE 13G) and you get the newest one filed about the company. Requested forms with no recent filing are named in forms_not_found, never dropped.\n\n**Use when:**\n- What is Apple's latest 8-K, and where is the document?\n- You have a ticker or CIK and need the newest 10-K, 10-Q or 8-K for that company.\n- Give me a link to the most recent annual report of this US filer.\n- You need the newest annual and quarterly reports for a US company in one call.\n- You are checking whether a US company has filed its latest quarterly report.\n- You need the report period covered by the newest filing of a given form.\n\n**Do not use when:**\n- You need to know who submitted the filing — EDGAR's submissions index carries no filer identity, and for ownership forms (3, 4, 5, SCHEDULE 13G) the submitter is a third party, not the company.\n- You need the full filing history or several filings of one form — use company.us.filings.\n- You need company details rather than filings — use company.us.profile.\n- You have a company name rather than a ticker or CIK — tickers are matched exactly and names never; use company.us.resolve first.\n- The company is UK registered — use company.uk.filings.\n- If the user has asked you to inspect a specific website, page or URL, use your browsing tool instead — this capability only returns the SEC EDGAR record.","tags":["company_information"],"parameters":[{"name":"id","in":"path","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string","description":"SEC CIK or exchange ticker symbol. All digits is read as a CIK (leading zeros and an EDGAR CIK prefix are both accepted: 320193, 0000320193, CIK0000320193); anything else is read as a ticker (1-10 characters starting with a letter) and matched exactly, case-insensitively, against the SEC listed-security index — AAPL, aapl and BRK-B all work. Company names are not accepted: resolve one with company.us.resolve. A ticker with no SEC index entry returns NOT_FOUND, which is not a billable result.","minLength":1,"maxLength":13,"pattern":"^(?:(?:[Cc][Ii][Kk])?[0-9]{1,10}|[A-Za-z][A-Za-z0-9.-]{0,9})$"},"description":"SEC CIK or exchange ticker symbol. All digits is read as a CIK (leading zeros and an EDGAR CIK prefix are both accepted: 320193, 0000320193, CIK0000320193); anything else is read as a ticker (1-10 characters starting with a letter) and matched exactly, case-insensitively, against the SEC listed-security index — AAPL, aapl and BRK-B all work. Company names are not accepted: resolve one with company.us.resolve. A ticker with no SEC index entry returns NOT_FOUND, which is not a billable result."},{"name":"form","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"string","description":"Comma-separated EDGAR form types to report the latest filing of. Defaults to \"10-K,10-Q,8-K\". Matching is exact and case-insensitive; output order follows the requested order.","maxLength":200,"pattern":"^[A-Za-z0-9 ,/.-]+$","default":"10-K,10-Q,8-K"},"description":"Comma-separated EDGAR form types to report the latest filing of. Defaults to \"10-K,10-Q,8-K\". Matching is exact and case-insensitive; output order follows the requested order."}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful capability result","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","required":["data","meta"],"properties":{"data":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/company_us_filings_latest_output"},"meta":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ResponseMeta"}}},"examples":{"apple_latest_reports_by_ticker_live_2026-08-18":{"summary":"apple_latest_reports_by_ticker_live_2026-08-18","value":{"data":{"cik":"0000320193","name":"Apple Inc.","query":{"id":"aapl","matched_by":"ticker"},"forms_requested":["10-K","10-Q","8-K","20-F"],"forms_not_found":["20-F"],"items":[{"form":"10-K","accession_number":"0000320193-25-000079","filing_date":"2025-10-31","report_date":"2025-09-27","primary_document":"aapl-20250927.htm","document_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/320193/000032019325000079/aapl-20250927.htm"},{"form":"10-Q","accession_number":"0000320193-26-000020","filing_date":"2026-07-31","report_date":"2026-06-27","primary_document":"aapl-20260627.htm","document_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/320193/000032019326000020/aapl-20260627.htm"},{"form":"8-K","accession_number":"0000320193-26-000018","filing_date":"2026-07-30","report_date":"2026-07-30","primary_document":"aapl-20260730.htm","document_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/320193/000032019326000018/aapl-20260730.htm"}],"page":{"limit":null,"offset":0,"returned":3,"total":3,"has_more":false,"next_offset":null}},"meta":{"capability":"company.us.filings.latest","version":"3.0.0","source":"sec_edgar","freshness":"near_live"}}}}}}},"400":{"description":"Invalid input (INVALID_INPUT)","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"401":{"description":"Authentication failed (AUTHENTICATION_REQUIRED, INVALID_API_KEY)","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"402":{"description":"Payment required (PAYMENT_REQUIRED, PAYMENT_FAILED, BUDGET_EXCEEDED, BILLING_REQUIRED). x402 challenge headers are attached.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"403":{"description":"Forbidden (PROJECT_DISABLED, CAPABILITY_NOT_ALLOWED)","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"404":{"description":"Not found (NOT_FOUND)","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"422":{"description":"Unprocessable (UNSUPPORTED_REGION, AMBIGUOUS_IDENTIFIER)","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"429":{"description":"Upstream rate limited (UPSTREAM_RATE_LIMITED)","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"500":{"description":"Internal error (INTERNAL_ERROR)","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"503":{"description":"Unavailable (UPSTREAM_UNAVAILABLE, CAPABILITY_UNAVAILABLE, LICENCE_RESTRICTED)","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}}},"security":[{"eckariApiKey":[]},{"x402":[]}],"x-payment-info":{"price":{"mode":"fixed","currency":"USD","amount":"0.003"},"protocols":[{"x402":{}}]},"x-eckari-capability":{"id":"company.us.filings.latest","version":"3.0.0","lifecycle":"beta","pricing":{"currency":"USD","account":{"enabled":true,"unit_price":"0.002"},"x402":{"enabled":true,"unit_price":"0.003"}},"discovery":{"title":"Latest 10-K, 10-Q or 8-K for a US company by ticker or CIK","description":"Give a stock ticker (AAPL) or CIK and get the most recent EDGAR filing of each requested form — by default the latest 10-K, 10-Q and 8-K — with filing and report dates and a direct sec.gov link to each primary document. Request other forms (4, SCHEDULE 13G) and you get the newest one filed about the company. Requested forms with no recent filing are named in forms_not_found, never dropped.","use_when":["What is Apple's latest 8-K, and where is the document?","You have a ticker or CIK and need the newest 10-K, 10-Q or 8-K for that company.","Give me a link to the most recent annual report of this US filer.","You need the newest annual and quarterly reports for a US company in one call.","You are checking whether a US company has filed its latest quarterly report.","You need the report period covered by the newest filing of a given form."],"do_not_use_when":["You need to know who submitted the filing — EDGAR's submissions index carries no filer identity, and for ownership forms (3, 4, 5, SCHEDULE 13G) the submitter is a third party, not the company.","You need the full filing history or several filings of one form — use company.us.filings.","You need company details rather than filings — use company.us.profile.","You have a company name rather than a ticker or CIK — tickers are matched exactly and names never; use company.us.resolve first.","The company is UK registered — use company.uk.filings.","If the user has asked you to inspect a specific website, page or URL, use your browsing tool instead — this capability only returns the SEC EDGAR record."],"synonyms":["latest 10-K","latest 10-Q","latest 8-K","latest sec filing by ticker","most recent sec filing","newest annual report","newest quarterly report","current report lookup","last filing date","annual report link","sec filing shortcut","recent disclosure us company","edgar latest submission","company last filed","quarterly earnings filing"],"category":"company_information","region":"US","tags":["us","sec","edgar","filings","latest"],"related_capabilities":["company.us.filings","company.us.profile","company.us.resolve"]},"cache_policy":{"mode":"none"},"provenance":{"sources":["sec_edgar"],"freshness":"near_live"}}}},"/v1/companies/us/{id}":{"get":{"operationId":"company_us_profile","summary":"US public company profile from SEC EDGAR by ticker or CIK","description":"Look up an SEC filer by stock ticker (AAPL) or CIK and return its registered profile — legal name, entity type, SIC industry code and description, EIN, filer category, fiscal year end, state of incorporation, tickers and exchanges, former names, business and mailing addresses and phone. Tickers are matched exactly; company names are not accepted (resolve one with company.us.resolve).\n\n**Use when:**\n- What industry, state of incorporation and EIN does the SEC hold for this ticker?\n- You have a stock ticker or a CIK and need the registered profile of the US public company behind it.\n- What industry (SIC code) is this SEC filer in?\n- Which exchanges and tickers does this filer trade under?\n- You are running KYB on a US listed counterparty and need registry-sourced identifiers.\n- Has this company filed under a former name?\n\n**Do not use when:**\n- You need to know whether the filer is still submitting periodic reports — check the filing dates with company.us.filings.latest; EDGAR publishes no reporting-status field.\n- You have a company name rather than a ticker or CIK — this capability matches tickers exactly and never names; use company.us.resolve first.\n- You need the filing list — use company.us.filings.\n- You need the newest 10-K/10-Q/8-K — use company.us.filings.latest.\n- The company is UK registered — use company.uk.profile.\n- You need a global legal entity identifier record — use entity.lei.search or entity.lei.profile.\n- If the user has asked you to inspect a specific website, page or URL, use your browsing tool instead — this capability only returns the SEC EDGAR record.","tags":["company_information"],"parameters":[{"name":"id","in":"path","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string","description":"SEC CIK or exchange ticker symbol. All digits is read as a CIK (leading zeros and an EDGAR CIK prefix are both accepted: 320193, 0000320193, CIK0000320193); anything else is read as a ticker (1-10 characters starting with a letter) and matched exactly, case-insensitively, against the SEC listed-security index — AAPL, aapl and BRK-B all work. Company names are not accepted: resolve one with company.us.resolve. A ticker with no SEC index entry returns NOT_FOUND, which is not a billable result.","minLength":1,"maxLength":13,"pattern":"^(?:(?:[Cc][Ii][Kk])?[0-9]{1,10}|[A-Za-z][A-Za-z0-9.-]{0,9})$"},"description":"SEC CIK or exchange ticker symbol. All digits is read as a CIK (leading zeros and an EDGAR CIK prefix are both accepted: 320193, 0000320193, CIK0000320193); anything else is read as a ticker (1-10 characters starting with a letter) and matched exactly, case-insensitively, against the SEC listed-security index — AAPL, aapl and BRK-B all work. Company names are not accepted: resolve one with company.us.resolve. A ticker with no SEC index entry returns NOT_FOUND, which is not a billable result."}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful capability result","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","required":["data","meta"],"properties":{"data":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/company_us_profile_output"},"meta":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ResponseMeta"}}},"examples":{"apple_by_ticker_live_2026-08-18":{"summary":"apple_by_ticker_live_2026-08-18","value":{"data":{"cik":"0000320193","name":"Apple Inc.","query":{"id":"AAPL","matched_by":"ticker"},"entity_type":"operating","sic_code":"3571","sic_description":"Electronic Computers","ein":"942404110","filer_categories":["Large accelerated filer"],"fiscal_year_end":{"month":9,"day":26},"state_of_incorporation":"CA","tickers":["AAPL"],"exchanges":["Nasdaq"],"former_names":[{"name":"APPLE INC","from":"2007-01-10","to":"2019-08-05"},{"name":"APPLE COMPUTER INC","from":"1994-01-26","to":"2007-01-04"},{"name":"APPLE COMPUTER INC/ FA","from":"1997-07-28","to":"1997-07-28"}],"addresses":{"business":{"street1":"ONE APPLE PARK WAY","street2":null,"city":"CUPERTINO","state_or_country":"CA","zip":"95014"},"mailing":{"street1":"ONE APPLE PARK WAY","street2":null,"city":"CUPERTINO","state_or_country":"CA","zip":"95014"}},"phone":"(408) 996-1010","website":null,"investor_website":null},"meta":{"capability":"company.us.profile","version":"3.0.0","source":"sec_edgar","freshness":"near_live"}}},"null_exchange_alignment_live_2026-08-18":{"summary":"null_exchange_alignment_live_2026-08-18","value":{"data":{"cik":"0000912595","name":"MID AMERICA APARTMENT COMMUNITIES INC.","query":{"id":"0000912595","matched_by":"cik"},"entity_type":"operating","sic_code":"6798","sic_description":"Real Estate Investment Trusts","ein":"621543819","filer_categories":["Large accelerated filer"],"fiscal_year_end":{"month":12,"day":31},"state_of_incorporation":"TN","tickers":["MAAI","MAA","MAA-PI"],"exchanges":[null,"NYSE","NYSE"],"former_names":[{"name":"MID AMERICA APARTMENT COMMUNITIES INC","from":"1995-02-03","to":"2018-05-03"}],"addresses":{"business":{"street1":"6815 POPLAR AVENUE","street2":"SUITE 500","city":"GERMANTOWN","state_or_country":"TN","zip":"38138"},"mailing":{"street1":"6815 POPLAR AVENUE","street2":"SUITE 500","city":"GERMANTOWN","state_or_country":"TN","zip":"38138"}},"phone":"9016826600","website":null,"investor_website":null},"meta":{"capability":"company.us.profile","version":"3.0.0","source":"sec_edgar","freshness":"near_live"}}}}}}},"400":{"description":"Invalid input (INVALID_INPUT)","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"401":{"description":"Authentication failed (AUTHENTICATION_REQUIRED, INVALID_API_KEY)","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"402":{"description":"Payment required (PAYMENT_REQUIRED, PAYMENT_FAILED, BUDGET_EXCEEDED, BILLING_REQUIRED). x402 challenge headers are attached.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"403":{"description":"Forbidden (PROJECT_DISABLED, CAPABILITY_NOT_ALLOWED)","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"404":{"description":"Not found (NOT_FOUND)","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"422":{"description":"Unprocessable (UNSUPPORTED_REGION, AMBIGUOUS_IDENTIFIER)","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"429":{"description":"Upstream rate limited (UPSTREAM_RATE_LIMITED)","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"500":{"description":"Internal error (INTERNAL_ERROR)","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"503":{"description":"Unavailable (UPSTREAM_UNAVAILABLE, CAPABILITY_UNAVAILABLE, LICENCE_RESTRICTED)","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}}},"security":[{"eckariApiKey":[]},{"x402":[]}],"x-payment-info":{"price":{"mode":"fixed","currency":"USD","amount":"0.004"},"protocols":[{"x402":{}}]},"x-eckari-capability":{"id":"company.us.profile","version":"3.0.0","lifecycle":"beta","pricing":{"currency":"USD","account":{"enabled":true,"unit_price":"0.003"},"x402":{"enabled":true,"unit_price":"0.004"}},"discovery":{"title":"US public company profile from SEC EDGAR by ticker or CIK","description":"Look up an SEC filer by stock ticker (AAPL) or CIK and return its registered profile — legal name, entity type, SIC industry code and description, EIN, filer category, fiscal year end, state of incorporation, tickers and exchanges, former names, business and mailing addresses and phone. Tickers are matched exactly; company names are not accepted (resolve one with company.us.resolve).","use_when":["What industry, state of incorporation and EIN does the SEC hold for this ticker?","You have a stock ticker or a CIK and need the registered profile of the US public company behind it.","What industry (SIC code) is this SEC filer in?","Which exchanges and tickers does this filer trade under?","You are running KYB on a US listed counterparty and need registry-sourced identifiers.","Has this company filed under a former name?"],"do_not_use_when":["You need to know whether the filer is still submitting periodic reports — check the filing dates with company.us.filings.latest; EDGAR publishes no reporting-status field.","You have a company name rather than a ticker or CIK — this capability matches tickers exactly and never names; use company.us.resolve first.","You need the filing list — use company.us.filings.","You need the newest 10-K/10-Q/8-K — use company.us.filings.latest.","The company is UK registered — use company.uk.profile.","You need a global legal entity identifier record — use entity.lei.search or entity.lei.profile.","If the user has asked you to inspect a specific website, page or URL, use your browsing tool instead — this capability only returns the SEC EDGAR record."],"synonyms":["sec company profile","company profile by ticker","stock symbol company lookup","edgar company details","us public company profile","sic code lookup","state of incorporation","ein lookup public company","filer category","fiscal year end","company addresses sec","former company names","us issuer details","kyb us listed company","cik profile","ticker to company details","public company registry data","securities issuer profile"],"category":"company_information","region":"US","tags":["us","sec","edgar","company","profile"],"related_capabilities":["company.us.resolve","company.us.filings.latest","company.us.filings","entity.lei.profile"]},"cache_policy":{"mode":"none"},"provenance":{"sources":["sec_edgar"],"freshness":"near_live"}}}},"/v1/companies/us/resolve":{"get":{"operationId":"company_us_resolve","summary":"Resolve a US company name to its SEC CIK and ticker","description":"Turn a company-name fragment or stock ticker into the SEC EDGAR identifiers. Searches the SEC listed-security index and returns ranked matches with the 10-digit CIK, ticker, registered name and listing exchange. Deterministic ranking: ticker exact, then name exact, then name prefix, then name contains. Use it for names — the other company.us.* capabilities take a ticker directly.\n\n**Use when:**\n- Which SEC filer and CIK does the company name \"Apple\" belong to?\n- What is the CIK for the ticker AAPL?\n- You have a US company name and need the SEC identifier before calling another US company capability.\n- You need to map a portfolio of names or tickers to SEC CIK numbers.\n- You want the exchange a US listed company trades on.\n- You need to see the candidate filers behind an ambiguous company name.\n\n**Do not use when:**\n- You already have a ticker or a CIK and want profile or filings — company.us.profile, company.us.filings and company.us.filings.latest accept either identifier directly, so this extra call is unnecessary.\n- You need to know whether a company is an SEC filer at all — this searches only the listed-security index, so private filers, funds and most foreign filers are absent even though they file; no result is not evidence of no filings.\n- You need filings — use company.us.filings or company.us.filings.latest.\n- The company is UK registered — use company.uk.search.\n- You need a global legal entity identifier rather than an SEC identifier — use entity.lei.search.\n- If the user has asked you to inspect a specific website, page or URL, use your browsing tool instead — this capability only returns the SEC EDGAR record.","tags":["company_information"],"parameters":[{"name":"q","in":"query","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string","description":"Ticker symbol (e.g. AAPL) or company-name fragment (e.g. Apple). Matching is case-insensitive and trimmed; no fuzzy matching is applied.","minLength":1,"maxLength":200},"description":"Ticker symbol (e.g. AAPL) or company-name fragment (e.g. Apple). Matching is case-insensitive and trimmed; no fuzzy matching is applied."},{"name":"limit","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"integer","description":"Maximum number of ranked matches to return. Ranking is applied before the limit; page.total reports how many matched in full.","minimum":1,"maximum":25,"default":10},"description":"Maximum number of ranked matches to return. Ranking is applied before the limit; page.total reports how many matched in full."}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful capability result","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","required":["data","meta"],"properties":{"data":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/company_us_resolve_output"},"meta":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ResponseMeta"}}},"examples":{"ticker_aapl_live_2026-08-18":{"summary":"ticker_aapl_live_2026-08-18","value":{"data":{"query":"AAPL","match_type":"ticker_exact","items":[{"cik":"0000320193","ticker":"AAPL","name":"Apple Inc.","exchange":"Nasdaq"}],"page":{"limit":3,"offset":0,"returned":1,"total":1,"has_more":false,"next_offset":null}},"meta":{"capability":"company.us.resolve","version":"2.0.0","source":"sec_edgar","freshness":"near_live"}}}}}}},"400":{"description":"Invalid input (INVALID_INPUT)","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"401":{"description":"Authentication failed (AUTHENTICATION_REQUIRED, INVALID_API_KEY)","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"402":{"description":"Payment required (PAYMENT_REQUIRED, PAYMENT_FAILED, BUDGET_EXCEEDED, BILLING_REQUIRED). x402 challenge headers are attached.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"403":{"description":"Forbidden (PROJECT_DISABLED, CAPABILITY_NOT_ALLOWED)","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"404":{"description":"Not found (NOT_FOUND)","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"422":{"description":"Unprocessable (UNSUPPORTED_REGION, AMBIGUOUS_IDENTIFIER)","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"429":{"description":"Upstream rate limited (UPSTREAM_RATE_LIMITED)","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"500":{"description":"Internal error (INTERNAL_ERROR)","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"503":{"description":"Unavailable (UPSTREAM_UNAVAILABLE, CAPABILITY_UNAVAILABLE, LICENCE_RESTRICTED)","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}}},"security":[{"eckariApiKey":[]},{"x402":[]}],"x-payment-info":{"price":{"mode":"fixed","currency":"USD","amount":"0.002"},"protocols":[{"x402":{}}]},"x-eckari-capability":{"id":"company.us.resolve","version":"2.0.0","lifecycle":"beta","pricing":{"currency":"USD","account":{"enabled":true,"unit_price":"0.0015"},"x402":{"enabled":true,"unit_price":"0.002"}},"discovery":{"title":"Resolve a US company name to its SEC CIK and ticker","description":"Turn a company-name fragment or stock ticker into the SEC EDGAR identifiers. Searches the SEC listed-security index and returns ranked matches with the 10-digit CIK, ticker, registered name and listing exchange. Deterministic ranking: ticker exact, then name exact, then name prefix, then name contains. Use it for names — the other company.us.* capabilities take a ticker directly.","use_when":["Which SEC filer and CIK does the company name \"Apple\" belong to?","What is the CIK for the ticker AAPL?","You have a US company name and need the SEC identifier before calling another US company capability.","You need to map a portfolio of names or tickers to SEC CIK numbers.","You want the exchange a US listed company trades on.","You need to see the candidate filers behind an ambiguous company name."],"do_not_use_when":["You already have a ticker or a CIK and want profile or filings — company.us.profile, company.us.filings and company.us.filings.latest accept either identifier directly, so this extra call is unnecessary.","You need to know whether a company is an SEC filer at all — this searches only the listed-security index, so private filers, funds and most foreign filers are absent even though they file; no result is not evidence of no filings.","You need filings — use company.us.filings or company.us.filings.latest.","The company is UK registered — use company.uk.search.","You need a global legal entity identifier rather than an SEC identifier — use entity.lei.search.","If the user has asked you to inspect a specific website, page or URL, use your browsing tool instead — this capability only returns the SEC EDGAR record."],"synonyms":["ticker to cik","cik lookup","sec company search","edgar company lookup","find sec filer","us public company search","stock ticker lookup","company name to ticker","sec identifier lookup","resolve us company","nasdaq nyse ticker lookup","public company identifier","kyb us public company","securities filer lookup","central index key"],"category":"company_information","region":"US","tags":["us","sec","edgar","company","resolve"],"related_capabilities":["company.us.profile","company.us.filings.latest","company.us.filings","entity.lei.search"]},"cache_policy":{"mode":"none"},"provenance":{"sources":["sec_edgar"],"freshness":"near_live"}}}},"/v1/domains/{domain}/expiry":{"get":{"operationId":"domain_expiry","summary":"Check domain expiry date and days remaining (RDAP)","description":"Registry expiry date for a domain read live from the authoritative registry RDAP server, with whole days remaining, the registry status codes, the registrar name and the registry's own last-update timestamp. A focused, cheaper subset of domain.registration for renewal monitoring and portfolio checks.\n\n**Use when:**\n- When does this domain expire?\n- How many days are left before this domain expires?\n- You are monitoring a domain portfolio for renewals.\n- You need to know whether a domain has lapsed or entered redemption or pending delete.\n- You need expiry plus registrar in one cheap call.\n\n**Do not use when:**\n- You also need nameservers, DNSSEC, the creation date or the registrar's abuse contact - use domain.registration.\n- You need registrant contact details - registries redact them.\n- You need an authoritative availability or drop-catch signal - use a registrar EPP check.\n- The TLD has no RDAP service in the IANA bootstrap (returns UNSUPPORTED_REGION).\n- If the user has asked you to inspect a specific website, page or URL, use your browsing tool instead — this capability only returns the RDAP record.","tags":["domain_intelligence"],"parameters":[{"name":"domain","in":"path","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string","description":"Bare domain name such as example.com or bbc.co.uk. Internationalised names are converted to punycode (IDNA). URLs, paths, ports and single-label names are rejected.","minLength":3,"maxLength":253,"pattern":"^[^ /:?#@]{3,253}$"},"description":"Bare domain name such as example.com or bbc.co.uk. Internationalised names are converted to punycode (IDNA). URLs, paths, ports and single-label names are rejected."}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful capability result","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","required":["data","meta"],"properties":{"data":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/domain_expiry_output"},"meta":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ResponseMeta"}}},"examples":{"eckari_com_expiry_live_2026-08-18":{"summary":"eckari_com_expiry_live_2026-08-18","value":{"data":{"domain":"eckari.com","is_registered":true,"expires_at":"2027-08-17T08:03:38.000Z","days_until_expiry":363,"status":["client transfer prohibited"],"registrar_name":"NameCheap, Inc.","rdap_last_update":"2026-08-18T13:20:44.000Z","terms_url":"https://www.verisign.com/domain-names/registration-data-access-protocol/terms-service/index.xhtml"},"meta":{"capability":"domain.expiry","version":"2.1.0","source":"rdap","freshness":"near_live"}}}}}}},"400":{"description":"Invalid input (INVALID_INPUT)","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"401":{"description":"Authentication failed (AUTHENTICATION_REQUIRED, INVALID_API_KEY)","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"402":{"description":"Payment required (PAYMENT_REQUIRED, PAYMENT_FAILED, BUDGET_EXCEEDED, BILLING_REQUIRED). x402 challenge headers are attached.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"403":{"description":"Forbidden (PROJECT_DISABLED, CAPABILITY_NOT_ALLOWED)","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"404":{"description":"Not found (NOT_FOUND)","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"422":{"description":"Unprocessable (UNSUPPORTED_REGION, AMBIGUOUS_IDENTIFIER)","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"429":{"description":"Upstream rate limited (UPSTREAM_RATE_LIMITED)","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"500":{"description":"Internal error (INTERNAL_ERROR)","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"503":{"description":"Unavailable (UPSTREAM_UNAVAILABLE, CAPABILITY_UNAVAILABLE, LICENCE_RESTRICTED)","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}}},"security":[{"eckariApiKey":[]},{"x402":[]}],"x-payment-info":{"price":{"mode":"fixed","currency":"USD","amount":"0.002"},"protocols":[{"x402":{}}]},"x-eckari-capability":{"id":"domain.expiry","version":"2.1.0","lifecycle":"beta","pricing":{"currency":"USD","account":{"enabled":true,"unit_price":"0.0015"},"x402":{"enabled":true,"unit_price":"0.002"}},"discovery":{"title":"Check domain expiry date and days remaining (RDAP)","description":"Registry expiry date for a domain read live from the authoritative registry RDAP server, with whole days remaining, the registry status codes, the registrar name and the registry's own last-update timestamp. A focused, cheaper subset of domain.registration for renewal monitoring and portfolio checks.","use_when":["When does this domain expire?","How many days are left before this domain expires?","You are monitoring a domain portfolio for renewals.","You need to know whether a domain has lapsed or entered redemption or pending delete.","You need expiry plus registrar in one cheap call."],"do_not_use_when":["You also need nameservers, DNSSEC, the creation date or the registrar's abuse contact - use domain.registration.","You need registrant contact details - registries redact them.","You need an authoritative availability or drop-catch signal - use a registrar EPP check.","The TLD has no RDAP service in the IANA bootstrap (returns UNSUPPORTED_REGION).","If the user has asked you to inspect a specific website, page or URL, use your browsing tool instead — this capability only returns the RDAP record."],"synonyms":["domain expiration","domain expiry date","when does domain expire","domain renewal date","days until domain expires","domain lapsed check","whois expiry","RDAP expiration","domain portfolio monitoring","domain renewal reminder","expired domain check","registrar and expiry lookup"],"category":"domain_intelligence","region":null,"tags":["domain","rdap","expiry","renewal","whois"],"related_capabilities":["domain.registration"]},"cache_policy":{"mode":"none"},"provenance":{"sources":["rdap"],"freshness":"near_live"}}}},"/v1/domains/{domain}/registration":{"get":{"operationId":"domain_registration","summary":"WHOIS lookup for a domain, from the registry RDAP record","description":"The WHOIS lookup for a domain, answered from the registry's own RDAP service - the structured successor to port-43 WHOIS, read live via the IANA bootstrap, never scraped WHOIS text. Registrar and IANA id, RDAP/EPP status codes, creation, update and expiry dates, nameservers, DNSSEC, days until expiry and the terms link. Registrant contacts are redacted by registries.\n\n**Use when:**\n- Answer a WHOIS question about a domain - registrar, creation date, expiry, transfer lock - from the registry record.\n- Who is the registrar of this domain and when does it expire?\n- You want a WHOIS lookup - this is the same question answered from RDAP, the registries' own structured replacement for it.\n- Is this domain registered, and when was it created?\n- You need the registry status codes such as \"client transfer prohibited\" (the RDAP spelling of the EPP code clientTransferProhibited) before a transfer.\n- You need nameservers and DNSSEC status from the registry rather than DNS.\n- You need domain age or expiry for risk, fraud or vendor due diligence.\n- You need evidence a domain has no registry record (availability signal).\n\n**Do not use when:**\n- You only need the expiry date and days remaining - use domain.expiry (cheaper).\n- You need registrant name, email, address or phone - registries redact them.\n- You need an authoritative availability check for purchase - use a registrar EPP check.\n- You need bulk or historical registration data or zone files - prohibited by registry terms.\n- The TLD has no RDAP service in the IANA bootstrap (returns UNSUPPORTED_REGION).\n- If the user has asked you to inspect a specific website, page or URL, use your browsing tool instead — this capability only returns the RDAP record.","tags":["domain_intelligence"],"parameters":[{"name":"domain","in":"path","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string","description":"Bare domain name such as example.com or bbc.co.uk. Internationalised names are converted to punycode (IDNA). URLs, paths, ports and single-label names are rejected.","minLength":3,"maxLength":253,"pattern":"^[^ /:?#@]{3,253}$"},"description":"Bare domain name such as example.com or bbc.co.uk. Internationalised names are converted to punycode (IDNA). URLs, paths, ports and single-label names are rejected."}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful capability result","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","required":["data","meta"],"properties":{"data":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/domain_registration_output"},"meta":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ResponseMeta"}}},"examples":{"example_com_live_2026-08-18":{"summary":"example_com_live_2026-08-18","value":{"data":{"domain":"example.com","unicode_name":null,"tld":"com","bootstrap_suffix":"com","is_registered":true,"status":["client delete prohibited","client transfer prohibited","client update prohibited"],"registrar":{"name":"RESERVED-Internet Assigned Numbers Authority","iana_id":"376","url":null,"abuse_email":null},"events":{"registered_at":"1995-08-14T04:00:00.000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-14T08:01:43.000Z","expires_at":"2027-08-13T04:00:00.000Z","transferred_at":null},"nameservers":["elliott.ns.cloudflare.com","hera.ns.cloudflare.com"],"dnssec_signed":true,"rdap_server":"https://rdap.verisign.com/com/v1/","rdap_last_update":"2026-08-18T13:20:14.000Z","days_until_expiry":359,"auto_renew_flag":null,"terms_url":"https://www.verisign.com/domain-names/registration-data-access-protocol/terms-service/index.xhtml","availability_note":null},"meta":{"capability":"domain.registration","version":"2.1.0","source":"rdap","freshness":"near_live"}}},"bbc_co_uk_nominet_live_2026-08-18":{"summary":"bbc_co_uk_nominet_live_2026-08-18","value":{"data":{"domain":"bbc.co.uk","unicode_name":"bbc.co.uk","tld":"uk","bootstrap_suffix":"uk","is_registered":true,"status":["server delete prohibited","server transfer prohibited","server update prohibited"],"registrar":{"name":"British Broadcasting Corporation","iana_id":null,"url":"https://www.bbc.co.uk/","abuse_email":"nominet.admins@bbc.co.uk"},"events":{"registered_at":"1994-12-13T03:49:48.000Z","updated_at":"2025-10-29T03:51:11.009Z","expires_at":"2034-12-13T03:49:48.000Z","transferred_at":null},"nameservers":["ddns0.bbc.co.uk","ddns0.bbc.com","ddns1.bbc.co.uk","ddns1.bbc.com","dns0.bbc.co.uk","dns0.bbc.com","dns1.bbc.co.uk","dns1.bbc.com"],"dnssec_signed":false,"rdap_server":"https://rdap.nominet.uk/uk/","rdap_last_update":"2026-08-18T13:20:27.385Z","days_until_expiry":3038,"auto_renew_flag":null,"terms_url":"https://nominet.uk/rdap-tos","availability_note":null},"meta":{"capability":"domain.registration","version":"2.1.0","source":"rdap","freshness":"near_live"}}},"unregistered_name_live_2026-08-18":{"summary":"unregistered_name_live_2026-08-18","value":{"data":{"domain":"eckari-unregistered-test-9f3a2b.com","unicode_name":null,"tld":"com","bootstrap_suffix":"com","is_registered":false,"status":[],"registrar":{"name":null,"iana_id":null,"url":null,"abuse_email":null},"events":{"registered_at":null,"updated_at":null,"expires_at":null,"transferred_at":null},"nameservers":[],"dnssec_signed":null,"rdap_server":"https://rdap.verisign.com/com/v1/","rdap_last_update":null,"days_until_expiry":null,"auto_renew_flag":null,"terms_url":null,"availability_note":"No registry record via RDAP; strong evidence of availability but not an authoritative EPP check"},"meta":{"capability":"domain.registration","version":"2.1.0","source":"rdap","freshness":"near_live"}}}}}}},"400":{"description":"Invalid input (INVALID_INPUT)","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"401":{"description":"Authentication failed (AUTHENTICATION_REQUIRED, INVALID_API_KEY)","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"402":{"description":"Payment required (PAYMENT_REQUIRED, PAYMENT_FAILED, BUDGET_EXCEEDED, BILLING_REQUIRED). x402 challenge headers are attached.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"403":{"description":"Forbidden (PROJECT_DISABLED, CAPABILITY_NOT_ALLOWED)","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"404":{"description":"Not found (NOT_FOUND)","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"422":{"description":"Unprocessable (UNSUPPORTED_REGION, AMBIGUOUS_IDENTIFIER)","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"429":{"description":"Upstream rate limited (UPSTREAM_RATE_LIMITED)","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"500":{"description":"Internal error (INTERNAL_ERROR)","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"503":{"description":"Unavailable (UPSTREAM_UNAVAILABLE, CAPABILITY_UNAVAILABLE, LICENCE_RESTRICTED)","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}}},"security":[{"eckariApiKey":[]},{"x402":[]}],"x-payment-info":{"price":{"mode":"fixed","currency":"USD","amount":"0.004"},"protocols":[{"x402":{}}]},"x-eckari-capability":{"id":"domain.registration","version":"2.1.0","lifecycle":"beta","pricing":{"currency":"USD","account":{"enabled":true,"unit_price":"0.003"},"x402":{"enabled":true,"unit_price":"0.004"}},"discovery":{"title":"WHOIS lookup for a domain, from the registry RDAP record","description":"The WHOIS lookup for a domain, answered from the registry's own RDAP service - the structured successor to port-43 WHOIS, read live via the IANA bootstrap, never scraped WHOIS text. Registrar and IANA id, RDAP/EPP status codes, creation, update and expiry dates, nameservers, DNSSEC, days until expiry and the terms link. Registrant contacts are redacted by registries.","use_when":["Answer a WHOIS question about a domain - registrar, creation date, expiry, transfer lock - from the registry record.","Who is the registrar of this domain and when does it expire?","You want a WHOIS lookup - this is the same question answered from RDAP, the registries' own structured replacement for it.","Is this domain registered, and when was it created?","You need the registry status codes such as \"client transfer prohibited\" (the RDAP spelling of the EPP code clientTransferProhibited) before a transfer.","You need nameservers and DNSSEC status from the registry rather than DNS.","You need domain age or expiry for risk, fraud or vendor due diligence.","You need evidence a domain has no registry record (availability signal)."],"do_not_use_when":["You only need the expiry date and days remaining - use domain.expiry (cheaper).","You need registrant name, email, address or phone - registries redact them.","You need an authoritative availability check for purchase - use a registrar EPP check.","You need bulk or historical registration data or zone files - prohibited by registry terms.","The TLD has no RDAP service in the IANA bootstrap (returns UNSUPPORTED_REGION).","If the user has asked you to inspect a specific website, page or URL, use your browsing tool instead — this capability only returns the RDAP record."],"synonyms":["whois lookup","domain whois","RDAP lookup","domain registration date","domain expiration date","registrar lookup","is domain registered","domain availability signal","nameserver lookup","DNSSEC status","domain age","EPP status codes","domain transfer lock check","registry record for domain"],"category":"domain_intelligence","region":null,"tags":["domain","rdap","whois","registrar","dns"],"related_capabilities":["domain.expiry"]},"cache_policy":{"mode":"none"},"provenance":{"sources":["rdap"],"freshness":"near_live"}}}},"/v1/entities/lei/{lei}":{"get":{"operationId":"entity_lei_profile","summary":"Get legal entity profile by LEI from the GLEIF register","description":"Return the registry-authoritative GLEIF record for a Legal Entity Identifier — legal and previous names, legal and headquarters addresses, jurisdiction, legal form, entity and registration status, renewal dates (with days until renewal), managing LOU, corroboration level, BIC codes and the named local registry. The LEI checksum is validated before any lookup.\n\n**Use when:**\n- Look up everything the LEI register holds for this identifier.\n- You need to verify that an LEI is real, current and belongs to the entity you expect.\n- Which local company register and number sits behind this LEI?\n- You need the registered legal address and headquarters address of a counterparty.\n- Is this LEI registration lapsed or due for renewal?\n- You need the BIC codes associated with a legal entity.\n\n**Do not use when:**\n- You only have a company name — use entity.lei.search first.\n- You need parent or subsidiary relationships — LEI hierarchy is not in this release; the related flags tell you what GLEIF holds.\n- You need UK register detail — use company.uk.profile with the registered_as number when ra_code is RA000585.\n- You need SEC filings or CIK data — use company.us.profile.\n- If the user has asked you to inspect a specific website, page or URL, use your browsing tool instead — this capability only returns the GLEIF LEI Public API record.","tags":["company_information"],"parameters":[{"name":"lei","in":"path","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string","description":"20-character ISO 17442 Legal Entity Identifier (18 alphanumerics + 2 check digits). Case-insensitive. The structure is checked before payment, so a wrong-shaped LEI is rejected on the 402 (details.input_validation). The ISO 7064 MOD 97-10 checksum cannot be expressed as a schema pattern and is verified at execution: it fails with INVALID_INPUT before any upstream call and before settlement, so a bad checksum is never charged for.","minLength":20,"maxLength":20,"pattern":"^[A-Za-z0-9]{18}[0-9]{2}$"},"description":"20-character ISO 17442 Legal Entity Identifier (18 alphanumerics + 2 check digits). Case-insensitive. The structure is checked before payment, so a wrong-shaped LEI is rejected on the 402 (details.input_validation). The ISO 7064 MOD 97-10 checksum cannot be expressed as a schema pattern and is verified at execution: it fails with INVALID_INPUT before any upstream call and before settlement, so a bad checksum is never charged for."}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful capability result","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","required":["data","meta"],"properties":{"data":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/entity_lei_profile_output"},"meta":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ResponseMeta"}}},"examples":{"apple_lei_live_2026-08-18":{"summary":"apple_lei_live_2026-08-18","value":{"data":{"lei":"HWUPKR0MPOU8FGXBT394","legal_name":"Apple Inc.","legal_name_language":"en","other_names":[{"name":"Apple Computer, Inc.","type":"PREVIOUS_LEGAL_NAME","language":"en"}],"legal_address":{"lines":["C/O C T Corporation System","330 N. Brand Blvd","Suite 700"],"city":"Glendale","region":"US-CA","country":"US","postal_code":"91203"},"headquarters_address":{"lines":["One Apple Park Way"],"city":"Cupertino","region":"US-CA","country":"US","postal_code":"95014"},"jurisdiction":"US-CA","legal_form":{"code":"H1UM","other":null},"category":"GENERAL","sub_category":null,"entity_status":"ACTIVE","creation_date":"1977-01-03","expiration":null,"registered_at":{"ra_code":"RA000598","name":"Secretary of State"},"registered_as":"806592","registration":{"status":"ISSUED","initial_date":"2012-06-06T15:53:00Z","last_update":"2026-03-03T16:34:33Z","next_renewal":"2027-03-08T17:27:20Z","days_until_renewal":202,"managing_lou":"5493001KJTIIGC8Y1R12","corroboration_level":"FULLY_CORROBORATED","validated_at":{"ra_code":"RA000598","name":"Secretary of State"},"validated_as":"806592"},"bic":["APLEUS66XXX"],"conformity_flag":"CONFORMING","golden_copy_date":"2026-08-18T00:00:00Z","related":{"direct_parent_available":false,"ultimate_parent_available":false,"children_available":true}},"meta":{"capability":"entity.lei.profile","version":"2.0.0","source":"gleif","freshness":"near_live"}}}}}}},"400":{"description":"Invalid input (INVALID_INPUT)","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"401":{"description":"Authentication failed (AUTHENTICATION_REQUIRED, INVALID_API_KEY)","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"402":{"description":"Payment required (PAYMENT_REQUIRED, PAYMENT_FAILED, BUDGET_EXCEEDED, BILLING_REQUIRED). x402 challenge headers are attached.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"403":{"description":"Forbidden (PROJECT_DISABLED, CAPABILITY_NOT_ALLOWED)","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"404":{"description":"Not found (NOT_FOUND)","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"422":{"description":"Unprocessable (UNSUPPORTED_REGION, AMBIGUOUS_IDENTIFIER)","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"429":{"description":"Upstream rate limited (UPSTREAM_RATE_LIMITED)","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"500":{"description":"Internal error (INTERNAL_ERROR)","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"503":{"description":"Unavailable (UPSTREAM_UNAVAILABLE, CAPABILITY_UNAVAILABLE, LICENCE_RESTRICTED)","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}}},"security":[{"eckariApiKey":[]},{"x402":[]}],"x-payment-info":{"price":{"mode":"fixed","currency":"USD","amount":"0.004"},"protocols":[{"x402":{}}]},"x-eckari-capability":{"id":"entity.lei.profile","version":"2.0.0","lifecycle":"beta","pricing":{"currency":"USD","account":{"enabled":true,"unit_price":"0.003"},"x402":{"enabled":true,"unit_price":"0.004"}},"discovery":{"title":"Get legal entity profile by LEI from the GLEIF register","description":"Return the registry-authoritative GLEIF record for a Legal Entity Identifier — legal and previous names, legal and headquarters addresses, jurisdiction, legal form, entity and registration status, renewal dates (with days until renewal), managing LOU, corroboration level, BIC codes and the named local registry. The LEI checksum is validated before any lookup.","use_when":["Look up everything the LEI register holds for this identifier.","You need to verify that an LEI is real, current and belongs to the entity you expect.","Which local company register and number sits behind this LEI?","You need the registered legal address and headquarters address of a counterparty.","Is this LEI registration lapsed or due for renewal?","You need the BIC codes associated with a legal entity."],"do_not_use_when":["You only have a company name — use entity.lei.search first.","You need parent or subsidiary relationships — LEI hierarchy is not in this release; the related flags tell you what GLEIF holds.","You need UK register detail — use company.uk.profile with the registered_as number when ra_code is RA000585.","You need SEC filings or CIK data — use company.us.profile.","If the user has asked you to inspect a specific website, page or URL, use your browsing tool instead — this capability only returns the GLEIF LEI Public API record."],"synonyms":["lei lookup by code","legal entity identifier details","gleif record","iso 17442 validation","lei checksum check","counterparty verification","entity legal form","managing lou","lei renewal date","lei status check","bic to lei","registered address global","kyb entity profile","corporate identity verification","global entity register"],"category":"company_information","region":null,"tags":["lei","gleif","entity","kyb","profile"],"related_capabilities":["entity.lei.search","company.uk.profile","company.uk.status","company.us.profile"]},"cache_policy":{"mode":"none"},"provenance":{"sources":["gleif"],"freshness":"near_live"}}}},"/v1/entities/lei/search":{"get":{"operationId":"entity_lei_search","summary":"Search legal entities by name in the GLEIF LEI register","description":"Find Legal Entity Identifiers by company name in the global GLEIF register, optionally narrowed to one country. Returns the LEI, legal name, registration and entity status, jurisdiction, legal address and the local registry the entity is registered at — the identifier bridge between national company registers worldwide.\n\n**Use when:**\n- What is the LEI for this company?\n- You need to identify a counterparty in a global register before onboarding or trading.\n- Find the registered entities with this name in a given country, paging with limit and offset in GLEIF's own ordering.\n- You need the local company-registry number behind a legal entity name.\n- You are resolving a corporate group's entities across jurisdictions.\n- Does this legal entity still hold an active LEI registration?\n\n**Do not use when:**\n- You already have the LEI — use entity.lei.profile.\n- You need UK Companies House data — use company.uk.search.\n- You need SEC filers or CIKs — use company.us.resolve.\n- You need parent or subsidiary relationships — LEI hierarchy is not in this release.\n- If the user has asked you to inspect a specific website, page or URL, use your browsing tool instead — this capability only returns the GLEIF LEI Public API record.","tags":["company_information"],"parameters":[{"name":"q","in":"query","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string","description":"Legal entity name or name fragment. GLEIF applies its own matching to this value; Eckari does not re-rank the results.","minLength":2,"maxLength":200},"description":"Legal entity name or name fragment. GLEIF applies its own matching to this value; Eckari does not re-rank the results."},{"name":"country","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"string","description":"ISO 3166-1 alpha-2 country code of the entity's legal address, used to narrow the search (e.g. GB, US, DE).","pattern":"^[A-Za-z]{2}$"},"description":"ISO 3166-1 alpha-2 country code of the entity's legal address, used to narrow the search (e.g. GB, US, DE)."},{"name":"limit","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"integer","description":"Maximum number of entities to return. Capped at 25 because that is the most records one fuzzy-completion fill-in pass can hydrate; a larger page could not be filled and would misreport how much GLEIF holds.","minimum":1,"maximum":25,"default":10},"description":"Maximum number of entities to return. Capped at 25 because that is the most records one fuzzy-completion fill-in pass can hydrate; a larger page could not be filled and would misreport how much GLEIF holds."},{"name":"offset","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"integer","description":"Zero-based offset into the result set for paging. Pass back page.next_offset from the previous response; page.has_more says whether there is one. GLEIF pages by page number, so an offset that is a multiple of limit is one upstream page - which is every offset page.next_offset produces. Capped at 9900 because GLEIF refuses page-based pagination beyond 10,000 records; beyond that, narrow the query.","minimum":0,"maximum":9900},"description":"Zero-based offset into the result set for paging. Pass back page.next_offset from the previous response; page.has_more says whether there is one. GLEIF pages by page number, so an offset that is a multiple of limit is one upstream page - which is every offset page.next_offset produces. Capped at 9900 because GLEIF refuses page-based pagination beyond 10,000 records; beyond that, narrow the query."}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful capability result","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","required":["data","meta"],"properties":{"data":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/entity_lei_search_output"},"meta":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ResponseMeta"}}},"examples":{"tesco_gb_live_2026-08-18":{"summary":"tesco_gb_live_2026-08-18","value":{"data":{"query":"TESCO PLC","country":"GB","items":[{"lei":"2138002P5RNKC5W2JZ46","legal_name":"TESCO PLC","legal_name_language":"en","registration_status":"ISSUED","entity_status":"ACTIVE","jurisdiction":"GB","legal_address":{"lines":["TESCO HOUSE","SHIRE PARK, KESTREL WAY"],"city":"WELWYN GARDEN CITY","region":"GB-HRT","country":"GB","postal_code":"AL7 1GA"},"registered_at":{"ra_code":"RA000585","name":"Companies House"},"registered_as":"00445790","match_source":"filter"},{"lei":"213800DJFYY7MSLDKD28","legal_name":"TESCO TREASURY SERVICES PLC","legal_name_language":"en","registration_status":"RETIRED","entity_status":"INACTIVE","jurisdiction":"GB","legal_address":{"lines":["TESCO HOUSE","SHIRE PARK, KESTREL WAY"],"city":"WELWYN GARDEN CITY","region":null,"country":"GB","postal_code":"AL7 1GA"},"registered_at":{"ra_code":"RA000585","name":"Companies House"},"registered_as":"07656305","match_source":"filter"},{"lei":"JL5Y1BHW3R0NH5H6C288","legal_name":"TESCO PLC PENSION SCHEME","legal_name_language":"en","registration_status":"ISSUED","entity_status":"ACTIVE","jurisdiction":"GB","legal_address":{"lines":["C/O TESCO PENSION TRUSTEES LIMITED","TESCO HOUSE, SHIRE PARK, KESTREL WAY"],"city":"WELWYN GARDEN CITY","region":"GB-HRT","country":"GB","postal_code":"AL7 1GA"},"registered_at":{"ra_code":"RA999999","name":null},"registered_as":null,"match_source":"filter"}],"page":{"limit":3,"offset":0,"returned":3,"total":11,"has_more":true,"next_offset":3}},"meta":{"capability":"entity.lei.search","version":"2.1.0","source":"gleif","freshness":"near_live"}}}}}}},"400":{"description":"Invalid input (INVALID_INPUT)","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"401":{"description":"Authentication failed (AUTHENTICATION_REQUIRED, INVALID_API_KEY)","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"402":{"description":"Payment required (PAYMENT_REQUIRED, PAYMENT_FAILED, BUDGET_EXCEEDED, BILLING_REQUIRED). x402 challenge headers are attached.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"403":{"description":"Forbidden (PROJECT_DISABLED, CAPABILITY_NOT_ALLOWED)","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"404":{"description":"Not found (NOT_FOUND)","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"422":{"description":"Unprocessable (UNSUPPORTED_REGION, AMBIGUOUS_IDENTIFIER)","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"429":{"description":"Upstream rate limited (UPSTREAM_RATE_LIMITED)","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"500":{"description":"Internal error (INTERNAL_ERROR)","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"503":{"description":"Unavailable (UPSTREAM_UNAVAILABLE, CAPABILITY_UNAVAILABLE, LICENCE_RESTRICTED)","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}}},"security":[{"eckariApiKey":[]},{"x402":[]}],"x-payment-info":{"price":{"mode":"fixed","currency":"USD","amount":"0.003"},"protocols":[{"x402":{}}]},"x-eckari-capability":{"id":"entity.lei.search","version":"2.1.0","lifecycle":"beta","pricing":{"currency":"USD","account":{"enabled":true,"unit_price":"0.002"},"x402":{"enabled":true,"unit_price":"0.003"}},"discovery":{"title":"Search legal entities by name in the GLEIF LEI register","description":"Find Legal Entity Identifiers by company name in the global GLEIF register, optionally narrowed to one country. Returns the LEI, legal name, registration and entity status, jurisdiction, legal address and the local registry the entity is registered at — the identifier bridge between national company registers worldwide.","use_when":["What is the LEI for this company?","You need to identify a counterparty in a global register before onboarding or trading.","Find the registered entities with this name in a given country, paging with limit and offset in GLEIF's own ordering.","You need the local company-registry number behind a legal entity name.","You are resolving a corporate group's entities across jurisdictions.","Does this legal entity still hold an active LEI registration?"],"do_not_use_when":["You already have the LEI — use entity.lei.profile.","You need UK Companies House data — use company.uk.search.","You need SEC filers or CIKs — use company.us.resolve.","You need parent or subsidiary relationships — LEI hierarchy is not in this release.","If the user has asked you to inspect a specific website, page or URL, use your browsing tool instead — this capability only returns the GLEIF LEI Public API record."],"synonyms":["lei lookup","legal entity identifier search","gleif search","iso 17442","entity resolution","kyb global","counterparty identification","lei by company name","legal entity search by country","mifid lei","find lei code","global company identifier","lei validation","company registry cross reference","legal entity name search"],"category":"company_information","region":null,"tags":["lei","gleif","entity","kyb","global"],"related_capabilities":["entity.lei.profile","company.uk.search","company.us.resolve"]},"cache_policy":{"mode":"none"},"provenance":{"sources":["gleif"],"freshness":"near_live"}}}},"/v1/fx/reference-rate":{"get":{"operationId":"fx_reference_rate","summary":"Get the official ECB reference exchange rate for a pair (accounting, invoicing, reporting)","description":"European Central Bank euro foreign exchange reference rate for a pair - the official daily fix used for accounting, invoicing and reporting - latest or any date in the last 90 days. The ECB publishes EUR/XXX only, so inverse and cross rates are computed from the same fix and named in rate_derivation. One fix per TARGET working day, not a tradable market rate.\n\n**Use when:**\n- Convert or report an amount at an official daily rate both sides of a contract can verify against the ECB.\n- What is the ECB reference rate for EUR to USD?\n- You need the rate to put on an invoice, a ledger entry or a statutory report.\n- You need an official, auditable daily reference rate for reporting or accounting.\n- You need a historical reference rate from the last 90 days.\n- You need a cross rate such as GBP to USD derived from the ECB euro fix.\n\n**Do not use when:**\n- You need an executable, tradable, live or intraday market rate - this is a daily fix only.\n- You need cryptocurrency prices - not supported.\n- You need rates older than 90 days - not supported.\n- You need a currency the ECB does not publish (returns INVALID_INPUT).\n- If the user has asked you to inspect a specific website, page or URL, use your browsing tool instead — this capability only returns the ECB euro foreign exchange reference rates record.","tags":["foreign_exchange"],"parameters":[{"name":"base","in":"query","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string","description":"ISO 4217 code of the base currency. EUR is always available; other currencies must be in the ECB reference rate list for the selected date.","pattern":"^[A-Za-z]{3}$"},"description":"ISO 4217 code of the base currency. EUR is always available; other currencies must be in the ECB reference rate list for the selected date."},{"name":"quote","in":"query","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string","description":"ISO 4217 code of the quote currency. EUR is always available; other currencies must be in the ECB reference rate list for the selected date.","pattern":"^[A-Za-z]{3}$"},"description":"ISO 4217 code of the quote currency. EUR is always available; other currencies must be in the ECB reference rate list for the selected date."},{"name":"date","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"string","description":"Optional ISO calendar date (YYYY-MM-DD) within the last 90 days. When the ECB published no fix on that date (a TARGET closing day), the latest prior fix is returned with a note.","pattern":"^[0-9]{4}-[0-9]{2}-[0-9]{2}$"},"description":"Optional ISO calendar date (YYYY-MM-DD) within the last 90 days. When the ECB published no fix on that date (a TARGET closing day), the latest prior fix is returned with a note."}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful capability result","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","required":["data","meta"],"properties":{"data":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/fx_reference_rate_output"},"meta":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ResponseMeta"}}},"examples":{"eur_usd_live_2026-08-18":{"summary":"eur_usd_live_2026-08-18","value":{"data":{"base":"EUR","quote":"USD","rate":"1.159300","rate_date":"2026-08-17","rate_kind":"reference","rate_derivation":"published","published_pairs_used":["EUR/USD"],"note":"no ECB fix published for today yet (weekend, TARGET closing day, or before the ~16:00 CET publication); the latest published fix is returned"},"meta":{"capability":"fx.reference_rate","version":"2.1.0","source":"ecb_fx","freshness":"near_live"}}},"usd_eur_inverse_live_2026-08-18":{"summary":"usd_eur_inverse_live_2026-08-18","value":{"data":{"base":"USD","quote":"EUR","rate":"0.862589","rate_date":"2026-08-17","rate_kind":"reference","rate_derivation":"inverse","published_pairs_used":["EUR/USD"],"note":"no ECB fix published for today yet (weekend, TARGET closing day, or before the ~16:00 CET publication); the latest published fix is returned"},"meta":{"capability":"fx.reference_rate","version":"2.1.0","source":"ecb_fx","freshness":"near_live"}}},"gbp_usd_cross_live_2026-08-18":{"summary":"gbp_usd_cross_live_2026-08-18","value":{"data":{"base":"GBP","quote":"USD","rate":"1.355906","rate_date":"2026-08-17","rate_kind":"reference","rate_derivation":"cross","published_pairs_used":["EUR/GBP","EUR/USD"],"note":"no ECB fix published for today yet (weekend, TARGET closing day, or before the ~16:00 CET publication); the latest published fix is returned"},"meta":{"capability":"fx.reference_rate","version":"2.1.0","source":"ecb_fx","freshness":"near_live"}}},"eur_jpy_non_publication_day_live_2026-08-18":{"summary":"eur_jpy_non_publication_day_live_2026-08-18","value":{"data":{"base":"EUR","quote":"JPY","rate":"183.930000","rate_date":"2026-08-14","rate_kind":"reference","rate_derivation":"published","published_pairs_used":["EUR/JPY"],"note":"no fix on requested date (TARGET closing day); latest prior fix returned"},"meta":{"capability":"fx.reference_rate","version":"2.1.0","source":"ecb_fx","freshness":"near_live"}}}}}}},"400":{"description":"Invalid input (INVALID_INPUT)","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"401":{"description":"Authentication failed (AUTHENTICATION_REQUIRED, INVALID_API_KEY)","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"402":{"description":"Payment required (PAYMENT_REQUIRED, PAYMENT_FAILED, BUDGET_EXCEEDED, BILLING_REQUIRED). x402 challenge headers are attached.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"403":{"description":"Forbidden (PROJECT_DISABLED, CAPABILITY_NOT_ALLOWED)","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"404":{"description":"Not found (NOT_FOUND)","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"422":{"description":"Unprocessable (UNSUPPORTED_REGION, AMBIGUOUS_IDENTIFIER)","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"429":{"description":"Upstream rate limited (UPSTREAM_RATE_LIMITED)","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"500":{"description":"Internal error (INTERNAL_ERROR)","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"503":{"description":"Unavailable (UPSTREAM_UNAVAILABLE, CAPABILITY_UNAVAILABLE, LICENCE_RESTRICTED)","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}}},"security":[{"eckariApiKey":[]},{"x402":[]}],"x-payment-info":{"price":{"mode":"fixed","currency":"USD","amount":"0.002"},"protocols":[{"x402":{}}]},"x-eckari-capability":{"id":"fx.reference_rate","version":"2.1.0","lifecycle":"beta","pricing":{"currency":"USD","account":{"enabled":true,"unit_price":"0.0015"},"x402":{"enabled":true,"unit_price":"0.002"}},"discovery":{"title":"Get the official ECB reference exchange rate for a pair (accounting, invoicing, reporting)","description":"European Central Bank euro foreign exchange reference rate for a pair - the official daily fix used for accounting, invoicing and reporting - latest or any date in the last 90 days. The ECB publishes EUR/XXX only, so inverse and cross rates are computed from the same fix and named in rate_derivation. One fix per TARGET working day, not a tradable market rate.","use_when":["Convert or report an amount at an official daily rate both sides of a contract can verify against the ECB.","What is the ECB reference rate for EUR to USD?","You need the rate to put on an invoice, a ledger entry or a statutory report.","You need an official, auditable daily reference rate for reporting or accounting.","You need a historical reference rate from the last 90 days.","You need a cross rate such as GBP to USD derived from the ECB euro fix."],"do_not_use_when":["You need an executable, tradable, live or intraday market rate - this is a daily fix only.","You need cryptocurrency prices - not supported.","You need rates older than 90 days - not supported.","You need a currency the ECB does not publish (returns INVALID_INPUT).","If the user has asked you to inspect a specific website, page or URL, use your browsing tool instead — this capability only returns the ECB euro foreign exchange reference rates record."],"synonyms":["exchange rate","FX rate","ECB reference rate","euro reference rate","EUR USD rate","ECB fixing","daily FX fix","currency conversion rate","historical exchange rate 90 days","official exchange rate for accounting","eurofxref","reference rate for invoicing","central bank exchange rate","cross rate from euro fix"],"category":"foreign_exchange","region":null,"tags":["fx","ecb","exchange-rate","reference-rate","finance"]},"cache_policy":{"mode":"shared","ttl_seconds":3600,"stale_while_revalidate_seconds":300},"provenance":{"sources":["ecb_fx"],"freshness":"near_live"}}}},"/v1/locations/us/geocode":{"get":{"operationId":"location_us_geocode","summary":"Geocode a US street address (Census, TIGER interpolated)","description":"Convert a one-line US street address into coordinates using the US Census Bureau Geocoder. Returns the standardised matched address, latitude and longitude to 6 decimal places, the TIGER/Line segment and parsed address components. Coordinates are interpolated along street address ranges, not rooftop or parcel positions. No match is a normal answer, not an error.\n\n**Use when:**\n- Convert this US street address to latitude and longitude.\n- You need coordinates for a US address before looking up census geographies.\n- You want a standardised, parsed form of a messy US address string.\n- You are batching US addresses to approximate map positions.\n- Did the Census Bureau recognise this US address at all?\n\n**Do not use when:**\n- You need rooftop or parcel-level precision — Census coordinates are TIGER address-range interpolations.\n- You need USPS deliverability or ZIP validation — this is not a USPS service.\n- The address is outside the US and Puerto Rico — no match will be returned.\n- You already have coordinates and want census geographies — use location.us.geographies.\n- You need routing, driving directions or map tiles.\n- If the user has asked you to inspect a specific website, page or URL, use your browsing tool instead — this capability only returns the US Census Bureau Geocoding Services API record.","tags":["location"],"parameters":[{"name":"address","in":"query","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string","description":"One-line US street address including city and state, e.g. \"1600 Pennsylvania Ave NW, Washington, DC 20500\".","minLength":5,"maxLength":200},"description":"One-line US street address including city and state, e.g. \"1600 Pennsylvania Ave NW, Washington, DC 20500\"."},{"name":"limit","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"integer","description":"Maximum number of candidate matches to return, in the Census Bureau's own order. page.total always reports how many the Census Bureau returned in total, so a low limit never hides an ambiguous address.","minimum":1,"maximum":10,"default":5},"description":"Maximum number of candidate matches to return, in the Census Bureau's own order. page.total always reports how many the Census Bureau returned in total, so a low limit never hides an ambiguous address."},{"name":"offset","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"integer","description":"Zero-based index of the first candidate to return. The Census Bureau returns every match in one response, so paging is applied by Eckari over that set - pass page.next_offset to walk the remaining candidates without a second upstream lookup.","minimum":0,"default":0},"description":"Zero-based index of the first candidate to return. The Census Bureau returns every match in one response, so paging is applied by Eckari over that set - pass page.next_offset to walk the remaining candidates without a second upstream lookup."}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful capability result","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","required":["data","meta"],"properties":{"data":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/location_us_geocode_output"},"meta":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ResponseMeta"}}},"examples":{"white_house_live_2026-08-18":{"summary":"white_house_live_2026-08-18","value":{"data":{"query":{"address":"1600 Pennsylvania Ave NW, Washington, DC 20500"},"items":[{"matched_address":"1600 PENNSYLVANIA AVE NW, WASHINGTON, DC, 20500","lat":38.898699,"lon":-77.035188,"precision":"tiger_interpolated","tiger_line_id":"76225813","side":"L","address_components":{"from_address":"1600","to_address":"1648","street_name":"PENNSYLVANIA","pre_type":null,"pre_direction":null,"suffix_type":"AVE","suffix_direction":"NW","city":"WASHINGTON","state":"DC","zip":"20500"}}],"page":{"limit":1,"offset":0,"returned":1,"total":1,"has_more":false,"next_offset":null},"benchmark":"Public_AR_Current"},"meta":{"capability":"location.us.geocode","version":"3.0.0","source":"census_geocoder","freshness":"live"}}}}}}},"400":{"description":"Invalid input (INVALID_INPUT)","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"401":{"description":"Authentication failed (AUTHENTICATION_REQUIRED, INVALID_API_KEY)","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"402":{"description":"Payment required (PAYMENT_REQUIRED, PAYMENT_FAILED, BUDGET_EXCEEDED, BILLING_REQUIRED). x402 challenge headers are attached.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"403":{"description":"Forbidden (PROJECT_DISABLED, CAPABILITY_NOT_ALLOWED)","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"404":{"description":"Not found (NOT_FOUND)","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"422":{"description":"Unprocessable (UNSUPPORTED_REGION, AMBIGUOUS_IDENTIFIER)","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"429":{"description":"Upstream rate limited (UPSTREAM_RATE_LIMITED)","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"500":{"description":"Internal error (INTERNAL_ERROR)","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"503":{"description":"Unavailable (UPSTREAM_UNAVAILABLE, CAPABILITY_UNAVAILABLE, LICENCE_RESTRICTED)","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}}},"security":[{"eckariApiKey":[]},{"x402":[]}],"x-payment-info":{"price":{"mode":"fixed","currency":"USD","amount":"0.003"},"protocols":[{"x402":{}}]},"x-eckari-capability":{"id":"location.us.geocode","version":"3.0.0","lifecycle":"beta","pricing":{"currency":"USD","account":{"enabled":true,"unit_price":"0.002"},"x402":{"enabled":true,"unit_price":"0.003"}},"discovery":{"title":"Geocode a US street address (Census, TIGER interpolated)","description":"Convert a one-line US street address into coordinates using the US Census Bureau Geocoder. Returns the standardised matched address, latitude and longitude to 6 decimal places, the TIGER/Line segment and parsed address components. Coordinates are interpolated along street address ranges, not rooftop or parcel positions. No match is a normal answer, not an error.","use_when":["Convert this US street address to latitude and longitude.","You need coordinates for a US address before looking up census geographies.","You want a standardised, parsed form of a messy US address string.","You are batching US addresses to approximate map positions.","Did the Census Bureau recognise this US address at all?"],"do_not_use_when":["You need rooftop or parcel-level precision — Census coordinates are TIGER address-range interpolations.","You need USPS deliverability or ZIP validation — this is not a USPS service.","The address is outside the US and Puerto Rico — no match will be returned.","You already have coordinates and want census geographies — use location.us.geographies.","You need routing, driving directions or map tiles.","If the user has asked you to inspect a specific website, page or URL, use your browsing tool instead — this capability only returns the US Census Bureau Geocoding Services API record."],"synonyms":["us address geocoding","address to lat lon","geocode us address free","census geocoder","street address coordinates","address standardisation us","latitude longitude from address","forward geocoding united states","tiger line geocoding","address parsing us","locate us address","address match census","geocode api usa","address to coordinates"],"category":"location","region":"US","tags":["us","census","geocoding","address","location"],"related_capabilities":["location.us.geographies"]},"cache_policy":{"mode":"none"},"provenance":{"sources":["census_geocoder"],"freshness":"live"}}}},"/v1/locations/us/geographies":{"get":{"operationId":"location_us_geographies","summary":"Get US Census geographies for coordinates (state to ZCTA)","description":"Return the US Census Bureau geographies containing a latitude/longitude — state, county, census tract, block group, census block, incorporated place, congressional district and ZIP Code Tabulation Area — each with its FIPS or GEOID. The standard way to attach official US statistical geography to a point.\n\n**Use when:**\n- Which county and census tract is this coordinate in?\n- You need the FIPS codes for a US latitude/longitude.\n- What congressional district covers this location?\n- You are joining points to census tract or block group statistics.\n- You need the ZIP Code Tabulation Area containing a point.\n- You want to know which incorporated place a coordinate falls in.\n\n**Do not use when:**\n- You have an address rather than coordinates — use location.us.geocode first.\n- You need a USPS delivery ZIP code — ZCTAs are statistical approximations, not USPS ZIPs.\n- The coordinates are outside the US, DC, Puerto Rico and the US island areas.\n- You need demographic or economic values for the geography — this returns identifiers only.\n- If the user has asked you to inspect a specific website, page or URL, use your browsing tool instead — this capability only returns the US Census Bureau Geocoding Services API record.","tags":["location"],"parameters":[{"name":"lat","in":"query","required":true,"schema":{"type":"number","description":"Latitude in decimal degrees (WGS 84), e.g. 38.8977.","minimum":-90,"maximum":90},"description":"Latitude in decimal degrees (WGS 84), e.g. 38.8977."},{"name":"lon","in":"query","required":true,"schema":{"type":"number","description":"Longitude in decimal degrees (WGS 84), negative in the western hemisphere, e.g. -77.0365.","minimum":-180,"maximum":180},"description":"Longitude in decimal degrees (WGS 84), negative in the western hemisphere, e.g. -77.0365."}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful capability result","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","required":["data","meta"],"properties":{"data":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/location_us_geographies_output"},"meta":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ResponseMeta"}}},"examples":{"white_house_point_live_2026-08-18":{"summary":"white_house_point_live_2026-08-18","value":{"data":{"query":{"lat":38.8977,"lon":-77.0365},"state":{"fips":"11","name":"District of Columbia","usps":"DC"},"county":{"fips":"11001","name":"District of Columbia"},"tract":{"geoid":"11001980000","name":"Census Tract 9800"},"block_group":{"geoid":"110019800001"},"block":{"geoid":"110019800001034"},"place":{"geoid":"1150000","name":"Washington city"},"congressional_district":{"geoid":"1198","name":"Delegate District (at Large)"},"zcta":{"geoid":"20006"},"vintage":"Current_Current","benchmark":"Public_AR_Current"},"meta":{"capability":"location.us.geographies","version":"2.0.0","source":"census_geocoder","freshness":"live"}}}}}}},"400":{"description":"Invalid input (INVALID_INPUT)","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"401":{"description":"Authentication failed (AUTHENTICATION_REQUIRED, INVALID_API_KEY)","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"402":{"description":"Payment required (PAYMENT_REQUIRED, PAYMENT_FAILED, BUDGET_EXCEEDED, BILLING_REQUIRED). x402 challenge headers are attached.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"403":{"description":"Forbidden (PROJECT_DISABLED, CAPABILITY_NOT_ALLOWED)","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"404":{"description":"Not found (NOT_FOUND)","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"422":{"description":"Unprocessable (UNSUPPORTED_REGION, AMBIGUOUS_IDENTIFIER)","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"429":{"description":"Upstream rate limited (UPSTREAM_RATE_LIMITED)","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"500":{"description":"Internal error (INTERNAL_ERROR)","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"503":{"description":"Unavailable (UPSTREAM_UNAVAILABLE, CAPABILITY_UNAVAILABLE, LICENCE_RESTRICTED)","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}}},"security":[{"eckariApiKey":[]},{"x402":[]}],"x-payment-info":{"price":{"mode":"fixed","currency":"USD","amount":"0.003"},"protocols":[{"x402":{}}]},"x-eckari-capability":{"id":"location.us.geographies","version":"2.0.0","lifecycle":"beta","pricing":{"currency":"USD","account":{"enabled":true,"unit_price":"0.002"},"x402":{"enabled":true,"unit_price":"0.003"}},"discovery":{"title":"Get US Census geographies for coordinates (state to ZCTA)","description":"Return the US Census Bureau geographies containing a latitude/longitude — state, county, census tract, block group, census block, incorporated place, congressional district and ZIP Code Tabulation Area — each with its FIPS or GEOID. The standard way to attach official US statistical geography to a point.","use_when":["Which county and census tract is this coordinate in?","You need the FIPS codes for a US latitude/longitude.","What congressional district covers this location?","You are joining points to census tract or block group statistics.","You need the ZIP Code Tabulation Area containing a point.","You want to know which incorporated place a coordinate falls in."],"do_not_use_when":["You have an address rather than coordinates — use location.us.geocode first.","You need a USPS delivery ZIP code — ZCTAs are statistical approximations, not USPS ZIPs.","The coordinates are outside the US, DC, Puerto Rico and the US island areas.","You need demographic or economic values for the geography — this returns identifiers only.","If the user has asked you to inspect a specific website, page or URL, use your browsing tool instead — this capability only returns the US Census Bureau Geocoding Services API record."],"synonyms":["fips code lookup","county from coordinates","census tract lookup","census block lookup","zcta lookup","congressional district by lat lon","reverse geocode us census geography","geoid lookup","state county fips","block group identifier","statistical geography us","point in census tract","incorporated place lookup","us geography by coordinates"],"category":"location","region":"US","tags":["us","census","geography","fips","location"],"related_capabilities":["location.us.geocode"]},"cache_policy":{"mode":"none"},"provenance":{"sources":["census_geocoder"],"freshness":"live"}}}},"/v1/parcels/detect-carrier":{"get":{"operationId":"parcel_detect_carrier","summary":"Detect the carrier from a tracking number","description":"Identify which carrier issued a tracking number using a deterministic, versioned signature set - prefixes, lengths, carrier check digits and UPU S10 structure - returning the carrier, how distinctive the match is, every ranked candidate with typed evidence, and the parsed S10 details. No upstream call and no carrier account required.\n\n**Use when:**\n- Which carrier is this tracking number from?\n- You have a tracking number but no carrier and need to route the lookup.\n- You need to validate that a tracking number is well formed before storing it.\n- You need to disambiguate a numeric tracking number between several carriers.\n- You need to parse a UPU S10 international postal item id (service, serial, origin country).\n\n**Do not use when:**\n- You need tracking events, status or delivery estimates - not yet available.\n- You need to validate a postal address - not supported.\n- You need a guaranteed single answer - formats overlap, so several candidates can be returned.\n- The carrier is outside the covered set - named carrier formats are UPS, FedEx, USPS, DHL Express, DHL eCommerce, DPD, Amazon Logistics and Canada Post, plus any UPU S10 postal item whose origin country maps to a designated postal operator (Royal Mail, Deutsche Post, La Poste, PostNL, Australia Post, Canada Post, China Post, Japan Post, India Post and other national posts). Regional carriers such as Evri, Yodel, GLS, Poste-style local couriers and Chinese e-commerce lines are not covered.\n- You are treating an empty candidates list as \"invalid number\" - read formats_matched first - 0 means no covered format matched, above 0 means a covered format matched but its check digit failed.\n- If the user has asked you to inspect a specific website, page or URL, use your browsing tool instead — this capability only returns the Eckari carrier signature engine record.","tags":["logistics"],"parameters":[{"name":"tracking_number","in":"query","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string","description":"Tracking or consignment number. Spaces and hyphens are removed and letters upper-cased before matching (4-40 letters and digits after normalisation). Digits and letters are never altered.","minLength":4,"maxLength":60,"pattern":"^[A-Za-z0-9 -]+$"},"description":"Tracking or consignment number. Spaces and hyphens are removed and letters upper-cased before matching (4-40 letters and digits after normalisation). Digits and letters are never altered."},{"name":"origin_country","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"string","description":"Optional ISO 3166-1 alpha-2 origin country hint. Used only as a small tie-breaker; it never invents a candidate.","pattern":"^[A-Za-z]{2}$"},"description":"Optional ISO 3166-1 alpha-2 origin country hint. Used only as a small tie-breaker; it never invents a candidate."},{"name":"destination_country","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"string","description":"Optional ISO 3166-1 alpha-2 destination country hint. Used only as a small tie-breaker; it never invents a candidate.","pattern":"^[A-Za-z]{2}$"},"description":"Optional ISO 3166-1 alpha-2 destination country hint. Used only as a small tie-breaker; it never invents a candidate."}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful capability result","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","required":["data","meta"],"properties":{"data":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/parcel_detect_carrier_output"},"meta":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ResponseMeta"}}},"examples":{"ups_1z_synthetic_format_2026-08-18":{"summary":"ups_1z_synthetic_format_2026-08-18","value":{"data":{"carrier":{"id":"ups","name":"UPS"},"match_strength":"distinctive","match_score":0.98,"candidates":[{"carrier_id":"ups","carrier_name":"UPS","match_score":0.98,"match_strength":"distinctive","format_id":"ups_1z","evidence":{"prefix":"1Z","length":18,"check_digit":"ups_mod10","s10_origin_country":null,"country_hint":null}}],"input":{"original":"1Z 879E93 03 4683 4440","normalised":"1Z879E930346834440"},"formats_matched":1,"upu_s10":null,"signature_version":"1.1.0"},"meta":{"capability":"parcel.detect_carrier","version":"2.0.0","source":"eckari_carrier_signatures","freshness":"static"}}},"upu_s10_royal_mail_synthetic_format_2026-08-18":{"summary":"upu_s10_royal_mail_synthetic_format_2026-08-18","value":{"data":{"carrier":{"id":"royal_mail","name":"Royal Mail"},"match_strength":"distinctive","match_score":0.9,"candidates":[{"carrier_id":"royal_mail","carrier_name":"Royal Mail","match_score":0.9,"match_strength":"distinctive","format_id":"upu_s10","evidence":{"prefix":"RB","length":13,"check_digit":"upu_s10","s10_origin_country":"GB","country_hint":null}}],"input":{"original":"RB123456785GB","normalised":"RB123456785GB"},"formats_matched":1,"upu_s10":{"service_indicator":"RB","service_type":"letter_post_registered","serial":"12345678","check_digit_valid":true,"origin_country":"GB"},"signature_version":"1.1.0"},"meta":{"capability":"parcel.detect_carrier","version":"2.0.0","source":"eckari_carrier_signatures","freshness":"static"}}},"fedex_express_12_synthetic_format_2026-08-18":{"summary":"fedex_express_12_synthetic_format_2026-08-18","value":{"data":{"carrier":{"id":"fedex","name":"FedEx"},"match_strength":"weak","match_score":0.8,"candidates":[{"carrier_id":"fedex","carrier_name":"FedEx","match_score":0.8,"match_strength":"weak","format_id":"fedex_express_12","evidence":{"prefix":null,"length":12,"check_digit":"fedex_express_mod11","s10_origin_country":null,"country_hint":null}}],"input":{"original":"986578788855","normalised":"986578788855"},"formats_matched":1,"upu_s10":null,"signature_version":"1.1.0"},"meta":{"capability":"parcel.detect_carrier","version":"2.0.0","source":"eckari_carrier_signatures","freshness":"static"}}}}}}},"400":{"description":"Invalid input (INVALID_INPUT)","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"401":{"description":"Authentication failed (AUTHENTICATION_REQUIRED, INVALID_API_KEY)","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"402":{"description":"Payment required (PAYMENT_REQUIRED, PAYMENT_FAILED, BUDGET_EXCEEDED, BILLING_REQUIRED). x402 challenge headers are attached.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"403":{"description":"Forbidden (PROJECT_DISABLED, CAPABILITY_NOT_ALLOWED)","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"404":{"description":"Not found (NOT_FOUND)","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"422":{"description":"Unprocessable (UNSUPPORTED_REGION, AMBIGUOUS_IDENTIFIER)","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"429":{"description":"Upstream rate limited (UPSTREAM_RATE_LIMITED)","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"500":{"description":"Internal error (INTERNAL_ERROR)","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"503":{"description":"Unavailable (UPSTREAM_UNAVAILABLE, CAPABILITY_UNAVAILABLE, LICENCE_RESTRICTED)","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}}},"security":[{"eckariApiKey":[]},{"x402":[]}],"x-payment-info":{"price":{"mode":"fixed","currency":"USD","amount":"0.001"},"protocols":[{"x402":{}}]},"x-eckari-capability":{"id":"parcel.detect_carrier","version":"2.0.0","lifecycle":"beta","pricing":{"currency":"USD","account":{"enabled":true,"unit_price":"0.001"},"x402":{"enabled":true,"unit_price":"0.001"}},"discovery":{"title":"Detect the carrier from a tracking number","description":"Identify which carrier issued a tracking number using a deterministic, versioned signature set - prefixes, lengths, carrier check digits and UPU S10 structure - returning the carrier, how distinctive the match is, every ranked candidate with typed evidence, and the parsed S10 details. No upstream call and no carrier account required.","use_when":["Which carrier is this tracking number from?","You have a tracking number but no carrier and need to route the lookup.","You need to validate that a tracking number is well formed before storing it.","You need to disambiguate a numeric tracking number between several carriers.","You need to parse a UPU S10 international postal item id (service, serial, origin country)."],"do_not_use_when":["You need tracking events, status or delivery estimates - not yet available.","You need to validate a postal address - not supported.","You need a guaranteed single answer - formats overlap, so several candidates can be returned.","The carrier is outside the covered set - named carrier formats are UPS, FedEx, USPS, DHL Express, DHL eCommerce, DPD, Amazon Logistics and Canada Post, plus any UPU S10 postal item whose origin country maps to a designated postal operator (Royal Mail, Deutsche Post, La Poste, PostNL, Australia Post, Canada Post, China Post, Japan Post, India Post and other national posts). Regional carriers such as Evri, Yodel, GLS, Poste-style local couriers and Chinese e-commerce lines are not covered.","You are treating an empty candidates list as \"invalid number\" - read formats_matched first - 0 means no covered format matched, above 0 means a covered format matched but its check digit failed.","If the user has asked you to inspect a specific website, page or URL, use your browsing tool instead — this capability only returns the Eckari carrier signature engine record."],"synonyms":["which carrier is this tracking number","tracking number carrier lookup","identify courier from tracking id","UPS or FedEx or USPS tracking number","parcel carrier detection","shipment carrier inference","tracking number format validation","UPU S10","detect courier","tracking number check digit","courier identification","parcel number lookup","carrier from consignment number","postal item id parser"],"category":"logistics","region":null,"tags":["parcel","tracking","carrier","logistics","shipping"]},"cache_policy":{"mode":"none"},"provenance":{"sources":["eckari_carrier_signatures"],"freshness":"static"}}}},"/v1/weather/us/alerts":{"get":{"operationId":"weather_us_alerts","summary":"Get active US weather alerts for a point or state (NWS)","description":"Active National Weather Service watches, warnings and advisories for a US coordinate or a two-letter state or marine area code - event, severity, certainty, urgency, headline, affected areas and zone codes, and effective/onset/expiry times in UTC. Read at request time, so an empty list means nothing is active. The 5 newest come back by default; detail=full adds the NWS narrative.\n\n**Use when:**\n- Decide whether an active US weather warning affects a location before dispatching or travelling.\n- Are there any active weather warnings for this US location?\n- Is there a tornado warning, hurricane advisory or flood watch in this state?\n- You need severe weather alerts before dispatching a driver or crew.\n- You need alert severity, urgency and expiry to decide whether to act.\n- You need the official NWS alert text and safety instruction (detail=full).\n\n**Do not use when:**\n- You need the forecast rather than alerts - use weather.us.forecast.\n- You need measured conditions - use weather.us.observation.\n- The location is outside the United States and its territories (returns UNSUPPORTED_REGION).\n- You need historical alert archives or alert polygons - not supported.\n- If the user has asked you to inspect a specific website, page or URL, use your browsing tool instead — this capability only returns the US National Weather Service API record.","tags":["weather"],"parameters":[{"name":"lat","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"number","description":"Latitude in decimal degrees (WGS84). Provide lat and lon together, or provide state.","minimum":-90,"maximum":90},"description":"Latitude in decimal degrees (WGS84). Provide lat and lon together, or provide state."},{"name":"lon","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"number","description":"Longitude in decimal degrees (WGS84). Provide lat and lon together, or provide state.","minimum":-180,"maximum":180},"description":"Longitude in decimal degrees (WGS84). Provide lat and lon together, or provide state."},{"name":"state","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"string","description":"Two-letter US state, territory or NWS marine area code such as CA / TX / PR. Alternative to lat and lon; one of the two forms is required.","pattern":"^[A-Za-z]{2}$"},"description":"Two-letter US state, territory or NWS marine area code such as CA / TX / PR. Alternative to lat and lon; one of the two forms is required."},{"name":"limit","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"integer","description":"Maximum number of active alerts to return, in the order NWS returns them. The default of 5 keeps the answer compact - a busy state can have dozens of active alerts, each covering tens of zones - and page.total always reports how many are active, so nothing is hidden.","minimum":1,"maximum":50,"default":5},"description":"Maximum number of active alerts to return, in the order NWS returns them. The default of 5 keeps the answer compact - a busy state can have dozens of active alerts, each covering tens of zones - and page.total always reports how many are active, so nothing is hidden."},{"name":"offset","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"integer","description":"Zero-based index of the first alert to return, for paging through the active set with limit. The whole active set is read in one upstream request and returned in that order, so a window over it is consistent.","minimum":0,"default":0},"description":"Zero-based index of the first alert to return, for paging through the active set with limit. The whole active set is read in one upstream request and returned in that order, so a window over it is consistent."},{"name":"detail","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"string","enum":["compact","full"],"description":"compact (default) returns the fields an agent decides on. full adds the two NWS narrative members - description (the multi-paragraph WHAT/WHERE/WHEN/IMPACTS text, truncated at 2000 characters with description_truncated set) and instruction (the protective-action text) - which are written for a human reader and are several times the size of the rest of the alert.","default":"compact"},"description":"compact (default) returns the fields an agent decides on. full adds the two NWS narrative members - description (the multi-paragraph WHAT/WHERE/WHEN/IMPACTS text, truncated at 2000 characters with description_truncated set) and instruction (the protective-action text) - which are written for a human reader and are several times the size of the rest of the alert."}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful capability result","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","required":["data","meta"],"properties":{"data":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/weather_us_alerts_output"},"meta":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ResponseMeta"}}},"examples":{"no_active_alerts_live_2026-08-18":{"summary":"no_active_alerts_live_2026-08-18","value":{"data":{"query":{"lat":38.8977,"lon":-77.0365,"state":null,"detail":"compact"},"items":[],"page":{"limit":5,"offset":0,"returned":0,"total":0,"has_more":false,"next_offset":null}},"meta":{"capability":"weather.us.alerts","version":"4.0.0","source":"nws","freshness":"live"}}},"california_alerts_live_2026-08-18":{"summary":"california_alerts_live_2026-08-18","value":{"data":{"query":{"lat":null,"lon":null,"state":"CA","detail":"compact"},"items":[{"id":"urn:oid:2.49.0.1.840.0.a8683156cb82db0e8003892bfdae383a4b47aac7.001.1","event":"Heat Advisory","severity":"Moderate","certainty":"Likely","urgency":"Expected","status":"Actual","message_type":"Update","headline":"Heat Advisory issued August 18 at 1:46AM PDT until August 20 at 8:00PM PDT by NWS Los Angeles/Oxnard CA","area_description":"Cuyama Valley; Santa Clarita Valley; Southern Salinas Valley; San Luis Obispo County Interior Valleys; San Luis Obispo County Mountains; Santa Ynez Mountains Western Range; Santa Barbara County Interior Mountains; Calabasas and Agoura Hills; Western San Fernando Valley; Eastern San Fernando Valley; Santa Susana Mountains; Southern Ventura County Mountains; Western San Gabriel Mountains and Highway 14 Corridor; Eastern San Gabriel Mountains; Los Angeles County San Gabriel Valley","sender_name":"NWS Los Angeles/Oxnard CA","sent":"2026-08-18T08:46:00.000Z","effective":"2026-08-18T08:46:00.000Z","onset":"2026-08-18T17:00:00.000Z","expires":"2026-08-18T21:00:00.000Z","ends":"2026-08-21T03:00:00.000Z","affected_zones":["CAZ038","CAZ088","CAZ343","CAZ344","CAZ345","CAZ351","CAZ353","CAZ371","CAZ372","CAZ373","CAZ375","CAZ376","CAZ379","CAZ380","CAZ548"]},{"id":"urn:oid:2.49.0.1.840.0.9799ff32747581365f339f94b4eb95a243bc174d.001.1","event":"Extreme Heat Warning","severity":"Severe","certainty":"Likely","urgency":"Expected","status":"Actual","message_type":"Update","headline":"Extreme Heat Warning issued August 18 at 12:28AM MST until August 21 at 8:00PM MST by NWS Phoenix AZ","area_description":"Parker Valley; Kofa; Yuma; Central La Paz; Southeast Yuma County; Gila River Valley; Imperial County Southwest; Imperial County Southeast; Imperial County West; Imperial Valley; Palo Verde Valley; Chuckwalla Valley","sender_name":"NWS Phoenix AZ","sent":"2026-08-18T07:28:00.000Z","effective":"2026-08-18T07:28:00.000Z","onset":"2026-08-18T07:28:00.000Z","expires":"2026-08-18T22:30:00.000Z","ends":"2026-08-22T03:00:00.000Z","affected_zones":["AZZ530","AZZ531","AZZ532","AZZ533","AZZ535","AZZ536","CAZ562","CAZ565","CAZ566","CAZ567","CAZ569","CAZ570"]},{"id":"urn:oid:2.49.0.1.840.0.2978f7e62ee76edc96a722d181180795e8660bf9.001.1","event":"Extreme Heat Warning","severity":"Severe","certainty":"Likely","urgency":"Expected","status":"Actual","message_type":"Update","headline":"Extreme Heat Warning issued August 17 at 1:32PM PDT until August 21 at 8:00PM PDT by NWS Las Vegas NV","area_description":"Lake Havasu and Fort Mohave; Lake Mead - AZ side; Lake Mohave - AZ side; Hualapai Mountains; Northwest Deserts; Death Valley National Park; Eastern Mojave Desert, Including the Mojave National Preserve; Morongo Basin; Cadiz Basin; San Bernardino County-Upper Colorado River Valley; Northeast Clark County; Western Clark and Southern Nye County; Las Vegas Valley; Southern Clark County; Lake Mead - NV side; Lake Mohave - NV side","sender_name":"NWS Las Vegas NV","sent":"2026-08-17T20:32:00.000Z","effective":"2026-08-17T20:32:00.000Z","onset":"2026-08-18T17:00:00.000Z","expires":"2026-08-18T12:00:00.000Z","ends":"2026-08-22T03:00:00.000Z","affected_zones":["AZZ002","AZZ570","AZZ571","AZZ575","AZZ576","CAZ522","CAZ524","CAZ525","CAZ526","CAZ527","NVZ016","NVZ017","NVZ020","NVZ022","NVZ025","NVZ026"]}],"page":{"limit":5,"offset":0,"returned":3,"total":3,"has_more":false,"next_offset":null}},"meta":{"capability":"weather.us.alerts","version":"4.0.0","source":"nws","freshness":"live"}}},"california_alert_full_detail_live_2026-08-18":{"summary":"california_alert_full_detail_live_2026-08-18","value":{"data":{"query":{"lat":null,"lon":null,"state":"CA","detail":"full"},"items":[{"id":"urn:oid:2.49.0.1.840.0.a8683156cb82db0e8003892bfdae383a4b47aac7.001.1","event":"Heat Advisory","severity":"Moderate","certainty":"Likely","urgency":"Expected","status":"Actual","message_type":"Update","headline":"Heat Advisory issued August 18 at 1:46AM PDT until August 20 at 8:00PM PDT by NWS Los Angeles/Oxnard CA","area_description":"Cuyama Valley; Santa Clarita Valley; Southern Salinas Valley; San Luis Obispo County Interior Valleys; San Luis Obispo County Mountains; Santa Ynez Mountains Western Range; Santa Barbara County Interior Mountains; Calabasas and Agoura Hills; Western San Fernando Valley; Eastern San Fernando Valley; Santa Susana Mountains; Southern Ventura County Mountains; Western San Gabriel Mountains and Highway 14 Corridor; Eastern San Gabriel Mountains; Los Angeles County San Gabriel Valley","sender_name":"NWS Los Angeles/Oxnard CA","sent":"2026-08-18T08:46:00.000Z","effective":"2026-08-18T08:46:00.000Z","onset":"2026-08-18T17:00:00.000Z","expires":"2026-08-18T21:00:00.000Z","ends":"2026-08-21T03:00:00.000Z","affected_zones":["CAZ038","CAZ088","CAZ343","CAZ344","CAZ345","CAZ351","CAZ353","CAZ371","CAZ372","CAZ373","CAZ375","CAZ376","CAZ379","CAZ380","CAZ548"],"description":"* WHAT...High temperatures of 92 to 105 expected, with most areas\nseeing peak heat on Wednesday and Thursday. Low temperatures are\nexpected to range from the upper 60s to lower 70s at lower\nelevations to the mid 70s to lower 80s in the foothills and\nmountains.\n\n* WHERE...A portion of southwest California.\n\n* WHEN...From 10 AM this morning to 8 PM PDT Thursday.\n\n* IMPACTS...Hot temperatures may cause heat illnesses. Warmer than\nnormal low temperatures will add to the heat discomfort.\n\n* ADDITIONAL DETAILS...The heat advisory may need to be extended into\nFriday for portions of the forecast area, but there remains\nconsiderable uncertainty at this time.","description_truncated":false,"instruction":"Drink plenty of fluids, stay in an air-conditioned room, stay out of\nthe sun, and check up on relatives and neighbors.\n\nTake extra precautions when outside. Wear lightweight and loose\nfitting clothing. Try to limit strenuous activities to early morning\nor evening. Take action when you see symptoms of heat exhaustion and\nheat stroke."}],"page":{"limit":1,"offset":0,"returned":1,"total":3,"has_more":true,"next_offset":1}},"meta":{"capability":"weather.us.alerts","version":"4.0.0","source":"nws","freshness":"live"}}}}}}},"400":{"description":"Invalid input (INVALID_INPUT)","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"401":{"description":"Authentication failed (AUTHENTICATION_REQUIRED, INVALID_API_KEY)","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"402":{"description":"Payment required (PAYMENT_REQUIRED, PAYMENT_FAILED, BUDGET_EXCEEDED, BILLING_REQUIRED). x402 challenge headers are attached.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"403":{"description":"Forbidden (PROJECT_DISABLED, CAPABILITY_NOT_ALLOWED)","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"404":{"description":"Not found (NOT_FOUND)","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"422":{"description":"Unprocessable (UNSUPPORTED_REGION, AMBIGUOUS_IDENTIFIER)","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"429":{"description":"Upstream rate limited (UPSTREAM_RATE_LIMITED)","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"500":{"description":"Internal error (INTERNAL_ERROR)","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"503":{"description":"Unavailable (UPSTREAM_UNAVAILABLE, CAPABILITY_UNAVAILABLE, LICENCE_RESTRICTED)","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}}},"security":[{"eckariApiKey":[]},{"x402":[]}],"x-payment-info":{"price":{"mode":"fixed","currency":"USD","amount":"0.003"},"protocols":[{"x402":{}}]},"x-eckari-capability":{"id":"weather.us.alerts","version":"4.0.0","lifecycle":"beta","pricing":{"currency":"USD","account":{"enabled":true,"unit_price":"0.002"},"x402":{"enabled":true,"unit_price":"0.003"}},"discovery":{"title":"Get active US weather alerts for a point or state (NWS)","description":"Active National Weather Service watches, warnings and advisories for a US coordinate or a two-letter state or marine area code - event, severity, certainty, urgency, headline, affected areas and zone codes, and effective/onset/expiry times in UTC. Read at request time, so an empty list means nothing is active. The 5 newest come back by default; detail=full adds the NWS narrative.","use_when":["Decide whether an active US weather warning affects a location before dispatching or travelling.","Are there any active weather warnings for this US location?","Is there a tornado warning, hurricane advisory or flood watch in this state?","You need severe weather alerts before dispatching a driver or crew.","You need alert severity, urgency and expiry to decide whether to act.","You need the official NWS alert text and safety instruction (detail=full)."],"do_not_use_when":["You need the forecast rather than alerts - use weather.us.forecast.","You need measured conditions - use weather.us.observation.","The location is outside the United States and its territories (returns UNSUPPORTED_REGION).","You need historical alert archives or alert polygons - not supported.","If the user has asked you to inspect a specific website, page or URL, use your browsing tool instead — this capability only returns the US National Weather Service API record."],"synonyms":["weather warnings","severe weather alerts","tornado warning","hurricane advisory","flood watch","winter storm warning","extreme heat warning","NWS alerts","NOAA weather alerts","active weather advisories","storm warnings by state","weather alerts by lat lon","emergency weather notification US","watches warnings advisories"],"category":"weather","region":"US","tags":["weather","nws","alerts","us","severe-weather"],"related_capabilities":["weather.us.forecast","weather.us.observation"]},"cache_policy":{"mode":"none"},"provenance":{"sources":["nws"],"freshness":"live"}}}},"/v1/weather/us/forecast":{"get":{"operationId":"weather_us_forecast","summary":"Get the US weather forecast for coordinates (NWS)","description":"Official National Weather Service forecast for any US coordinate - six 12-hour day/night periods by default, or hourly - each with temperature in C and F, precipitation probability, a wind speed range in km/h, wind direction and a short forecast, plus the NWS issue time so an agent can judge its age. detail=full adds the narrative, icon, dewpoint and humidity. United States, its territories and coastal waters only.\n\n**Use when:**\n- What is the weather forecast for these US coordinates?\n- Will it rain in Washington DC tomorrow?\n- You need an hourly US forecast for the next 24-48 hours.\n- You need the official NOAA/NWS forecast rather than a modelled aggregation.\n- You need forecast temperatures and wind for a US delivery, event or site visit.\n- You need the forecast issue time for provenance.\n\n**Do not use when:**\n- You need the latest observed conditions and their age - use weather.us.observation.\n- You need active warnings, watches or advisories - use weather.us.alerts.\n- The location is outside the United States and its territories (returns UNSUPPORTED_REGION).\n- You need historical or climate data, radar imagery or model output - not supported.\n- If the user has asked you to inspect a specific website, page or URL, use your browsing tool instead — this capability only returns the US National Weather Service API record.","tags":["weather"],"parameters":[{"name":"lat","in":"query","required":true,"schema":{"type":"number","description":"Latitude in decimal degrees (WGS84). Rounded to 4 decimal places before the National Weather Service lookup.","minimum":-90,"maximum":90},"description":"Latitude in decimal degrees (WGS84). Rounded to 4 decimal places before the National Weather Service lookup."},{"name":"lon","in":"query","required":true,"schema":{"type":"number","description":"Longitude in decimal degrees (WGS84). Rounded to 4 decimal places before the National Weather Service lookup.","minimum":-180,"maximum":180},"description":"Longitude in decimal degrees (WGS84). Rounded to 4 decimal places before the National Weather Service lookup."},{"name":"hourly","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"boolean","description":"Return hourly periods instead of the default 12-hour day/night periods. Hourly periods have no name and, at detail=full, carry dewpoint and humidity.","default":false},"description":"Return hourly periods instead of the default 12-hour day/night periods. Hourly periods have no name and, at detail=full, carry dewpoint and humidity."},{"name":"period_limit","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"integer","description":"Maximum number of 12-hour day/night periods to return, soonest first. Applies when hourly is false; use hours for hourly forecasts. NWS issues 14 periods (7 days); the default of 6 is three days. Named period_limit, not periods, because periods is the returned series.","minimum":1,"maximum":14,"default":6},"description":"Maximum number of 12-hour day/night periods to return, soonest first. Applies when hourly is false; use hours for hourly forecasts. NWS issues 14 periods (7 days); the default of 6 is three days. Named period_limit, not periods, because periods is the returned series."},{"name":"hours","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"integer","description":"Number of hourly periods to return, soonest first. Applies when hourly is true; use period_limit for day/night forecasts.","minimum":1,"maximum":48,"default":24},"description":"Number of hourly periods to return, soonest first. Applies when hourly is true; use period_limit for day/night forecasts."},{"name":"detail","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"string","enum":["compact","full"],"description":"compact (default) returns the fields an agent acts on. full adds the NWS narrative (detailed_forecast), the icon URL, the trend note and, for hourly periods, dewpoint_c and humidity_pct.","default":"compact"},"description":"compact (default) returns the fields an agent acts on. full adds the NWS narrative (detailed_forecast), the icon URL, the trend note and, for hourly periods, dewpoint_c and humidity_pct."}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful capability result","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","required":["data","meta"],"properties":{"data":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/weather_us_forecast_output"},"meta":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ResponseMeta"}}},"examples":{"washington_dc_forecast_compact_live_2026-08-18":{"summary":"washington_dc_forecast_compact_live_2026-08-18","value":{"data":{"query":{"lat":38.8977,"lon":-77.0365,"hourly":false,"period_limit":6,"hours":null,"detail":"compact"},"location":{"city":"Washington","state":"DC","timezone":"America/New_York"},"updated_at":"2026-08-18T11:55:05.000Z","generated_at":"2026-08-18T12:03:31.000Z","valid_from":"2026-08-18T05:00:00.000Z","periods":[{"name":"Today","start_time":"2026-08-18T08:00:00-04:00","end_time":"2026-08-18T18:00:00-04:00","is_daytime":true,"temperature_c":31.11,"temperature_f":88,"precipitation_probability_pct":11,"wind_speed_range_kmh":{"min":4.83,"max":11.27},"wind_direction":"N","short_forecast":"Partly Sunny"},{"name":"Tonight","start_time":"2026-08-18T18:00:00-04:00","end_time":"2026-08-19T06:00:00-04:00","is_daytime":false,"temperature_c":21.67,"temperature_f":71,"precipitation_probability_pct":1,"wind_speed_range_kmh":{"min":1.61,"max":9.66},"wind_direction":"NW","short_forecast":"Partly Cloudy"},{"name":"Wednesday","start_time":"2026-08-19T06:00:00-04:00","end_time":"2026-08-19T18:00:00-04:00","is_daytime":true,"temperature_c":32.22,"temperature_f":90,"precipitation_probability_pct":0,"wind_speed_range_kmh":{"min":8.05,"max":8.05},"wind_direction":"W","short_forecast":"Sunny"},{"name":"Wednesday Night","start_time":"2026-08-19T18:00:00-04:00","end_time":"2026-08-20T06:00:00-04:00","is_daytime":false,"temperature_c":22.78,"temperature_f":73,"precipitation_probability_pct":19,"wind_speed_range_kmh":{"min":1.61,"max":8.05},"wind_direction":"SW","short_forecast":"Partly Cloudy then Slight Chance Showers And Thunderstorms"},{"name":"Thursday","start_time":"2026-08-20T06:00:00-04:00","end_time":"2026-08-20T18:00:00-04:00","is_daytime":true,"temperature_c":31.11,"temperature_f":88,"precipitation_probability_pct":70,"wind_speed_range_kmh":{"min":1.61,"max":9.66},"wind_direction":"N","short_forecast":"Showers And Thunderstorms Likely"},{"name":"Thursday Night","start_time":"2026-08-20T18:00:00-04:00","end_time":"2026-08-21T06:00:00-04:00","is_daytime":false,"temperature_c":21.11,"temperature_f":70,"precipitation_probability_pct":70,"wind_speed_range_kmh":{"min":1.61,"max":8.05},"wind_direction":"NE","short_forecast":"Showers And Thunderstorms Likely"}]},"meta":{"capability":"weather.us.forecast","version":"4.0.0","source":"nws","freshness":"near_live"}}},"washington_dc_forecast_full_detail_live_2026-08-18":{"summary":"washington_dc_forecast_full_detail_live_2026-08-18","value":{"data":{"query":{"lat":38.8977,"lon":-77.0365,"hourly":false,"period_limit":1,"hours":null,"detail":"full"},"location":{"city":"Washington","state":"DC","timezone":"America/New_York"},"updated_at":"2026-08-18T11:55:05.000Z","generated_at":"2026-08-18T12:03:31.000Z","valid_from":"2026-08-18T05:00:00.000Z","periods":[{"name":"Today","start_time":"2026-08-18T08:00:00-04:00","end_time":"2026-08-18T18:00:00-04:00","is_daytime":true,"temperature_c":31.11,"temperature_f":88,"precipitation_probability_pct":11,"wind_speed_range_kmh":{"min":4.83,"max":11.27},"wind_direction":"N","short_forecast":"Partly Sunny","temperature_trend":null,"dewpoint_c":null,"humidity_pct":null,"detailed_forecast":"Partly sunny, with a high near 88. North wind 3 to 7 mph.","icon":"https://api.weather.gov/icons/land/day/bkn?size=medium"}]},"meta":{"capability":"weather.us.forecast","version":"4.0.0","source":"nws","freshness":"near_live"}}}}}}},"400":{"description":"Invalid input (INVALID_INPUT)","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"401":{"description":"Authentication failed (AUTHENTICATION_REQUIRED, INVALID_API_KEY)","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"402":{"description":"Payment required (PAYMENT_REQUIRED, PAYMENT_FAILED, BUDGET_EXCEEDED, BILLING_REQUIRED). x402 challenge headers are attached.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"403":{"description":"Forbidden (PROJECT_DISABLED, CAPABILITY_NOT_ALLOWED)","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"404":{"description":"Not found (NOT_FOUND)","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"422":{"description":"Unprocessable (UNSUPPORTED_REGION, AMBIGUOUS_IDENTIFIER)","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"429":{"description":"Upstream rate limited (UPSTREAM_RATE_LIMITED)","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"500":{"description":"Internal error (INTERNAL_ERROR)","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"503":{"description":"Unavailable (UPSTREAM_UNAVAILABLE, CAPABILITY_UNAVAILABLE, LICENCE_RESTRICTED)","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}}},"security":[{"eckariApiKey":[]},{"x402":[]}],"x-payment-info":{"price":{"mode":"fixed","currency":"USD","amount":"0.003"},"protocols":[{"x402":{}}]},"x-eckari-capability":{"id":"weather.us.forecast","version":"4.0.0","lifecycle":"beta","pricing":{"currency":"USD","account":{"enabled":true,"unit_price":"0.002"},"x402":{"enabled":true,"unit_price":"0.003"}},"discovery":{"title":"Get the US weather forecast for coordinates (NWS)","description":"Official National Weather Service forecast for any US coordinate - six 12-hour day/night periods by default, or hourly - each with temperature in C and F, precipitation probability, a wind speed range in km/h, wind direction and a short forecast, plus the NWS issue time so an agent can judge its age. detail=full adds the narrative, icon, dewpoint and humidity. United States, its territories and coastal waters only.","use_when":["What is the weather forecast for these US coordinates?","Will it rain in Washington DC tomorrow?","You need an hourly US forecast for the next 24-48 hours.","You need the official NOAA/NWS forecast rather than a modelled aggregation.","You need forecast temperatures and wind for a US delivery, event or site visit.","You need the forecast issue time for provenance."],"do_not_use_when":["You need the latest observed conditions and their age - use weather.us.observation.","You need active warnings, watches or advisories - use weather.us.alerts.","The location is outside the United States and its territories (returns UNSUPPORTED_REGION).","You need historical or climate data, radar imagery or model output - not supported.","If the user has asked you to inspect a specific website, page or URL, use your browsing tool instead — this capability only returns the US National Weather Service API record."],"synonyms":["US weather forecast","National Weather Service forecast","NOAA forecast","weather.gov API","hourly forecast US","forecast by lat lon","weather forecast by coordinates","7 day forecast united states","rain chance forecast","temperature forecast US","wind forecast US","gridpoint forecast","us weather api","weather prediction united states"],"category":"weather","region":"US","tags":["weather","nws","forecast","us","geospatial"],"related_capabilities":["weather.us.observation","weather.us.alerts"]},"cache_policy":{"mode":"none"},"provenance":{"sources":["nws"],"freshness":"near_live"}}}},"/v1/weather/us/observation":{"get":{"operationId":"weather_us_observation","summary":"Get the latest US weather observation with its age (NWS)","description":"Latest surface observation from the nearest National Weather Service station to a US coordinate, with the station identity, the observation time (observed_at), its age in seconds and an is_stale flag. Station observations are reported roughly every 20-60 minutes, so this is the most recent measurement, not a real-time reading. Readings that fail the station's quality control are returned as null.\n\n**Use when:**\n- What was the most recently observed temperature at these US coordinates?\n- You need measured conditions (temperature, humidity, wind, pressure, visibility) with a timestamp.\n- You need to know how old the observation is before acting on it.\n- You need the reporting station id and distance for provenance.\n- You need observed cloud layers or visibility for an aviation or logistics decision.\n\n**Do not use when:**\n- You need a prediction rather than a measurement - use weather.us.forecast.\n- You need warnings, watches or advisories - use weather.us.alerts.\n- You need a guaranteed real-time reading; observations can be an hour old, so check age_seconds and is_stale.\n- The location is outside the United States and its territories (returns UNSUPPORTED_REGION).\n- If the user has asked you to inspect a specific website, page or URL, use your browsing tool instead — this capability only returns the US National Weather Service API record.","tags":["weather"],"parameters":[{"name":"lat","in":"query","required":true,"schema":{"type":"number","description":"Latitude in decimal degrees (WGS84). Rounded to 4 decimal places before the National Weather Service lookup.","minimum":-90,"maximum":90},"description":"Latitude in decimal degrees (WGS84). Rounded to 4 decimal places before the National Weather Service lookup."},{"name":"lon","in":"query","required":true,"schema":{"type":"number","description":"Longitude in decimal degrees (WGS84). Rounded to 4 decimal places before the National Weather Service lookup.","minimum":-180,"maximum":180},"description":"Longitude in decimal degrees (WGS84). Rounded to 4 decimal places before the National Weather Service lookup."}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful capability result","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","required":["data","meta"],"properties":{"data":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/weather_us_observation_output"},"meta":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ResponseMeta"}}},"examples":{"washington_dc_observation_live_2026-08-18":{"summary":"washington_dc_observation_live_2026-08-18","value":{"data":{"station":{"id":"KDCA","name":"Washington/Reagan National Airport, DC","distance_km":5.49},"observed_at":"2026-08-18T11:40:00.000Z","age_seconds":1451,"is_stale":false,"text_description":"Partly Cloudy","temperature_c":25,"temperature_f":77,"dewpoint_c":22,"relative_humidity_pct":83.45,"wind_speed_kmh":12.96,"wind_direction_deg":340,"wind_gust_kmh":null,"barometric_pressure_hpa":1011.85,"visibility_m":16093.44,"precipitation_last_hour_mm":null,"cloud_layers":[{"amount":{"code":"SCT","description":"scattered (3-4 oktas)"},"base_m":3352.8}]},"meta":{"capability":"weather.us.observation","version":"2.1.0","source":"nws","freshness":"near_live"}}}}}}},"400":{"description":"Invalid input (INVALID_INPUT)","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"401":{"description":"Authentication failed (AUTHENTICATION_REQUIRED, INVALID_API_KEY)","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"402":{"description":"Payment required (PAYMENT_REQUIRED, PAYMENT_FAILED, BUDGET_EXCEEDED, BILLING_REQUIRED). x402 challenge headers are attached.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"403":{"description":"Forbidden (PROJECT_DISABLED, CAPABILITY_NOT_ALLOWED)","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"404":{"description":"Not found (NOT_FOUND)","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"422":{"description":"Unprocessable (UNSUPPORTED_REGION, AMBIGUOUS_IDENTIFIER)","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"429":{"description":"Upstream rate limited (UPSTREAM_RATE_LIMITED)","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"500":{"description":"Internal error (INTERNAL_ERROR)","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"503":{"description":"Unavailable (UPSTREAM_UNAVAILABLE, CAPABILITY_UNAVAILABLE, LICENCE_RESTRICTED)","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}}},"security":[{"eckariApiKey":[]},{"x402":[]}],"x-payment-info":{"price":{"mode":"fixed","currency":"USD","amount":"0.003"},"protocols":[{"x402":{}}]},"x-eckari-capability":{"id":"weather.us.observation","version":"2.1.0","lifecycle":"beta","pricing":{"currency":"USD","account":{"enabled":true,"unit_price":"0.002"},"x402":{"enabled":true,"unit_price":"0.003"}},"discovery":{"title":"Get the latest US weather observation with its age (NWS)","description":"Latest surface observation from the nearest National Weather Service station to a US coordinate, with the station identity, the observation time (observed_at), its age in seconds and an is_stale flag. Station observations are reported roughly every 20-60 minutes, so this is the most recent measurement, not a real-time reading. Readings that fail the station's quality control are returned as null.","use_when":["What was the most recently observed temperature at these US coordinates?","You need measured conditions (temperature, humidity, wind, pressure, visibility) with a timestamp.","You need to know how old the observation is before acting on it.","You need the reporting station id and distance for provenance.","You need observed cloud layers or visibility for an aviation or logistics decision."],"do_not_use_when":["You need a prediction rather than a measurement - use weather.us.forecast.","You need warnings, watches or advisories - use weather.us.alerts.","You need a guaranteed real-time reading; observations can be an hour old, so check age_seconds and is_stale.","The location is outside the United States and its territories (returns UNSUPPORTED_REGION).","If the user has asked you to inspect a specific website, page or URL, use your browsing tool instead — this capability only returns the US National Weather Service API record."],"synonyms":["current weather US with observation time","latest weather observation","METAR observation","observed temperature united states","weather station reading","National Weather Service observation","NOAA observation","nearest weather station","measured conditions US","temperature right now US (latest observation)","humidity and wind observation","barometric pressure observation","visibility observation","weather.gov latest observation"],"category":"weather","region":"US","tags":["weather","nws","observation","us","station"],"related_capabilities":["weather.us.forecast","weather.us.alerts"]},"cache_policy":{"mode":"none"},"provenance":{"sources":["nws"],"freshness":"near_live"}}}}},"components":{"schemas":{"ErrorEnvelope":{"type":"object","required":["error"],"properties":{"error":{"type":"object","required":["code","message","request_id"],"properties":{"code":{"type":"string","enum":["INVALID_INPUT","AUTHENTICATION_REQUIRED","INVALID_API_KEY","PROJECT_DISABLED","CAPABILITY_NOT_ALLOWED","BUDGET_EXCEEDED","BILLING_REQUIRED","PAYMENT_REQUIRED","PAYMENT_FAILED","CAPABILITY_UNAVAILABLE","UPSTREAM_RATE_LIMITED","UPSTREAM_UNAVAILABLE","NOT_FOUND","AMBIGUOUS_IDENTIFIER","UNSUPPORTED_REGION","LICENCE_RESTRICTED","INTERNAL_ERROR"]},"message":{"type":"string"},"request_id":{"type":"string"},"details":{"type":["object","null"]}}}}},"ResponseMeta":{"type":"object","required":["capability","version","retrieved_at","source","freshness","request_id"],"properties":{"capability":{"type":"string"},"version":{"type":"string"},"retrieved_at":{"type":"string","format":"date-time"},"source":{"type":"string"},"freshness":{"type":"string","enum":["live","near_live","cached","static"]},"request_id":{"type":"string"},"attribution":{"type":"string","description":"Source licence attribution statement, present only when the executing provider's licence conditions re-use on acknowledging the source (e.g. Open Government Licence v3.0 for Companies House). Republish it verbatim with the data. Absent when the provider declares none (ADR-007)."},"attribution_url":{"type":"string","format":"uri","description":"Canonical https URL of the licence or attribution notice behind meta.attribution. Present only when the executing provider declares one; attribution never appears inside data (ADR-008 §1)."}}},"company_uk_accounts_output":{"type":"object","description":"Contains public sector information licensed under the Open Government Licence v3.0 (Companies House).","additionalProperties":false,"required":["company_number","company_name","has_accounts_information","accounting_reference_date","last_accounts","next_accounts"],"properties":{"company_number":{"type":"string"},"company_name":{"type":"string"},"has_accounts_information":{"type":"boolean","description":"Derived; false when the register holds no accounts block for this company."},"accounting_reference_date":{"type":["object","null"],"description":"The register's accounting reference date (ARD) as a day and month with no year: the anchor Companies House uses to derive a company's accounting periods and filing deadlines. It is not the same thing as the end date of any particular set of accounts — a company filing to a 52/53-week calendar may make its accounts up to any date within seven days either side of the ARD, so read last_accounts.made_up_to for the actual period end. TESCO PLC's ARD is 26 February while its last accounts were made up to 28 February 2026.","additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"day":{"type":["integer","null"]},"month":{"type":["integer","null"]}}},"last_accounts":{"type":["object","null"],"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"type":{"type":["string","null"],"description":"Register accounts type (e.g. full, small, micro-entity, dormant, group)."},"period_start_on":{"type":["string","null"],"format":"date"},"period_end_on":{"type":["string","null"],"format":"date"},"made_up_to":{"type":["string","null"],"format":"date"}}},"next_accounts":{"type":["object","null"],"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"period_start_on":{"type":["string","null"],"format":"date"},"period_end_on":{"type":["string","null"],"format":"date"},"due_on":{"type":["string","null"],"format":"date"},"is_overdue":{"type":["boolean","null"],"description":"The register's own overdue flag for the next accounts filing (true when due_on has passed without a filing)."}}}}},"company_uk_charges_output":{"type":"object","description":"Contains public sector information licensed under the Open Government Licence v3.0 (Companies House).","additionalProperties":false,"required":["company_number","query","outstanding_count","satisfied_count","part_satisfied_count","items","page"],"properties":{"company_number":{"type":"string"},"query":{"type":"object","description":"The resolved inputs, echoed because page.total depends on the status filter and the item shape depends on detail.","additionalProperties":false,"required":["status","detail"],"properties":{"status":{"type":"string","enum":["outstanding","satisfied","all"]},"detail":{"type":"string","enum":["summary","full"]}}},"outstanding_count":{"type":["integer","null"],"description":"Derived, register-wide: the register's total charge count minus its satisfied count — the charges it has not recorded as discharged, and the one number a credit decision wants. Part-satisfied charges are counted as outstanding because the security has not been fully released; part_satisfied_count reports them separately. That makes this equal to the public register's own \"Outstanding\" headline only when part_satisfied_count is 0; when it is not, this figure is larger by exactly that number, because the register lists part-satisfied charges under their own heading. Null when the register omits either count."},"satisfied_count":{"type":["integer","null"],"description":"Register-wide count of charges the register records as fully discharged (status satisfied or fully-satisfied). Not a count of the returned page."},"part_satisfied_count":{"type":["integer","null"],"description":"Register-wide count of charges the register records as partly discharged. These are also included in outstanding_count."},"items":{"type":"array","description":"Charges in the register's own order, filtered by the status filter in force.","items":{"type":"object","additionalProperties":false,"required":["id","charge_number","charge_code","status","is_outstanding","created_on","delivered_on","satisfied_on","classification","particulars","persons_entitled"],"properties":{"id":{"type":"string","description":"Stable identifier for the charge, taken from the register's own charge resource link (falling back to charge_code, then charge_number)."},"charge_number":{"type":"integer","description":"The register's per-company charge number."},"charge_code":{"type":["string","null"],"description":"The register's public charge code, shown on the public register for charges registered from 2013. Null for older charges, which are identified by charge_number."},"status":{"type":"string","description":"Companies House charge status. outstanding — registered and not discharged. part-satisfied — partly discharged, security still in force for the remainder. satisfied and fully-satisfied — both terminal: the register uses two keys for a fully discharged charge and the public register renders either as \"Satisfied\", so filtering on one alone gives the wrong answer. Use is_outstanding instead."},"is_outstanding":{"type":"boolean","description":"Derived; false when status is satisfied or fully-satisfied (the two terminal keys), true otherwise — including part-satisfied, where security remains in force. An unrecognised future status is reported as outstanding rather than silently discharged."},"created_on":{"type":["string","null"],"format":"date"},"delivered_on":{"type":["string","null"],"format":"date"},"satisfied_on":{"type":["string","null"],"format":"date"},"acquired_on":{"type":["string","null"],"format":"date","description":"Date the property or undertaking was acquired. Returned only when detail=full; the register populates it for acquisition filings only."},"resolved_on":{"type":["string","null"],"format":"date","description":"Date the register resolved an issue with the charge. Returned only when detail=full."},"assets_ceased_released":{"type":["string","null"],"description":"Register cease/release information (e.g. whole-property-released, part-property-ceased-to-belong), mapped from the register's misspelled member name. Returned only when detail=full; populated only where property has been released or has ceased to belong."},"more_than_four_persons_entitled":{"type":["boolean","null"],"description":"Register flag for a charge with more than four persons entitled, in which case persons_entitled lists the first four. Returned only when detail=full."},"classification":{"type":"array","description":"The register's classification of the charge.","items":{"type":"object","additionalProperties":false,"required":["type","description"],"properties":{"type":{"type":"string"},"description":{"type":"string"}}}},"particulars":{"type":"array","description":"What is charged, as the register describes it.","items":{"type":"object","additionalProperties":false,"required":["type","description","flags"],"properties":{"type":{"type":"string"},"description":{"type":"string"},"flags":{"type":"array","description":"The register's particulars flags that are set for this charge, in a fixed order: contains_fixed_charge, contains_floating_charge, floating_charge_covers_all, contains_negative_pledge, chargor_acting_as_bare_trustee. The register publishes each as true or omits it, so a flag absent from this list is one the register did not assert. Empty when it asserted none.","items":{"type":"string","enum":["contains_fixed_charge","contains_floating_charge","floating_charge_covers_all","contains_negative_pledge","chargor_acting_as_bare_trustee"]}}}}},"secured_details":{"type":"array","description":"What the charge secures, as the register describes it.","items":{"type":"object","additionalProperties":false,"required":["type","description"],"properties":{"type":{"type":"string"},"description":{"type":"string"}}}},"persons_entitled":{"type":"array","description":"The secured parties named on the register.","items":{"type":"object","additionalProperties":false,"required":["name"],"properties":{"name":{"type":"string"}}}}}}},"page":{"type":"object","additionalProperties":false,"required":["limit","offset","returned","total","has_more","next_offset"],"properties":{"limit":{"type":["integer","null"],"description":"The page size applied (the requested limit, default 3)."},"offset":{"type":"integer","description":"The register index this page started at (the requested offset)."},"returned":{"type":"integer","description":"Number of charges in this response."},"total":{"type":["integer","null"],"description":"Register-wide count of charges matching the status filter in force — the register's total charge count for status=all, outstanding_count for status=outstanding and satisfied_count for status=satisfied. Null when the register omits the count it is derived from. Never a count of this page."},"has_more":{"type":"boolean","description":"Authoritative end-of-list signal; true when charges matching the status filter remain beyond this page. items.length < limit is NOT a valid end-of-list test when a status filter is in force, because the filter is applied after the register read."},"next_offset":{"type":["integer","null"],"description":"Derived; the register index to pass as offset to continue after the last charge returned. Under a status filter this is the register index of the next matching charge and can be greater than offset + returned. Null exactly when has_more is false."}}}}},"company_uk_directors_output":{"type":"object","description":"Contains public sector information licensed under the Open Government Licence v3.0 (Companies House).","additionalProperties":false,"required":["company_number","query","officer_totals","items","page"],"properties":{"company_number":{"type":"string","description":"Normalised 8-character company number."},"query":{"type":"object","description":"The resolved filters, echoed because page.total depends on them.","additionalProperties":false,"required":["role","include_resigned"],"properties":{"role":{"type":"string","enum":["director","secretary","llp_member","all"]},"include_resigned":{"type":"boolean"}}},"officer_totals":{"type":"object","description":"The register's three officer buckets, register-wide and unaffected by the role filter, the resigned filter or paging. They sum to the register's total number of officer entries for the company. The register publishes no per-role count, which is why page.total is null whenever a role filter is in force.","additionalProperties":false,"required":["active","inactive","resigned"],"properties":{"active":{"type":"integer","description":"Officers in the register's active bucket. Not simply 'entries without a resignation date': when a company is dissolved or closed the register moves its serving officers into the inactive bucket and this becomes 0."},"inactive":{"type":["integer","null"],"description":"The register's third bucket — appointments that ended with the company rather than by resignation, which is where the officers of a dissolved or closed company are counted. Null when the register omits the member."},"resigned":{"type":"integer","description":"Officers the register records as resigned."}}},"items":{"type":"array","description":"Officer entries in the register's own order, filtered by role (default director). Resigned entries are omitted unless include_resigned is true; inactive entries (a dissolved company's officers) are always returned, because the register does not treat them as resigned.","items":{"type":"object","additionalProperties":false,"required":["name","role","officer_status","is_active","appointed_on","resigned_on"],"properties":{"name":{"type":"string","description":"Officer name as registered (surname-first for natural persons)."},"role":{"type":"string","description":"Companies House officer_role exactly as published (e.g. director, corporate-director, nominee-director, secretary, corporate-secretary, llp-member, llp-designated-member, managing-officer)."},"officer_status":{"type":"string","enum":["active","resigned","inactive"],"description":"Derived from the register's own three officer buckets: resigned when the entry carries a resignation date; inactive when it does not but the register reports no active officers and a non-zero inactive bucket (the appointment ended with a dissolved or closed company); otherwise active. It describes the register entry, not the company — check company.uk.status for the company's own state."},"is_active":{"type":"boolean","description":"Derived; true exactly when officer_status is active. It is NOT 'no resignation date recorded': an officer of a dissolved company has no resignation date and is not active."},"appointed_on":{"type":["string","null"],"format":"date"},"resigned_on":{"type":["string","null"],"format":"date"},"nationality":{"type":["string","null"]},"country_of_residence":{"type":["string","null"]},"occupation":{"type":["string","null"]},"date_of_birth":{"type":["object","null"],"description":"Month and year only, as published on the public register.","additionalProperties":false,"required":["month","year"],"properties":{"month":{"type":"integer"},"year":{"type":"integer"}}},"address":{"type":["object","null"],"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"care_of":{"type":["string","null"]},"premises":{"type":["string","null"]},"address_line_1":{"type":["string","null"]},"address_line_2":{"type":["string","null"]},"po_box":{"type":["string","null"]},"locality":{"type":["string","null"]},"region":{"type":["string","null"]},"postal_code":{"type":["string","null"]},"country":{"type":["string","null"]}}},"identification":{"type":["object","null"],"description":"Corporate officer identification where the officer is a corporate body.","additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"identification_type":{"type":["string","null"]},"legal_authority":{"type":["string","null"]},"legal_form":{"type":["string","null"]},"place_registered":{"type":["string","null"]},"registration_number":{"type":["string","null"]}}}}}},"page":{"type":"object","additionalProperties":false,"required":["limit","offset","returned","total","has_more","next_offset"],"properties":{"limit":{"type":["integer","null"],"description":"The page size applied (the requested limit, default 5)."},"offset":{"type":"integer","description":"The register index this page started at (the requested offset)."},"returned":{"type":"integer","description":"Number of officer entries in this response."},"total":{"type":["integer","null"],"description":"Register-wide count of officer entries matching the filters in force: the register's total when role=all and include_resigned=true, that total minus the resigned bucket when role=all and include_resigned=false, and null under any role filter — the register publishes no per-role count and Eckari will not invent one. Never a count of this page."},"has_more":{"type":"boolean","description":"Authoritative end-of-list signal; true when officers matching the current filters remain beyond this page — either because more matches were read than limit allows, or because the register list was not exhausted within the three-page read budget. items.length < limit is NOT a valid end-of-list test, and neither is comparing against officer_totals, which is register-wide."},"next_offset":{"type":["integer","null"],"description":"Derived; the register index to pass as offset to continue after the last officer returned. Because entries are filtered after the read, this is the register index of the next matching entry and can be greater than offset + returned. Null exactly when has_more is false."}}}}},"company_uk_filings_output":{"type":"object","description":"Contains public sector information licensed under the Open Government Licence v3.0 (Companies House).","additionalProperties":false,"required":["company_number","query","filing_history_status","is_filing_history_available","items","page"],"properties":{"company_number":{"type":"string"},"query":{"type":"object","description":"The resolved inputs, echoed because page.total depends on the category filter and the item shape depends on detail.","additionalProperties":false,"required":["category","detail"],"properties":{"category":{"type":["string","null"],"description":"The category filter actually applied (the normalised input value), or null when none was applied."},"detail":{"type":"string","enum":["summary","full"]}}},"filing_history_status":{"type":["string","null"],"description":"The register's own statement about this company's filing history, passed through unchanged (e.g. filing-history-available). It qualifies a short or empty list: without it, 'no filings match this filter' and 'the register holds no filing history for this company' look identical. Null when the register omits it."},"is_filing_history_available":{"type":["boolean","null"],"description":"Derived; true when filing_history_status is exactly filing-history-available (the only value the register enumerates), false when it reports some other status, and null when it omits the member — the register did not say, which is never reported as 'not available'."},"items":{"type":"array","description":"The register's own filing order, passed through unchanged — reverse chronological (most recent first) in practice. Eckari applies no sort of its own and guarantees no ordering; sort on date yourself if your logic depends on it.","items":{"type":"object","additionalProperties":false,"required":["transaction_id","date","category","type","description","description_source","annotations","has_document","document_url"],"properties":{"transaction_id":{"type":"string","description":"The register's identifier for this filing; it appears in document_url."},"date":{"type":"string","format":"date","description":"Date the filing was processed by the register."},"category":{"type":"string"},"subcategory":{"type":["string","null"]},"type":{"type":"string","description":"Register filing type code (e.g. AA, CS01, AP01, TM01)."},"description":{"type":"string","description":"Human-readable description of the filing, rendered from the Companies House filing_history_descriptions enumeration with the register's own description_values merged in (e.g. \"Confirmation statement made on 2026-06-18 with no updates\"). Never invented: an unrecognised key is rendered as a readable form of the key itself and flagged by description_source. Registrar annotations are NOT merged into this text — read annotations[] as well to see everything the register shows for the filing."},"description_source":{"type":"string","enum":["enumeration","fallback"],"description":"\"enumeration\" when the register's description key matched the published Companies House enumeration; \"fallback\" when it did not and the key itself (or the register's own free text) was made readable."},"description_key":{"type":"string","description":"Raw register description key for the filing (e.g. capital-return-purchase-own-shares), stable for machine matching. Returned only when detail=full."},"description_values":{"type":["object","null"],"description":"Placeholder values supplied by the register for the description template (dates, officer names, addresses, capital figures). Passed through unmodified; null when the register supplies none. Returned only when detail=full — `description` already carries them merged in."},"annotations":{"type":"array","description":"Registrar annotations attached to this filing, verbatim and in register order; empty when there are none. The register renders them beneath the filing's own description (e.g. \"Purchase of own shares. ANNOTATION Clarification …\"), so a consumer reading description alone is not reading what the register says about the filing. Annotations are the registrar's after-the-fact clarifications and corrections.","items":{"type":"object","additionalProperties":false,"required":["annotation","date","description"],"properties":{"annotation":{"type":"string","description":"The annotation text as published by the register."},"date":{"type":["string","null"],"format":"date","description":"The date the annotation was added, as a date. The register publishes it as a midnight timestamp; only the date part is a fact, so only the date is returned. Null when the register omits it."},"description":{"type":["string","null"],"description":"The register's own description key for the annotation entry (e.g. annotation). Null when the register omits it."}}}},"pages":{"type":["integer","null"]},"paper_filed":{"type":["boolean","null"]},"has_document":{"type":"boolean","description":"Derived; true when the register exposes document metadata for this filing, meaning a filed image exists on the Companies House document service. document_url is then the address to fetch it from."},"document_url":{"type":["string","null"],"format":"uri","description":"Derived; the Companies House public register URL for the filed document (https://find-and-update.company-information.service.gov.uk/company/{company_number}/filing-history/{transaction_id}/document?format=pdf). Null exactly when has_document is false. Eckari does not proxy, host or charge for the document itself; fetching it is a separate, free request to Companies House under the same OGL terms."}}}},"page":{"type":"object","additionalProperties":false,"required":["limit","offset","returned","total","has_more","next_offset"],"properties":{"limit":{"type":["integer","null"],"description":"The page size applied (the requested limit, default 5)."},"offset":{"type":"integer","description":"The register index this page started at (the requested offset)."},"returned":{"type":"integer","description":"Number of filings in this response."},"total":{"type":["integer","null"],"description":"Register-wide count of filings for the applied category filter — read it together with query.category, which is why the filter is echoed. Never a count of this page."},"has_more":{"type":"boolean","description":"Authoritative end-of-list signal; true when further filings remain beyond this page for the applied filter."},"next_offset":{"type":["integer","null"],"description":"The offset to request next. Null exactly when has_more is false."}}}}},"company_uk_owners_output":{"type":"object","description":"Contains public sector information licensed under the Open Government Licence v3.0 (Companies House).","additionalProperties":false,"required":["company_number","query","active_count","ceased_count","items","page","statements","active_statement_count","exemptions","ownership_status"],"properties":{"company_number":{"type":"string"},"query":{"type":"object","description":"The resolved filter, echoed because page.total depends on it.","additionalProperties":false,"required":["include_ceased"],"properties":{"include_ceased":{"type":"boolean"}}},"active_count":{"type":"integer","description":"Register-wide count of PSC entries with no cessation date. Not a count of the returned page."},"ceased_count":{"type":"integer","description":"Register-wide count of ceased PSC entries. Not a count of the returned page."},"items":{"type":"array","description":"PSC entries in the register's own order. Ceased entries are omitted unless include_ceased is true.","items":{"type":"object","additionalProperties":false,"required":["name","kind","is_active","notified_on","ceased_on","natures_of_control","is_sanctioned"],"properties":{"name":{"type":["string","null"],"description":"PSC name as published. Null only for super-secure entries, where the register withholds the individual's particulars."},"kind":{"type":["string","null"],"description":"PSC kind (e.g. individual-person-with-significant-control, corporate-entity-person-with-significant-control, legal-person-with-significant-control, super-secure-person-with-significant-control, or the *-beneficial-owner variants for registered overseas entities)."},"is_active":{"type":"boolean","description":"Derived; true when the register records no cessation date for this PSC entry. It describes the entry, not the company — a dissolved company can still carry a PSC entry with no cessation date, so check company.uk.status for the company's own state."},"notified_on":{"type":["string","null"],"format":"date"},"ceased_on":{"type":["string","null"],"format":"date"},"natures_of_control":{"type":"array","description":"How this person or entity controls the company, in the register's own order — one entry per nature of control, each carrying the register code and its official text. Empty when the register lists none.","items":{"type":"object","additionalProperties":false,"required":["code","description"],"properties":{"code":{"type":"string","description":"Companies House natures_of_control code exactly as published (e.g. ownership-of-shares-75-to-100-percent, voting-rights-25-to-50-percent, right-to-appoint-and-remove-directors, significant-influence-or-control). The stable key for machine matching."},"description":{"type":"string","description":"Official Companies House text for the code, from the register's published psc_descriptions enumeration (e.g. \"The person holds, directly or indirectly, more than 75% of the shares in the company.\"). An unrecognised future code echoes back as its own description; never invented."}}}},"nationality":{"type":["string","null"]},"country_of_residence":{"type":["string","null"]},"date_of_birth":{"type":["object","null"],"additionalProperties":false,"required":["month","year"],"properties":{"month":{"type":"integer"},"year":{"type":"integer"}}},"address":{"type":["object","null"],"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"care_of":{"type":["string","null"]},"premises":{"type":["string","null"]},"address_line_1":{"type":["string","null"]},"address_line_2":{"type":["string","null"]},"po_box":{"type":["string","null"]},"locality":{"type":["string","null"]},"region":{"type":["string","null"]},"postal_code":{"type":["string","null"]},"country":{"type":["string","null"]}}},"identification":{"type":["object","null"],"description":"Corporate/legal-person identification where applicable.","additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"legal_authority":{"type":["string","null"]},"legal_form":{"type":["string","null"]},"place_registered":{"type":["string","null"]},"registration_number":{"type":["string","null"]},"country_registered":{"type":["string","null"]}}},"is_sanctioned":{"type":["boolean","null"],"description":"Register-declared flag, passed through unchanged. Companies House only ever populates it for beneficial owners on the Register of Overseas Entities, where the filer declares whether the person is designated under UK sanctions legislation; it is null for every other PSC entry and null does NOT mean 'not sanctioned'. This is NOT a sanctions screening result: Eckari runs no screening, checks no list and infers nothing. Screen against an authoritative sanctions source before relying on it."}}}},"statements":{"type":"array","description":"PSC statements filed against the company — the register's own explanation of why a PSC entry is absent or incomplete (no registrable person, PSC not identified, restrictions notice, super-secure, and the Register of Overseas Entities beneficial-owner statements). Ceased statements are omitted unless include_ceased is true. This collection is fetched whole, not paged by limit/offset, so ownership_status does not drift between pages.","items":{"type":"object","additionalProperties":false,"required":["statement","description","notified_on","ceased_on","linked_psc_name"],"properties":{"statement":{"type":"string","description":"Companies House statement key (e.g. no-individual-or-entity-with-signficant-control, psc-exists-but-not-identified, restrictions-notice-issued-to-psc, no-beneficial-owner-identified)."},"description":{"type":"string","description":"Official statement text from the Companies House psc_descriptions enumeration. Falls back to the raw key when the register publishes a key we do not yet carry; never invented."},"notified_on":{"type":["string","null"],"format":"date"},"ceased_on":{"type":["string","null"],"format":"date"},"linked_psc_name":{"type":["string","null"],"description":"Name of the PSC the statement refers to, where the register links one."}}}},"active_statement_count":{"type":"integer","description":"Number of statements with no cessation date. Unaffected by include_ceased."},"page":{"type":"object","additionalProperties":false,"required":["limit","offset","returned","total","has_more","next_offset"],"properties":{"limit":{"type":["integer","null"],"description":"The page size applied (the requested limit, default 10)."},"offset":{"type":"integer","description":"The register index this page started at (the requested offset)."},"returned":{"type":"integer","description":"Number of PSC entries in this response."},"total":{"type":["integer","null"],"description":"Register-wide count of PSC entries matching the filter in force: the register's total when include_ceased is true, and its active count when it is false. Never a count of this page."},"has_more":{"type":"boolean","description":"Authoritative end-of-list signal; true when PSC entries matching the current filter remain beyond this page — either because more matches were read than limit allows, or because the register list was not exhausted within the three-page read budget. items.length < limit is NOT a valid end-of-list test, and neither is comparing against active_count or ceased_count, which are register-wide."},"next_offset":{"type":["integer","null"],"description":"Derived; the register index to pass as offset to continue after the last PSC returned. Because ceased entries are filtered after the read, this is the register index of the next matching entry and can be greater than offset + returned. Null exactly when has_more is false."}}},"exemptions":{"type":"array","description":"PSC exemptions recorded against the company. This is where the register records a listed company's exemption from the PSC regime (DTR5 / voting shares admitted to a regulated market) — it is a separate register collection from statements, and it is the reason a listed PLC discloses no PSC. Historic (closed) exemptions are returned too, flagged by is_current false.","items":{"type":"object","additionalProperties":false,"required":["exemption_type","description","exempt_from","exempt_to","is_current"],"properties":{"exemption_type":{"type":"string","description":"Companies House exemption key (e.g. psc-exempt-as-trading-on-uk-regulated-market, disclosure-transparency-rules-chapter-five-applies)."},"description":{"type":"string","description":"Official exemption text from the Companies House exemption_descriptions enumeration. Falls back to the raw key when unknown; never invented."},"exempt_from":{"type":["string","null"],"format":"date"},"exempt_to":{"type":["string","null"],"description":"Date the exemption ended; null while it remains in force., format: date"},"is_current":{"type":"boolean","description":"Derived; true when the register records no end date for the exemption."}}}},"ownership_status":{"type":"string","description":"Single derived answer to \"does this company disclose owners, and if not, why not?\". Precedence, highest first. (1) pscs_listed — at least one active PSC entry is listed in items (this also covers the Register of Overseas Entities statement all-beneficial-owners-identified, which is meaningful only alongside listed entries). (2) exempt_listed_company — a current PSC exemption, or an active statement whose key starts psc-exempt-. (3) no_psc_declared — an active statement no-individual-or-entity-with-signficant-control (or its -partnership form), or the Register of Overseas Entities statement no-beneficial-owner-identified: the entity positively declares it has no registrable person. (4) psc_not_identified — an active statement saying an owner exists but the register does not (yet) identify them: psc-exists-but-not-identified, psc-details-not-confirmed, steps-to-find-psc-not-yet-completed, psc-contacted-but-no-response, psc-has-failed-to-confirm-changed-details, restrictions-notice-issued-to-psc, awaiting-confirmation-from-psc, their -partnership forms, the Register of Overseas Entities keys at-least-one-beneficial-owner-unidentified and information-not-provided-for-at-least-one-beneficial-owner (and the combined form), and all-beneficial-owners-identified filed with no PSC entry on the register. (5) super_secure — an active super-secure statement, or an active PSC entry the register marks super-secure, where the individual's particulars are withheld. (6) no_information — the register holds no PSC entry, no active statement and no exemption at all. Any other active statement key, including one the register publishes in future, is reported as psc_not_identified, so no_information is never returned while the register is explaining itself. An empty items list never on its own means the company has no owner. Paging caveat: for a company whose every active PSC entry is super-secure, a page that skips past those entries reports pscs_listed rather than super_secure — both are truthful (the entry is listed), and no page can turn a company with disclosed PSCs into super_secure.","enum":["pscs_listed","exempt_listed_company","no_psc_declared","psc_not_identified","super_secure","no_information"]}}},"company_uk_profile_output":{"type":"object","description":"Contains public sector information licensed under the Open Government Licence v3.0 (Companies House).","additionalProperties":false,"required":["company_number","company_name","status","is_active","is_striking_off","type","date_of_creation","sic_codes","registered_office_address","registered_office_single_line","previous_company_names","resources"],"properties":{"company_number":{"type":"string"},"company_name":{"type":"string"},"status":{"type":["string","null"],"description":"Companies House company_status (e.g. active, dissolved, liquidation, administration, receivership, voluntary-arrangement, registered, removed, closed, open). Null when the register publishes none for the record."},"status_detail":{"type":["string","null"],"description":"Companies House company_status_detail where present (e.g. active-proposal-to-strike-off, transferred-from-uk, transformed-to-se, converted-to-plc)."},"is_active":{"type":"boolean","description":"Derived by the same rule as company.uk.status, so the cheap check and the full profile can never disagree: true when status is one of active, open or registered — the three values the register uses for an entity still live on it. It is a liveness flag, not a good-standing flag, and it is false when the register publishes no status for the record."},"is_striking_off":{"type":"boolean","description":"Derived; true when status_detail is exactly active-proposal-to-strike-off (the registrar has published a proposal to strike the company off the register). Same rule as company.uk.status."},"type":{"type":"string","description":"Companies House company type (e.g. ltd, plc, llp)."},"subtype":{"type":["string","null"]},"jurisdiction":{"type":["string","null"]},"date_of_creation":{"type":["string","null"],"format":"date"},"date_of_cessation":{"type":["string","null"],"format":"date"},"can_file":{"type":["boolean","null"]},"undeliverable_registered_office_address":{"type":["boolean","null"]},"registered_office_is_in_dispute":{"type":["boolean","null"]},"sic_codes":{"type":"array","description":"The register's SIC codes for the company, each decoded against the condensed UK SIC 2007 list Companies House publishes (config/data/uk-sic-2007.json, 731 codes). Empty when the register holds none.","items":{"type":"object","additionalProperties":false,"required":["code","description"],"properties":{"code":{"type":"string","description":"Register SIC code exactly as published (five digits for SIC 2007; historic records can still carry a four-digit SIC 2003 code)."},"description":{"type":["string","null"],"description":"Official Companies House text for the code. Null — never a guess, and never text borrowed from another classification — when the code is not in the UK SIC 2007 condensed list, which in practice means a legacy SIC 2003 code on a historic record."}}}},"registered_office_address":{"type":["object","null"],"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"care_of":{"type":["string","null"]},"premises":{"type":["string","null"]},"address_line_1":{"type":["string","null"]},"address_line_2":{"type":["string","null"]},"po_box":{"type":["string","null"]},"locality":{"type":["string","null"]},"region":{"type":["string","null"]},"postal_code":{"type":["string","null"]},"country":{"type":["string","null"]}}},"registered_office_single_line":{"type":"string","description":"Derived; the registered office rendered on one line by the same deterministic renderer company.uk.registered_office uses, so the two capabilities always agree. Format: the non-empty parts joined with \", \" in the order premises + address_line_1 (themselves joined by a space), address_line_2, locality, region, postal_code, country. Empty string when the register holds no address. It is a normalised rendering and is not byte-comparable with the register's own address_snippet in company.uk.search, which places country before the postcode."},"previous_company_names":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"object","additionalProperties":false,"required":["name","effective_from","ceased_on"],"properties":{"name":{"type":"string"},"effective_from":{"type":"string","format":"date"},"ceased_on":{"type":"string","format":"date"}}}},"confirmation_statement":{"type":["object","null"],"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"last_made_up_to":{"type":["string","null"],"format":"date"},"next_due":{"type":["string","null"],"format":"date"},"next_made_up_to":{"type":["string","null"],"format":"date"},"is_overdue":{"type":["boolean","null"],"description":"The register's own overdue flag for the next confirmation statement."}}},"accounts":{"type":["object","null"],"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"accounting_reference_date":{"type":["object","null"],"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"day":{"type":["integer","null"]},"month":{"type":["integer","null"]}}},"last_accounts":{"type":["object","null"],"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"type":{"type":["string","null"]},"period_start_on":{"type":["string","null"],"format":"date"},"period_end_on":{"type":["string","null"],"format":"date"},"made_up_to":{"type":["string","null"],"format":"date"}}},"next_accounts":{"type":["object","null"],"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"period_start_on":{"type":["string","null"],"format":"date"},"period_end_on":{"type":["string","null"],"format":"date"},"due_on":{"type":["string","null"],"format":"date"},"is_overdue":{"type":["boolean","null"],"description":"The register's own overdue flag for the next accounts filing."}}}}},"resources":{"type":"object","description":"Which related registers exist for this company (derived from the register's resource links). Use it to decide which further capability is worth calling. This block is also the deliberate replacement for the register's three deprecated profile booleans: has_charges (→ resources.charges, and company.uk.charges for the detail), has_insolvency_history and has_been_liquidated (→ resources.insolvency). Companies House marks all three deprecated and directs consumers to the links these flags are derived from, so Eckari does not surface them (ADR-004); their absence is a decision, not an omission.","additionalProperties":false,"required":["officers","persons_with_significant_control","persons_with_significant_control_statements","persons_with_significant_control_exemptions","filing_history","charges","insolvency"],"properties":{"officers":{"type":"boolean"},"persons_with_significant_control":{"type":"boolean","description":"True when the register exposes any ownership resource for this company — the PSC list, the PSC statements collection or the PSC exemptions collection. company.uk.owners answers all three, and an exempt listed company such as TESCO PLC has no PSC list but does have an exemption, so a flag derived from the PSC list alone would route an agent away from the answer."},"persons_with_significant_control_statements":{"type":"boolean","description":"True when the register exposes the PSC statements collection — the company's own filed explanation of why a PSC entry is absent."},"persons_with_significant_control_exemptions":{"type":"boolean","description":"True when the register exposes the PSC exemptions collection — where a listed company's exemption from the PSC regime is recorded."},"filing_history":{"type":"boolean"},"charges":{"type":"boolean","description":"True when the register exposes a charges resource for this company — the live replacement for the register's deprecated has_charges flag. Read the charges themselves with company.uk.charges."},"insolvency":{"type":"boolean","description":"True when the register exposes an insolvency resource for this company — the live replacement for the register's deprecated has_insolvency_history and has_been_liquidated flags. Eckari does not yet publish the insolvency detail itself (ADR-004)."}}}}},"company_uk_registered_office_output":{"type":"object","description":"Contains public sector information licensed under the Open Government Licence v3.0 (Companies House).","additionalProperties":false,"required":["company_number","company_name","address","single_line"],"properties":{"company_number":{"type":"string"},"company_name":{"type":"string","description":"Registered company name, so the address is self-describing without a second call."},"address":{"type":"object","description":"The register's address components, passed through unchanged. Byte-identical to registered_office_address in company.uk.profile: both are read from the same register document, so the two capabilities can be compared field by field and can never disagree.","additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"care_of":{"type":["string","null"],"description":"Register c/o line (an agent or occupier the post is addressed via). A routing instruction rather than part of the premises, so it is deliberately excluded from single_line — include it yourself when addressing correspondence."},"po_box":{"type":["string","null"],"description":"Register PO box. Like care_of, a routing instruction and deliberately excluded from single_line."},"premises":{"type":["string","null"]},"address_line_1":{"type":["string","null"]},"address_line_2":{"type":["string","null"]},"locality":{"type":["string","null"]},"region":{"type":["string","null"]},"postal_code":{"type":["string","null"]},"country":{"type":["string","null"]}}},"single_line":{"type":"string","description":"Derived by Eckari's single deterministic address renderer, which company.uk.profile also uses for registered_office_single_line, so the two capabilities always agree. Format: the non-empty parts joined with \", \" in the order premises + address_line_1 (themselves joined by a space), address_line_2, locality, region, postal_code, country. care_of and po_box are excluded by design — they are routing instructions, not the address of the premises — so read them from address when addressing correspondence. Empty string when the register holds no address. It is a normalised rendering for display and fuzzy matching, and is not byte-comparable with the register's own address_snippet in company.uk.search, which places country before the postcode."}}},"company_uk_search_output":{"type":"object","description":"Contains public sector information licensed under the Open Government Licence v3.0 (Companies House).","additionalProperties":false,"required":["query","items","page"],"properties":{"query":{"type":"object","description":"The resolved search input, echoed so a logged or cached response is self-describing.","additionalProperties":false,"required":["q"],"properties":{"q":{"type":"string","description":"The search term actually sent to the register."}}},"items":{"type":"array","description":"Matching companies in the register's own result order.","items":{"type":"object","additionalProperties":false,"required":["match_rank","company_number","company_name","status","is_active","type","date_of_creation","date_of_cessation","address_snippet"],"properties":{"match_rank":{"type":"integer","minimum":1,"description":"Derived; the 1-based position of this item in the register's own result ordering, continuing across pages (offset + index + 1). It records where the register placed the result and is NOT a relevance, confidence or similarity score — Eckari does not compute one. Rank 1 is not a guarantee of an exact name match."},"company_number":{"type":"string","description":"Companies House company number; pass it as company_number to every other company.uk.* capability."},"company_name":{"type":"string","description":"Registered name as published by the register."},"status":{"type":["string","null"],"description":"Companies House company_status for the result. Companies use active, dissolved, liquidation, administration, receivership, voluntary-arrangement, insolvency-proceedings and converted-closed; UK establishments (BR…) use open and closed; registered overseas entities (OE…) use registered and removed. Null when the register omits it."},"is_active":{"type":"boolean","description":"Derived by the same rule as company.uk.status: true when status is one of active, open or registered — the three values the register uses for an entity still live on it. False for every other status, including dissolved, closed, removed, liquidation, administration and receivership. Liveness, not good standing."},"type":{"type":["string","null"],"description":"Companies House company_type for the result (e.g. ltd, plc, llp, private-limited-guarant-nsc, limited-partnership, uk-establishment, registered-overseas-entity, royal-charter, industrial-and-provident-society, scottish-partnership). Null when the register omits it."},"date_of_creation":{"type":["string","null"],"format":"date","description":"Date of incorporation or registration."},"date_of_cessation":{"type":["string","null"],"format":"date","description":"Date the entity was dissolved, closed or removed; null while it remains on the register."},"address_snippet":{"type":["string","null"],"description":"The register's own one-line address for the result, passed through verbatim. Its component order (country before postcode) differs from the single_line rendering in company.uk.registered_office and company.uk.profile, so the two are not byte-comparable. The structured address is one company.uk.profile or company.uk.registered_office call away and is deliberately not repeated here."}}}},"page":{"type":"object","additionalProperties":false,"required":["limit","offset","returned","total","has_more","next_offset"],"properties":{"limit":{"type":["integer","null"],"description":"The page size applied (the requested limit, default 10)."},"offset":{"type":"integer","description":"The register index this page started at."},"returned":{"type":"integer","description":"Number of items in this response."},"total":{"type":["integer","null"],"description":"Total matches the register reports for this query. Null when the register omits it."},"has_more":{"type":"boolean","description":"Authoritative end-of-list signal: true when further matches remain beyond this page."},"next_offset":{"type":["integer","null"],"description":"The offset to request next. Null exactly when has_more is false."}}}}},"company_uk_status_output":{"type":"object","description":"Contains public sector information licensed under the Open Government Licence v3.0 (Companies House).","additionalProperties":false,"required":["company_number","company_name","status","is_active","is_striking_off"],"properties":{"company_number":{"type":"string","description":"Normalised 8-character company number."},"company_name":{"type":"string"},"status":{"type":"string","description":"Companies House company_status value (e.g. active, dissolved, liquidation, administration, receivership, voluntary-arrangement, insolvency-proceedings, converted-closed, registered, removed, closed, open). Companies use active/dissolved; UK establishments (BR…) and registered overseas entities (OE…) use open/closed and registered/removed."},"status_detail":{"type":["string","null"],"description":"Companies House company_status_detail where present (e.g. active-proposal-to-strike-off, transferred-from-uk, transformed-to-se, converted-to-plc)."},"is_active":{"type":"boolean","description":"Derived; true when status is one of active, open or registered — the three values the register uses for an entity that is still live on it (companies, UK establishments and overseas entities respectively). False for every other status, including dissolved, closed, removed, liquidation, administration and receivership. It is a liveness flag, not a good-standing flag: an active company with a proposal to strike off, an overdue filing or an insolvency process is still is_active true — read is_striking_off and status_detail alongside it."},"is_striking_off":{"type":"boolean","description":"Derived; true when status_detail is exactly active-proposal-to-strike-off, meaning the registrar has published a proposal to strike the company off the register. False when the register records no such detail."},"date_of_cessation":{"type":["string","null"],"format":"date","description":"Date the company was dissolved, converted/closed or removed, when applicable (date only, as the register publishes it)."}}},"company_us_filings_output":{"type":"object","additionalProperties":false,"required":["cik","name","query","has_more_history","items","page"],"properties":{"cik":{"type":"string","description":"SEC Central Index Key of the subject company, zero-padded to 10 digits — the resolved identifier when the request supplied a ticker."},"name":{"type":"string","description":"Current filer name on EDGAR."},"query":{"type":"object","additionalProperties":false,"required":["id","matched_by","form","since"],"description":"The request as interpreted — the identifier supplied and the filters applied after normalisation. The resolved CIK is data.cik; limit/offset are in page.","properties":{"id":{"type":"string","description":"The identifier supplied by the caller, trimmed."},"matched_by":{"type":"string","enum":["cik","ticker"],"description":"How id was read — \"cik\" when it was all digits, \"ticker\" when it was matched against the SEC listed-security index."},"form":{"type":["string","null"],"description":"Comma-separated upper-cased form filter applied, or null when no form filter was supplied."},"since":{"type":["string","null"],"description":"The since date filter applied (YYYY-MM-DD), or null when none was supplied."}}},"has_more_history":{"type":"boolean","description":"True when EDGAR holds older filings outside the recent window that could still match this query. It is gated on the since filter: EDGAR declares the date range of each older page, so a since date newer than every older page means the recent window already holds every matching filing and this is false. Older pages are not traversed by this capability version; narrow the query with since or form instead."},"items":{"type":"array","description":"Filings in EDGAR order, newest first. This is the company's EDGAR index, not a list of filings the company itself submitted: forms filed by third parties about the company (SCHEDULE 13G/13D by an institutional holder, Forms 3/4/5 by insiders, UPLOAD for SEC staff correspondence) appear here too, and EDGAR does not publish who submitted each one.","items":{"type":"object","additionalProperties":false,"required":["accession_number","form","filing_date","report_date","act","file_number","item_codes","primary_document","primary_doc_description","is_xbrl","is_inline_xbrl","size_bytes","document_url","index_url"],"properties":{"accession_number":{"type":"string","description":"EDGAR accession number in dashed form (e.g. 0000320193-25-000079)."},"form":{"type":"string","description":"EDGAR form type exactly as filed (e.g. 10-K, 10-Q, 8-K, DEF 14A, SCHEDULE 13G)."},"filing_date":{"type":["string","null"],"description":"Date the filing was accepted by EDGAR (YYYY-MM-DD)."},"report_date":{"type":["string","null"],"description":"Period or event date the filing reports on (YYYY-MM-DD), or null when the form has none."},"act":{"type":["string","null"],"description":"Securities act the filing is made under (33 or 34), or null when EDGAR states none."},"file_number":{"type":["string","null"],"description":"SEC file number, or null when EDGAR states none."},"item_codes":{"type":"array","description":"8-K item codes reported by the filing (e.g. 2.02, 9.01). Empty for forms that carry no item codes.","items":{"type":"string"}},"primary_document":{"type":["string","null"],"description":"File name — or path relative to the filing's EDGAR Archives directory, which older submissions use — of the filing's primary document. document_url is the resolved link; prefer it over building one from this value."},"primary_doc_description":{"type":["string","null"],"description":"EDGAR's description of the primary document, or null when blank upstream."},"is_xbrl":{"type":"boolean","description":"True when EDGAR flags the filing as containing XBRL data."},"is_inline_xbrl":{"type":"boolean","description":"True when EDGAR flags the filing as inline XBRL."},"size_bytes":{"type":["integer","null"],"description":"Size of the filing package in bytes as reported by EDGAR, or null when absent."},"document_url":{"type":["string","null"],"description":"Direct https://www.sec.gov link to the primary document, or null when EDGAR reports no primary document."},"index_url":{"type":["string","null"],"description":"Direct https://www.sec.gov link to the filing index page listing every document in the submission."}}}},"page":{"type":"object","additionalProperties":false,"required":["limit","offset","returned","total","has_more","next_offset"],"description":"Paging state for items (ADR-008 §2).","properties":{"limit":{"type":["integer","null"],"description":"Page size applied to this request."},"offset":{"type":"integer","description":"Zero-based offset of the first item returned."},"returned":{"type":"integer","description":"Number of entries in items."},"total":{"type":["integer","null"],"description":"Number of filings matching the form and since filters within EDGAR's recent filing window (see has_more_history), before limit and offset are applied. Never null for this capability."},"has_more":{"type":"boolean","description":"Authoritative; true when filings matching the same filters remain beyond this page within the recent window. items.length < limit is NOT a valid end-of-page test on its own — read this field."},"next_offset":{"type":["integer","null"],"description":"The offset to pass to the next request to continue after the last filing returned. Null when has_more is false."}}}}},"company_us_filings_latest_output":{"type":"object","additionalProperties":false,"required":["cik","name","query","forms_requested","forms_not_found","items","page"],"properties":{"cik":{"type":"string","description":"SEC Central Index Key of the subject company, zero-padded to 10 digits — the resolved identifier when the request supplied a ticker."},"name":{"type":"string","description":"Current filer name on EDGAR."},"query":{"type":"object","additionalProperties":false,"required":["id","matched_by"],"description":"The request as interpreted. The resolved CIK is data.cik and the forms covered are in forms_requested.","properties":{"id":{"type":"string","description":"The identifier supplied by the caller, trimmed."},"matched_by":{"type":"string","enum":["cik","ticker"],"description":"How id was read — \"cik\" when it was all digits, \"ticker\" when it was matched against the SEC listed-security index."}}},"forms_requested":{"type":"array","description":"The forms this answer covers, upper-cased, in the order they were requested (the default set when the caller supplied no form).","items":{"type":"string"}},"forms_not_found":{"type":"array","description":"Requested forms with no filing in EDGAR's recent window for this CIK. This is an answer, not an omission — a form listed here has no recent filing rather than an unknown one.","items":{"type":"string"}},"items":{"type":"array","description":"The newest filing of each requested form that appears in EDGAR's recent window for this CIK, in the order the forms were requested. Forms with no filing in that window are named in forms_not_found. The window is the company's EDGAR index, so a requested ownership form (3, 4, 5, SCHEDULE 13G) returns the newest filing made about the company by a third party; EDGAR does not publish who submitted it.","items":{"type":"object","additionalProperties":false,"required":["form","accession_number","filing_date","report_date","primary_document","document_url"],"properties":{"form":{"type":"string","description":"EDGAR form type exactly as filed."},"accession_number":{"type":"string","description":"EDGAR accession number in dashed form (e.g. 0000320193-25-000079)."},"filing_date":{"type":["string","null"],"description":"Date the filing was accepted by EDGAR (YYYY-MM-DD)."},"report_date":{"type":["string","null"],"description":"Period or event date the filing reports on (YYYY-MM-DD), or null when the form has none."},"primary_document":{"type":["string","null"],"description":"File name — or path relative to the filing's EDGAR Archives directory, which older submissions use — of the filing's primary document. document_url is the resolved link; prefer it over building one from this value."},"document_url":{"type":["string","null"],"description":"Direct https://www.sec.gov link to the primary document, or null when EDGAR reports no primary document."}}}},"page":{"type":"object","additionalProperties":false,"required":["limit","offset","returned","total","has_more","next_offset"],"description":"Paging state for items (ADR-008 §2). This answer is never paged — it holds at most one filing per requested form and accepts no limit or offset — so it is always the whole result set.","properties":{"limit":{"type":["integer","null"],"description":"Always null: this capability accepts no page size, so no limit was applied."},"offset":{"type":"integer","description":"Always 0: the whole result set is returned."},"returned":{"type":"integer","description":"Number of entries in items — one per requested form that has a filing in EDGAR's recent window."},"total":{"type":"integer","description":"Equal to returned. Requested forms with no filing in the window are not missing entries; they are named in forms_not_found."},"has_more":{"type":"boolean","description":"Always false: there is no further page to fetch."},"next_offset":{"type":["integer","null"],"description":"Always null: has_more is false, so there is nothing to resume from."}}}}},"company_us_profile_output":{"type":"object","additionalProperties":false,"required":["cik","name","query","entity_type","tickers","exchanges","former_names","addresses"],"properties":{"cik":{"type":"string","description":"SEC Central Index Key, zero-padded to 10 digits. This is the resolved identifier — the one to reuse for company.us.filings and company.us.filings.latest."},"name":{"type":"string","description":"Current filer name on EDGAR."},"query":{"type":"object","additionalProperties":false,"required":["id","matched_by"],"description":"The request as interpreted. The resolved CIK is data.cik.","properties":{"id":{"type":"string","description":"The identifier supplied by the caller, trimmed."},"matched_by":{"type":"string","enum":["cik","ticker"],"description":"How id was read — \"cik\" when it was all digits, \"ticker\" when it was matched against the SEC listed-security index."}}},"entity_type":{"type":["string","null"],"description":"EDGAR entity classification (e.g. operating), or null when EDGAR states none."},"sic_code":{"type":["string","null"],"description":"Standard Industrial Classification code assigned by the SEC, or null when unassigned."},"sic_description":{"type":["string","null"],"description":"SEC description of the SIC code (e.g. Electronic Computers)."},"ein":{"type":["string","null"],"description":"Employer Identification Number as filed with the SEC, digits only and unformatted. Some filers report a placeholder such as 000000000."},"filer_categories":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"string"},"description":"SEC filer categories as text (e.g. [\"Large accelerated filer\"], [\"Accelerated filer\", \"Smaller reporting company\"]); EDGAR publishes them as one string with HTML line breaks, which Eckari splits. Empty when EDGAR states none."},"fiscal_year_end":{"type":["object","null"],"additionalProperties":false,"required":["month","day"],"description":"Recurring fiscal year end as a partial date (EDGAR publishes it as MMDD, e.g. 0926). Null when EDGAR states none or publishes a value that is not a real month and day.","properties":{"month":{"type":"integer","description":"Calendar month, 1-12.","minimum":1,"maximum":12},"day":{"type":"integer","description":"Day of the month, 1-31, as filed. Not validated against the month's length.","minimum":1,"maximum":31}}},"state_of_incorporation":{"type":["string","null"],"description":"State or country of incorporation code as recorded by the SEC."},"tickers":{"type":"array","description":"Trading symbols recorded by the SEC for this filer, in EDGAR order. Empty when the filer has no listed security.","items":{"type":"string"}},"exchanges":{"type":"array","description":"Listing venues recorded by the SEC, one entry per entry in tickers and positionally aligned with it: exchanges[i] is the venue for tickers[i]. An entry is null when EDGAR records no venue for that security (live example: tickers [MAAI, MAA, MAA-PI] against exchanges [null, NYSE, NYSE]), so nulls are preserved rather than dropped. Empty when the filer has no listed security. EDGAR occasionally returns fewer exchange entries than tickers; treat a missing trailing entry as unknown.","items":{"type":["string","null"]}},"former_names":{"type":"array","description":"Previous EDGAR filer names in EDGAR's own order, which is not guaranteed to be chronological — sort by from/to yourself if you need an ordered history. Empty when the filer has never changed name on EDGAR.","items":{"type":"object","additionalProperties":false,"required":["name","from","to"],"properties":{"name":{"type":"string","description":"Former filer name."},"from":{"type":["string","null"],"description":"Date from which the former name applied (YYYY-MM-DD). EDGAR publishes this as a timestamp (midnight US Eastern expressed in UTC); the calendar date is taken from it and the time discarded."},"to":{"type":["string","null"],"description":"Date until which the former name applied (YYYY-MM-DD), derived from EDGAR's timestamp the same way as from."}}}},"addresses":{"type":"object","additionalProperties":false,"required":["business","mailing"],"description":"Addresses on file with the SEC. Either may be null when EDGAR holds none.","properties":{"business":{"type":["object","null"],"additionalProperties":false,"required":["street1","street2","city","state_or_country","zip"],"description":"Business address of record.","properties":{"street1":{"type":["string","null"],"description":"First address line."},"street2":{"type":["string","null"],"description":"Second address line."},"city":{"type":["string","null"],"description":"City or town."},"state_or_country":{"type":["string","null"],"description":"State code for US addresses, or an EDGAR country code for foreign addresses."},"zip":{"type":["string","null"],"description":"Postal code as filed. Not validated against USPS."}}},"mailing":{"type":["object","null"],"additionalProperties":false,"required":["street1","street2","city","state_or_country","zip"],"description":"Mailing address of record.","properties":{"street1":{"type":["string","null"],"description":"First address line."},"street2":{"type":["string","null"],"description":"Second address line."},"city":{"type":["string","null"],"description":"City or town."},"state_or_country":{"type":["string","null"],"description":"State code for US addresses, or an EDGAR country code for foreign addresses."},"zip":{"type":["string","null"],"description":"Postal code as filed. Not validated against USPS."}}}}},"phone":{"type":["string","null"],"description":"Contact telephone number exactly as filed with the SEC; formatting is not normalised, so values such as (408) 996-1010, 408-996-1010 and 4089961010 all occur. No country code is implied and the number is not validated."},"website":{"type":["string","null"],"description":"Corporate website recorded by the SEC, or null. EDGAR leaves this blank for most filers."},"investor_website":{"type":["string","null"],"description":"Investor relations website recorded by the SEC, or null. EDGAR leaves this blank for most filers."}}},"company_us_resolve_output":{"type":"object","additionalProperties":false,"required":["query","match_type","items","page"],"properties":{"query":{"type":"string","description":"The trimmed query as interpreted by the resolver."},"match_type":{"type":["string","null"],"enum":["ticker_exact","name_exact","name_prefix","name_contains",null],"description":"Strongest match class present in the result set, or null when nothing matched. ticker_exact beats name_exact beats name_prefix beats name_contains."},"items":{"type":"array","description":"Matches ordered by match class, then registered name ascending, then CIK ascending, then ticker ascending. A company with several listed securities appears once per ticker.","items":{"type":"object","additionalProperties":false,"required":["cik","ticker","name","exchange"],"properties":{"cik":{"type":"string","description":"SEC Central Index Key, zero-padded to 10 digits — the identifier every other company.us.* capability takes."},"ticker":{"type":["string","null"],"description":"Trading symbol as published in the SEC company index, or null when the row carries no symbol."},"name":{"type":"string","description":"Company name as recorded by the SEC. This is the EDGAR filer name, which may differ from the trading name."},"exchange":{"type":["string","null"],"description":"Listing venue recorded by the SEC (e.g. Nasdaq, NYSE, OTC), or null when the SEC index does not state one."}}}},"page":{"type":"object","additionalProperties":false,"required":["limit","offset","returned","total","has_more","next_offset"],"description":"Paging state for items (ADR-008 §2). This capability accepts no offset, so it always returns the first page.","properties":{"limit":{"type":["integer","null"],"description":"Page size applied to this request."},"offset":{"type":"integer","description":"Zero-based offset of the first item returned. Always 0 — this capability takes no offset input."},"returned":{"type":"integer","description":"Number of entries in items."},"total":{"type":["integer","null"],"description":"Number of index rows matching the query before the limit is applied. Only SEC filers with a listed security appear in this index (company_tickers_exchange.json, about 10,400 rows); zero matches do not mean the company is not an SEC filer."},"has_more":{"type":"boolean","description":"True when the query matched more rows than were returned. Refine the query or raise limit (max 25)."},"next_offset":{"type":["integer","null"],"description":"Always null: this capability exposes no offset input, so there is no offset to resume at. Read has_more to learn that matches were left behind."}}}}},"domain_expiry_output":{"type":"object","additionalProperties":false,"required":["domain","is_registered","expires_at","days_until_expiry","status","registrar_name","rdap_last_update","terms_url"],"properties":{"domain":{"type":"string","description":"ASCII (punycode) domain name as recorded by the registry."},"is_registered":{"type":"boolean","description":"True when the registry returned a record; false when the registry has no record."},"expires_at":{"type":["string","null"],"description":"Registry expiry date (RDAP expiration event); null when the registry does not publish one."},"days_until_expiry":{"type":["integer","null"],"description":"Whole days from now to expires_at, floored; negative when already past expiry."},"status":{"type":"array","description":"RFC 9083 status values (the RDAP spelling of EPP status codes), lower-cased and sorted.","items":{"type":"string"}},"registrar_name":{"type":["string","null"],"description":"Registrar name from the RDAP registrar entity."},"rdap_last_update":{"type":["string","null"],"description":"Registry's own last update of RDAP database timestamp - how current this expiry date is. Null when the registry publishes no such event."},"terms_url":{"type":["string","null"],"description":"Link to the first notice the registry published with this response - normally its terms of service. Those terms govern your use of this data and vary by registry. Null when the registry published no notice link; the source acknowledgement is in meta.attribution."}}},"domain_registration_output":{"type":"object","additionalProperties":false,"required":["domain","tld","bootstrap_suffix","is_registered","status","registrar","events","nameservers","rdap_server","terms_url"],"properties":{"domain":{"type":"string","description":"ASCII (punycode) domain name as recorded by the registry."},"unicode_name":{"type":["string","null"],"description":"Unicode form of the name when the registry publishes one."},"tld":{"type":"string","description":"Top-level domain - the last label of the name, lower-cased and without a dot (uk for bbc.co.uk, com for example.com). It is the label itself, not necessarily the suffix the IANA bootstrap matched, and not the registrable suffix (co.uk) - read bootstrap_suffix for the entry that actually routed the query."},"bootstrap_suffix":{"type":"string","description":"Suffix that matched in the IANA RDAP bootstrap (RFC 9224 longest-suffix rule) and so selected rdap_server. Usually the same as tld, but it can be longer where IANA publishes a multi-label entry."},"is_registered":{"type":"boolean","description":"True when the registry returned a record. False means the registry has no record (RDAP 404)."},"status":{"type":"array","description":"RFC 9083 status values - the RDAP spelling of EPP status codes, so \"client transfer prohibited\" here is EPP clientTransferProhibited - lower-cased, de-duplicated and sorted.","items":{"type":"string"}},"registrar":{"type":"object","additionalProperties":false,"required":["name","iana_id","url","abuse_email"],"properties":{"name":{"type":["string","null"],"description":"Registrar name from the RDAP registrar entity."},"iana_id":{"type":["string","null"],"description":"IANA registrar id where the registry publishes one (gTLDs); null for registries that use their own identifiers."},"url":{"type":["string","null"],"description":"Registrar URL when published."},"abuse_email":{"type":["string","null"],"description":"Registrar abuse contact email when published; frequently redacted."}}},"events":{"type":"object","additionalProperties":false,"required":["registered_at","updated_at","expires_at","transferred_at"],"properties":{"registered_at":{"type":["string","null"],"description":"Registry creation date (RDAP registration event)."},"updated_at":{"type":["string","null"],"description":"Last change to the registry record (RDAP last changed event)."},"expires_at":{"type":["string","null"],"description":"Registry expiry date (RDAP expiration event)."},"transferred_at":{"type":["string","null"],"description":"Last transfer date when the registry publishes one."}}},"nameservers":{"type":"array","description":"Delegated nameserver hostnames from the registry, lower-cased, de-duplicated and sorted.","items":{"type":"string"}},"dnssec_signed":{"type":["boolean","null"],"description":"Registry DNSSEC delegation flag (secureDNS.delegationSigned); null when the registry omits it."},"rdap_server":{"type":"string","description":"Authoritative registry RDAP base URL that answered, resolved from the IANA bootstrap."},"rdap_last_update":{"type":["string","null"],"description":"Registry's own last update of RDAP database timestamp - the true freshness of this record."},"days_until_expiry":{"type":["integer","null"],"description":"Whole days from now to expires_at, floored; negative when already past expiry."},"auto_renew_flag":{"type":["boolean","null"],"description":"True only when the registry publishes the auto renew period status. RDAP does not otherwise expose auto-renew, so null means unknown rather than off."},"terms_url":{"type":["string","null"],"description":"Link to the first notice the registry published with this response - normally its terms of service. Those terms govern your use of this data and vary by registry, which is why the link is a fact of the record rather than a fixed Eckari constant; the source acknowledgement itself is in meta.attribution. Null when the registry published no notice link."},"availability_note":{"type":["string","null"],"description":"Set only when the registry has no record; explains that this is strong evidence of availability but not an authoritative EPP check."}}},"entity_lei_profile_output":{"type":"object","additionalProperties":false,"required":["lei","legal_name","legal_name_language","other_names","legal_address","headquarters_address","jurisdiction","legal_form","category","sub_category","entity_status","creation_date","expiration","registered_at","registered_as","registration","bic","conformity_flag","golden_copy_date","related"],"properties":{"lei":{"type":"string","description":"20-character ISO 17442 Legal Entity Identifier, upper-cased."},"legal_name":{"type":["string","null"],"description":"Registered legal name as held by GLEIF, or null when the record carries no legal name. Never falls back to the LEI itself — an identifier is not a name."},"legal_name_language":{"type":["string","null"],"description":"ISO language code of the legal name, or null."},"other_names":{"type":"array","description":"Other or previous names GLEIF holds for the entity, in GLEIF order.","items":{"type":"object","additionalProperties":false,"required":["name","type","language"],"properties":{"name":{"type":"string","description":"The alternative or previous name."},"type":{"type":["string","null"],"description":"GLEIF name type (e.g. PREVIOUS_LEGAL_NAME, TRADING_OR_OPERATING_NAME)."},"language":{"type":["string","null"],"description":"ISO language code of the name, or null."}}}},"legal_address":{"type":["object","null"],"additionalProperties":false,"required":["lines","city","region","country","postal_code"],"description":"Registered legal address as held by GLEIF.","properties":{"lines":{"type":"array","description":"Street address lines in GLEIF order.","items":{"type":"string"}},"city":{"type":["string","null"],"description":"City or town."},"region":{"type":["string","null"],"description":"ISO 3166-2 subdivision code, or null."},"country":{"type":["string","null"],"description":"ISO 3166-1 alpha-2 country code."},"postal_code":{"type":["string","null"],"description":"Postal code as held by GLEIF."}}},"headquarters_address":{"type":["object","null"],"additionalProperties":false,"required":["lines","city","region","country","postal_code"],"description":"Headquarters address as held by GLEIF; often differs from the legal address (which may be a registered agent).","properties":{"lines":{"type":"array","description":"Street address lines in GLEIF order.","items":{"type":"string"}},"city":{"type":["string","null"],"description":"City or town."},"region":{"type":["string","null"],"description":"ISO 3166-2 subdivision code, or null."},"country":{"type":["string","null"],"description":"ISO 3166-1 alpha-2 country code."},"postal_code":{"type":["string","null"],"description":"Postal code as held by GLEIF."}}},"jurisdiction":{"type":["string","null"],"description":"Legal jurisdiction as an ISO 3166 country or subdivision code (e.g. GB, US-CA)."},"legal_form":{"type":["object","null"],"additionalProperties":false,"required":["code","other"],"description":"Entity legal form from the ISO 20275 Entity Legal Forms code list.","properties":{"code":{"type":["string","null"],"description":"ISO 20275 ELF code (e.g. H1UM), or null."},"other":{"type":["string","null"],"description":"Free-text legal form when no ELF code applies."}}},"category":{"type":["string","null"],"description":"GLEIF entity category (e.g. GENERAL, BRANCH, FUND, SOLE_PROPRIETOR, INTERNATIONAL_ORGANIZATION)."},"sub_category":{"type":["string","null"],"description":"GLEIF entity sub-category, or null."},"entity_status":{"type":["string","null"],"description":"Legal entity status recorded by GLEIF (e.g. ACTIVE, INACTIVE, NULL)."},"creation_date":{"type":["string","null"],"description":"Date the entity was created, as reported to GLEIF. Returned as a calendar date (YYYY-MM-DD) when GLEIF publishes a plain midnight UTC value, which is the usual case; when GLEIF publishes a real time of day the ISO 8601 timestamp is returned exactly as it stands. Null when GLEIF holds none."},"expiration":{"type":["object","null"],"additionalProperties":false,"required":["date","reason"],"description":"Entity expiry as reported to GLEIF; null when the entity has not expired.","properties":{"date":{"type":["string","null"],"description":"ISO 8601 expiry timestamp."},"reason":{"type":["string","null"],"description":"GLEIF expiry reason (e.g. DISSOLVED, CORPORATE_ACTION, VOLUNTARY)."}}},"registered_at":{"type":"object","additionalProperties":false,"required":["ra_code","name"],"description":"Business registry the entity is registered at, as an ISO 17442 Registration Authority code with its name decoded.","properties":{"ra_code":{"type":["string","null"],"description":"Registration Authority code (e.g. RA000585 is the UK Companies Register). RA999999 means no listed authority."},"name":{"type":["string","null"],"description":"Registry name decoded from GLEIF's published Registration Authorities list (v1.8.1, 2024-11-20), e.g. RA000585 => Companies House. Falls back to the free-text authority GLEIF holds when the entity's registry has no RA code, and is null when neither is available."}}},"registered_as":{"type":["string","null"],"description":"The entity's identifier in that local registry. When ra_code is RA000585 this is a UK company number usable with company.uk.profile and company.uk.status."},"registration":{"type":"object","additionalProperties":false,"required":["status","initial_date","last_update","next_renewal","days_until_renewal","managing_lou","corroboration_level","validated_at","validated_as"],"description":"State of the LEI registration itself, as distinct from the entity's own status.","properties":{"status":{"type":["string","null"],"description":"LEI registration status (e.g. ISSUED, LAPSED, RETIRED, ANNULLED, MERGED, DUPLICATE)."},"initial_date":{"type":["string","null"],"description":"ISO 8601 timestamp the LEI was first issued."},"last_update":{"type":["string","null"],"description":"ISO 8601 timestamp the record was last updated."},"next_renewal":{"type":["string","null"],"description":"ISO 8601 timestamp the registration is next due for renewal."},"days_until_renewal":{"type":["integer","null"],"description":"Whole days from now to next_renewal, floored; negative when the renewal date has already passed (an LEI whose status is still ISSUED but whose renewal is overdue is on its way to LAPSED). Null when GLEIF publishes no renewal date."},"managing_lou":{"type":["string","null"],"description":"LEI of the Local Operating Unit (the LEI-issuing organisation accredited by GLEIF) that maintains this record."},"corroboration_level":{"type":["string","null"],"description":"How far the LOU corroborated the record against an authoritative source — FULLY_CORROBORATED means validated against the registry named in validated_at, ENTITY_SUPPLIED_ONLY means the entity's own statement was accepted."},"validated_at":{"type":"object","additionalProperties":false,"required":["ra_code","name"],"description":"Registry against which the LOU validated the record.","properties":{"ra_code":{"type":["string","null"],"description":"Registration Authority code used for validation."},"name":{"type":["string","null"],"description":"Name of that registry, decoded from GLEIF's published Registration Authorities list; null when the code is not in the list and GLEIF supplies no free-text authority."}}},"validated_as":{"type":["string","null"],"description":"The identifier used at the validating registry."}}},"bic":{"type":"array","description":"Business Identifier Codes (ISO 9362) mapped to this LEI by GLEIF. Empty when none are mapped.","items":{"type":"string"}},"conformity_flag":{"type":["string","null"],"description":"Whether the record meets GLEIF's data-quality requirements — CONFORMING means it passed GLEIF's quality checks, NON_CONFORMING means it did not, NOT_APPLICABLE that the checks do not apply."},"golden_copy_date":{"type":["string","null"],"description":"Publish timestamp of the GLEIF golden copy this record was served from, exactly as GLEIF reports it. GLEIF republishes the golden copy three times a day (observed publish timestamps 00:00, 08:00 and 16:00 UTC), so a record can be up to about eight hours behind the LOU's latest update. Present means the answer is near_live rather than live; null when GLEIF states no publish date."},"related":{"type":"object","additionalProperties":false,"required":["direct_parent_available","ultimate_parent_available","children_available"],"description":"What relationship data GLEIF holds for this entity. False means the relationship is not reported (often with a documented reporting exception), which is a valid registry answer, not an error.","properties":{"direct_parent_available":{"type":"boolean","description":"True when GLEIF publishes a direct accounting-consolidation parent record for this entity."},"ultimate_parent_available":{"type":"boolean","description":"True when GLEIF publishes an ultimate accounting-consolidation parent record for this entity."},"children_available":{"type":"boolean","description":"True when GLEIF publishes direct child relationships for this entity."}}}}},"entity_lei_search_output":{"type":"object","additionalProperties":false,"required":["query","country","items","page"],"properties":{"query":{"type":"string","description":"The trimmed query as sent to GLEIF."},"country":{"type":["string","null"],"description":"Upper-cased ISO 3166-1 alpha-2 filter applied, or null when no country filter was supplied."},"items":{"type":"array","description":"Entities in GLEIF's own order. Records matched by the authoritative name filter come first, then records added from GLEIF's fuzzy name completion, de-duplicated by LEI. Eckari applies no scoring of its own.","items":{"type":"object","additionalProperties":false,"required":["lei","legal_name","legal_name_language","registration_status","entity_status","jurisdiction","legal_address","registered_at","registered_as","match_source"],"properties":{"lei":{"type":"string","description":"20-character ISO 17442 Legal Entity Identifier."},"legal_name":{"type":["string","null"],"description":"Registered legal name as held by GLEIF, or null when the record carries no legal name. Never falls back to the LEI itself — an identifier is not a name."},"legal_name_language":{"type":["string","null"],"description":"ISO language code of the legal name, or null when GLEIF states none."},"registration_status":{"type":["string","null"],"description":"Status of the LEI registration itself (e.g. ISSUED, LAPSED, RETIRED, ANNULLED, MERGED). ISSUED means the registration is current. Distinct from entity_status, which describes the legal entity."},"entity_status":{"type":["string","null"],"description":"Legal entity status recorded by GLEIF (e.g. ACTIVE, INACTIVE, NULL)."},"jurisdiction":{"type":["string","null"],"description":"Legal jurisdiction as an ISO 3166 country or subdivision code (e.g. GB, US-CA)."},"legal_address":{"type":["object","null"],"additionalProperties":false,"required":["lines","city","region","country","postal_code"],"description":"Registered legal address as held by GLEIF.","properties":{"lines":{"type":"array","description":"Street address lines in GLEIF order.","items":{"type":"string"}},"city":{"type":["string","null"],"description":"City or town."},"region":{"type":["string","null"],"description":"ISO 3166-2 subdivision code, or null."},"country":{"type":["string","null"],"description":"ISO 3166-1 alpha-2 country code."},"postal_code":{"type":["string","null"],"description":"Postal code as held by GLEIF."}}},"registered_at":{"type":"object","additionalProperties":false,"required":["ra_code","name"],"description":"Business registry the entity is registered at, as an ISO 17442 Registration Authority code with its name decoded.","properties":{"ra_code":{"type":["string","null"],"description":"Registration Authority code (e.g. RA000585 is the UK Companies Register, RA000598 the California business entity register). RA999999 means no listed authority."},"name":{"type":["string","null"],"description":"Registry name decoded from GLEIF's published Registration Authorities list (v1.8.1, 2024-11-20), e.g. RA000585 => Companies House. Falls back to the free-text authority GLEIF holds when the entity's registry has no RA code, and is null when neither is available. The code identifies the specific jurisdiction's register; the name is the organisation responsible for it."}}},"registered_as":{"type":["string","null"],"description":"The entity's identifier in that local registry. When ra_code is RA000585 this is a UK company number usable with company.uk.profile and company.uk.status."},"match_source":{"type":"string","enum":["filter","fuzzy"],"description":"How GLEIF surfaced this record — filter means the authoritative legal-name filter, fuzzy means GLEIF's name-completion service."}}}},"page":{"type":"object","additionalProperties":false,"required":["limit","offset","returned","total","has_more","next_offset"],"description":"Paging state for items (ADR-008 section 2). The result set being paged is GLEIF's authoritative legal-name filter; when that filter holds fewer records than one page, GLEIF's fuzzy name completion fills the rest and the set becomes those filter records followed by the completions, in GLEIF's order. Both are paged the same way and both resume from next_offset.","properties":{"limit":{"type":["integer","null"],"description":"Page size applied to this request."},"offset":{"type":"integer","description":"Zero-based offset of the first item returned (the offset input)."},"returned":{"type":"integer","description":"Number of entries in items."},"total":{"type":["integer","null"],"description":"Total entities GLEIF reports for its authoritative legal-name filter (register-wide, independent of the page size). Null when the result set includes records from GLEIF's fuzzy name completion: GLEIF publishes no count for those, so the set is no longer the one it counted and a number here would be unreconcilable with the items returned. has_more and next_offset are exact either way."},"has_more":{"type":"boolean","description":"True when further matches remain beyond this page — from GLEIF's own total on the filter path, and from the merged set (filter records plus up to 25 completions) when the completion fill-in is in force."},"next_offset":{"type":["integer","null"],"description":"The offset to pass as offset to continue after the last entity returned. Null exactly when has_more is false. GLEIF's ordering for a query is stable across pages, so resuming returns the next entities rather than repeats; it is not a ranking, and it can change when GLEIF republishes the golden copy."}}}}},"fx_reference_rate_output":{"type":"object","additionalProperties":false,"required":["base","quote","rate","rate_date","rate_kind","rate_derivation","published_pairs_used"],"properties":{"base":{"type":"string","description":"Base currency (ISO 4217, upper case)."},"quote":{"type":"string","description":"Quote currency (ISO 4217, upper case)."},"rate":{"type":"string","description":"Units of quote currency per 1 unit of base currency, as a decimal string with 6 decimal places. Computed with exact integer arithmetic from the ECB fix (rate = published(quote) / published(base), with EUR = 1) and rounded half-even - never floating point. Unless rate_derivation is published, this is a computed value rather than a figure published by the ECB, and rounding means it need not round-trip exactly against the published fix.","pattern":"^[0-9]+\\.[0-9]{6}$"},"rate_date":{"type":"string","description":"TARGET working day of the ECB fix used (the Cube time value), which may be earlier than a requested date or than today when no fix has been published yet - see note."},"rate_kind":{"type":"string","description":"Always the string reference - an official daily reference rate, not a tradable or executable market rate."},"rate_derivation":{"type":"string","enum":["published","inverse","cross","identity"],"description":"How the rate relates to what the ECB publishes. published = the ECB EUR/quote fix itself (base EUR); inverse = 1 divided by the EUR/base fix (quote EUR), an Eckari computation; cross = the EUR/quote fix divided by the EUR/base fix, an Eckari computation from two published quotations of the same fix (neither side EUR); identity = EUR to EUR (1). Only published values are ECB figures."},"published_pairs_used":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"string"},"description":"Every ECB quotation used to produce the rate, in the form EUR/XXX - two for a cross, one for published or inverse, none for the identity."},"note":{"type":"string","description":"Present only when the fix returned is not the one asked for - either the requested date had no fix and the latest prior fix was returned, or no fix has been published for today (UTC) yet and the latest published fix was returned. Absent otherwise (an always-null note says nothing); rate_date always states which fix was used."}}},"location_us_geocode_output":{"type":"object","additionalProperties":false,"required":["query","items","page","benchmark"],"properties":{"query":{"type":"object","additionalProperties":false,"required":["address"],"description":"The resolved input, echoed so a batched caller can match answers to requests.","properties":{"address":{"type":"string","description":"The trimmed address as sent to the Census Bureau."}}},"items":{"type":"array","description":"Candidate matches in the Census Bureau's own order (best first), for the requested page. Eckari applies no re-ranking. An empty array with page.total 0 means the Census Bureau recognised no address - a valid answer, not an error.","items":{"type":"object","additionalProperties":false,"required":["matched_address","lat","lon","precision","tiger_line_id","side","address_components"],"properties":{"matched_address":{"type":["string","null"],"description":"Standardised address as returned by the Census Bureau, upper-cased."},"lat":{"type":["number","null"],"description":"Latitude in decimal degrees (WGS 84), interpolated along the TIGER/Line street segment and rounded to 6 decimal places (about 0.11 m) - the Census returns up to 11 decimals, which is false precision for an address-range interpolation.","minimum":-90,"maximum":90},"lon":{"type":["number","null"],"description":"Longitude in decimal degrees (WGS 84), interpolated along the TIGER/Line street segment and rounded to 6 decimal places.","minimum":-180,"maximum":180},"precision":{"type":"string","const":"tiger_interpolated","description":"Always tiger_interpolated: the coordinate is interpolated from the address range of a TIGER/Line street segment, not a rooftop, parcel centroid or surveyed point. Typical error is the length of a house-number range along one block."},"tiger_line_id":{"type":["string","null"],"description":"Identifier of the TIGER/Line street segment the match was interpolated along."},"side":{"type":["string","null"],"description":"Side of the street segment the address falls on (L or R), as recorded in TIGER/Line."},"address_components":{"type":"object","additionalProperties":false,"required":["from_address","to_address","street_name","pre_type","pre_direction","suffix_type","suffix_direction","city","state","zip"],"description":"Parsed components of the matched address. Empty upstream values are returned as null.","properties":{"from_address":{"type":["string","null"],"description":"Lowest house number of the TIGER/Line address range this match was interpolated within - a property of the block segment, not of the address you asked for. Together with to_address it shows how wide that range is, which is the main source of positional error."},"to_address":{"type":["string","null"],"description":"Highest house number of the same TIGER/Line address range."},"street_name":{"type":["string","null"],"description":"Street name without type or directional parts."},"pre_type":{"type":["string","null"],"description":"Street type appearing before the name (e.g. AVENUE in \"Avenue of the Americas\")."},"pre_direction":{"type":["string","null"],"description":"Directional appearing before the street name (e.g. N, SW)."},"suffix_type":{"type":["string","null"],"description":"Street type appearing after the name (e.g. AVE, ST, BLVD)."},"suffix_direction":{"type":["string","null"],"description":"Directional appearing after the street name (e.g. NW)."},"city":{"type":["string","null"],"description":"City or place name as standardised by the Census Bureau."},"state":{"type":["string","null"],"description":"Two-letter US state or territory code."},"zip":{"type":["string","null"],"description":"Five-digit ZIP code recorded on the TIGER address range. This is Census reference data, not a USPS deliverability check."}}}}}},"page":{"type":"object","additionalProperties":false,"required":["limit","offset","returned","total","has_more","next_offset"],"description":"Canonical paging block over the candidate list the Census Bureau returned for this address.","properties":{"limit":{"type":["integer","null"],"description":"Page size applied (the requested limit)."},"offset":{"type":"integer","description":"Zero-based index of the first candidate returned."},"returned":{"type":"integer","description":"Number of candidates in this response."},"total":{"type":["integer","null"],"description":"Number of candidates the Census Bureau returned for this address, before limit and offset were applied. A value above 1 means the address is ambiguous in TIGER/Line - typically the same house number on the same street in several ZIP codes - even when only one candidate is shown. 0 means no match."},"has_more":{"type":"boolean","description":"True when candidates beyond this page exist."},"next_offset":{"type":["integer","null"],"description":"Offset to pass to see the next page; null when has_more is false."}}},"benchmark":{"type":["string","null"],"description":"Census Bureau address-range benchmark used for the match (Public_AR_Current)."}}},"location_us_geographies_output":{"type":"object","additionalProperties":false,"required":["query","state","county","tract","block_group","block","place","congressional_district","zcta","vintage","benchmark"],"properties":{"query":{"type":"object","additionalProperties":false,"required":["lat","lon"],"description":"The point that was looked up, echoed so a batched caller can match answers to requests.","properties":{"lat":{"type":"number","description":"The latitude that was looked up."},"lon":{"type":"number","description":"The longitude that was looked up."}}},"state":{"type":["object","null"],"additionalProperties":false,"required":["fips","name","usps"],"description":"US state, district or territory containing the point.","properties":{"fips":{"type":["string","null"],"description":"Two-digit state FIPS code (e.g. 11 for the District of Columbia)."},"name":{"type":["string","null"],"description":"State, district or territory name."},"usps":{"type":["string","null"],"description":"Two-letter USPS state abbreviation as published by the Census Bureau."}}},"county":{"type":["object","null"],"additionalProperties":false,"required":["fips","name"],"description":"County or county equivalent containing the point; null when the Census Bureau returns no county layer.","properties":{"fips":{"type":["string","null"],"description":"Five-digit county FIPS code (state FIPS + county code)."},"name":{"type":["string","null"],"description":"County or county-equivalent name."}}},"tract":{"type":["object","null"],"additionalProperties":false,"required":["geoid","name"],"description":"Census tract containing the point; null when the Census Bureau returns no tract layer.","properties":{"geoid":{"type":["string","null"],"description":"11-character census tract GEOID (state + county + tract)."},"name":{"type":["string","null"],"description":"Census tract name as published (e.g. Census Tract 9800)."}}},"block_group":{"type":["object","null"],"additionalProperties":false,"required":["geoid"],"description":"Census block group containing the point, or null.","properties":{"geoid":{"type":["string","null"],"description":"12-character block group GEOID."}}},"block":{"type":["object","null"],"additionalProperties":false,"required":["geoid"],"description":"Census block containing the point (decennial census block layer), or null.","properties":{"geoid":{"type":["string","null"],"description":"15-character census block GEOID."}}},"place":{"type":["object","null"],"additionalProperties":false,"required":["geoid","name"],"description":"Incorporated place containing the point, or null when the point is unincorporated.","properties":{"geoid":{"type":["string","null"],"description":"Seven-character place GEOID (state FIPS + place code)."},"name":{"type":["string","null"],"description":"Place name as published (e.g. Washington city)."}}},"congressional_district":{"type":["object","null"],"additionalProperties":false,"required":["geoid","name"],"description":"Congressional district for the current session containing the point, or null.","properties":{"geoid":{"type":["string","null"],"description":"Four-character congressional district GEOID (state FIPS + district number)."},"name":{"type":["string","null"],"description":"District name as published by the Census Bureau."}}},"zcta":{"type":["object","null"],"additionalProperties":false,"required":["geoid"],"description":"ZIP Code Tabulation Area containing the point, or null. A ZCTA is a Census statistical approximation of a ZIP code built from census blocks — it is NOT a USPS delivery ZIP code. ZCTAs and ZIPs are not one-to-one: some ZIPs have no ZCTA, boundaries do not match carrier routes, and PO-Box-only ZIPs have no area. Never present a ZCTA as USPS-validated.","properties":{"geoid":{"type":["string","null"],"description":"Five-digit ZCTA code (ZCTA5)."}}},"vintage":{"type":["string","null"],"description":"Census geography vintage used for the lookup (Current_Current), echoed by the Census Bureau. Named identically in location.us.geocode."},"benchmark":{"type":["string","null"],"description":"Census Bureau address-range benchmark used for the lookup (Public_AR_Current)."}}},"parcel_detect_carrier_output":{"type":"object","additionalProperties":false,"required":["carrier","match_strength","match_score","candidates","input","formats_matched","upu_s10","signature_version"],"properties":{"carrier":{"type":["object","null"],"additionalProperties":false,"required":["id","name"],"description":"The answer - the best-matching carrier, or null when no candidate scored at least 0.5. Always read match_strength before acting on it - a weak match names a carrier whose format has no carrier-unique marker.","properties":{"id":{"type":"string","description":"Stable Eckari carrier identifier such as ups or royal_mail."},"name":{"type":"string","description":"Human-readable carrier name such as UPS."}}},"match_strength":{"type":"string","enum":["distinctive","strong","weak","none"],"description":"How distinctive the match behind `carrier` is. distinctive = a carrier-unique marker (prefix or UPU S10 operator) plus length plus a valid check digit - only that carrier issues numbers of this shape. strong = carrier-unique marker plus length, check digit not verifiable. weak = length plus check digit only, with no carrier-unique marker; a random number of the right length passes a single decimal check digit about 1 time in 10 (about 1 in 36 for the alphanumeric mod 37,36 check), so treat a weak match as a hint. none = no carrier is named."},"match_score":{"type":["number","null"],"description":"Deterministic signature match score for `carrier` from a fixed table (0-1, two decimals) - carrier-unique prefix plus length plus valid check digit 0.98, UPU S10 with a valid check digit 0.90, prefix plus length 0.85, length plus valid check digit 0.80, S10 structure with an invalid check digit 0.45, plus 0.02 when a country hint matches. It is a rule-based heuristic, NOT a calibrated probability, and it is null when no carrier is named.","minimum":0,"maximum":1},"candidates":{"type":"array","description":"Every carrier whose signature matched, highest score first, ties broken by carrier_id ascending. Candidates below the 0.5 reporting threshold are still listed here even though `carrier` is null, so an ambiguous or failed-check number can be inspected.","items":{"type":"object","additionalProperties":false,"required":["carrier_id","carrier_name","match_score","match_strength","format_id","evidence"],"properties":{"carrier_id":{"type":"string","description":"Stable Eckari carrier identifier such as ups or usps."},"carrier_name":{"type":"string","description":"Human-readable carrier name."},"match_score":{"type":"number","description":"This candidate's score from the same fixed table as the top-level match_score.","minimum":0,"maximum":1},"match_strength":{"type":"string","enum":["distinctive","strong","weak"],"description":"How distinctive this candidate's match is; same meaning as the top-level field (a candidate is never \"none\")."},"format_id":{"type":"string","description":"Identifier of the matched format within the signature set, for example ups_1z or upu_s10."},"evidence":{"type":"object","additionalProperties":false,"required":["prefix","length","check_digit","s10_origin_country","country_hint"],"description":"What about this number made the format match. A null member means that signal played no part in this match.","properties":{"prefix":{"type":["string","null"],"description":"The leading characters of the normalised number that form the carrier-unique marker, for example 1Z, or the UPU S10 service indicator such as RB. Null when the format has no distinguishing prefix."},"length":{"type":["integer","null"],"description":"The exact number of characters this format requires, for example 18 for a UPS 1Z number. Null when the format accepts a range of lengths."},"check_digit":{"type":["string","null"],"description":"Name of the check-digit algorithm that validated this number - ups_mod10, gs1_mod10, fedex_express_mod11, dhl_mod7, mod_37_36 or upu_s10. Null when the format defines no check digit, or when the S10 check digit did not validate."},"s10_origin_country":{"type":["string","null"],"description":"ISO 3166-1 alpha-2 country of the designated postal operator for a UPU S10 match. Null for non-postal formats."},"country_hint":{"type":["string","null"],"description":"The origin_country or destination_country you supplied that matched this format's country list and added the 0.02 tie-breaker. Null when no hint applied."}}}}}},"input":{"type":"object","additionalProperties":false,"required":["original","normalised"],"description":"The tracking number as supplied and as evaluated.","properties":{"original":{"type":"string","description":"Input as supplied, trimmed. Never altered otherwise."},"normalised":{"type":"string","description":"Upper-cased value with spaces and hyphens removed - the string the rules were evaluated against."}}},"formats_matched":{"type":"integer","description":"Number of distinct formats in the signature set whose pattern matched the normalised number, counted before check digits were applied. Zero with no candidates means no covered format matches this shape at all; a value above zero with no candidates means a covered format matched but its check digit did not validate - a typo or a partial capture rather than an unknown carrier.","minimum":0},"upu_s10":{"type":["object","null"],"additionalProperties":false,"description":"Parsed UPU S10 components; null when the number does not have the S10 structure.","required":["service_indicator","service_type","serial","check_digit_valid","origin_country"],"properties":{"service_indicator":{"type":"string","description":"Two-letter S10 service indicator such as RB."},"service_type":{"type":["string","null"],"description":"Service class implied by the first indicator letter, for example letter_post_registered; null when unrecognised."},"serial":{"type":"string","description":"Eight-digit S10 serial number."},"check_digit_valid":{"type":"boolean","description":"True when the S10 check digit validates against the serial."},"origin_country":{"type":"string","description":"ISO 3166-1 alpha-2 country code of the origin designated operator."}}},"signature_version":{"type":"string","description":"Version of the signature set that produced this result; results are reproducible for a given version."}}},"weather_us_alerts_output":{"type":"object","additionalProperties":false,"required":["query","items","page"],"properties":{"query":{"type":"object","additionalProperties":false,"required":["lat","lon","state","detail"],"description":"The area actually queried, echoed so a batched caller can match answers to inputs.","properties":{"lat":{"type":["number","null"],"description":"Latitude queried, when a point was supplied."},"lon":{"type":["number","null"],"description":"Longitude queried, when a point was supplied."},"state":{"type":["string","null"],"description":"Area code queried, when a state was supplied."},"detail":{"type":"string","description":"Detail level applied - compact (default) or full."}}},"items":{"type":"array","description":"Active alerts in the order the National Weather Service returns them (newest first, by the time the message was sent; Eckari does not re-sort), windowed by limit and offset. An empty array means no alert is active for the queried point or area right now - it is a valid answer, not an error.","items":{"type":"object","additionalProperties":false,"required":["id","event","severity","certainty","urgency","status","message_type","headline","area_description","sender_name","sent","effective","onset","expires","ends","affected_zones"],"properties":{"id":{"type":"string","description":"NWS alert identifier (CAP urn:oid form)."},"event":{"type":["string","null"],"description":"Event type such as Extreme Heat Warning."},"severity":{"type":["string","null"],"description":"CAP severity - Extreme / Severe / Moderate / Minor / Unknown."},"certainty":{"type":["string","null"],"description":"CAP certainty - Observed / Likely / Possible / Unlikely / Unknown."},"urgency":{"type":["string","null"],"description":"CAP urgency - Immediate / Expected / Future / Past / Unknown."},"status":{"type":["string","null"],"description":"CAP status such as Actual / Exercise / Test."},"message_type":{"type":["string","null"],"description":"CAP message type - Alert / Update / Cancel."},"headline":{"type":["string","null"],"description":"NWS headline for the alert."},"area_description":{"type":["string","null"],"description":"Human-readable list of affected areas."},"sender_name":{"type":["string","null"],"description":"Issuing office such as NWS Las Vegas NV."},"sent":{"type":["string","null"],"description":"Time the message was sent, RFC 3339 UTC (Z). This is the order NWS returns alerts in, newest first."},"effective":{"type":["string","null"],"description":"Time the alert becomes effective, RFC 3339 UTC (Z)."},"onset":{"type":["string","null"],"description":"Expected start of the hazard, RFC 3339 UTC (Z)."},"expires":{"type":["string","null"],"description":"Time the alert message expires, RFC 3339 UTC (Z). After this the alert must be refetched; it does not mean the hazard has ended (see ends)."},"ends":{"type":["string","null"],"description":"Expected end of the hazard, RFC 3339 UTC (Z)."},"affected_zones":{"type":"array","description":"NWS zone codes covered by the alert, for example CAZ038. The third character is the zone type - Z public forecast zone, C county, F fire weather - and the code is the last segment of the zone URL NWS publishes, so the URL is reconstructible from it.","items":{"type":"string"}},"description":{"type":["string","null"],"description":"Alert narrative as issued by NWS, truncated to 2000 characters when description_truncated is true. Returned only when detail=full - it is prose written for a human reader and restates the structured fields above."},"description_truncated":{"type":"boolean","description":"True when the narrative was truncated at 2000 characters. Returned only when detail=full, alongside description."},"instruction":{"type":["string","null"],"description":"Protective action instruction issued by NWS. Returned only when detail=full."}}}},"page":{"type":"object","additionalProperties":false,"required":["limit","offset","returned","total","has_more","next_offset"],"description":"Canonical paging block over the active alert set. total is exact - the whole set is read in one request and page reports a window over it.","properties":{"limit":{"type":"integer","description":"Page size applied (the limit input, default 5)."},"offset":{"type":"integer","description":"Zero-based index of the first item returned (the offset input)."},"returned":{"type":"integer","description":"Number of items in this response."},"total":{"type":"integer","description":"Total number of alerts active for the queried point or area at request time."},"has_more":{"type":"boolean","description":"True when active alerts exist beyond this window."},"next_offset":{"type":["integer","null"],"description":"Offset to request next; null when has_more is false."}}}}},"weather_us_forecast_output":{"type":"object","additionalProperties":false,"required":["query","location","updated_at","generated_at","valid_from","periods"],"properties":{"query":{"type":"object","additionalProperties":false,"required":["lat","lon","hourly","period_limit","hours","detail"],"description":"The request as resolved, echoed so a batched caller can match answers to inputs and see which defaults were applied.","properties":{"lat":{"type":"number","description":"Latitude actually queried (rounded to 4 decimal places)."},"lon":{"type":"number","description":"Longitude actually queried (rounded to 4 decimal places)."},"hourly":{"type":"boolean","description":"True when the hourly series was requested."},"period_limit":{"type":["integer","null"],"description":"Maximum number of 12-hour day/night periods requested (default 6); null when hourly is true. The forecast office may issue fewer, so this is the ceiling, not periods.length."},"hours":{"type":["integer","null"],"description":"Number of hourly periods requested (default 24); null when hourly is false."},"detail":{"type":"string","description":"Detail level applied - compact (default) or full."}}},"location":{"type":"object","additionalProperties":false,"required":["city","state","timezone"],"description":"What the National Weather Service reports at the queried point. The coordinates are in query; the forecast office and grid square that produced the forecast are provenance, not weather, and are not published here - meta.source names the provider.","properties":{"city":{"type":["string","null"],"description":"Nearest named place reported by NWS for the point; null when NWS omits it."},"state":{"type":["string","null"],"description":"Two-letter US state or territory code."},"timezone":{"type":["string","null"],"description":"IANA timezone of the point as reported by NWS - the zone the period start_time and end_time offsets are expressed in."}}},"updated_at":{"type":["string","null"],"description":"Time the forecast product was issued by the forecast office (NWS updateTime), RFC 3339 UTC. This is the true age of the forecast."},"generated_at":{"type":["string","null"],"description":"Time NWS generated this response from the forecast grid (RFC 3339 UTC)."},"valid_from":{"type":["string","null"],"description":"Start of the validity interval of the underlying forecast grid (RFC 3339 UTC)."},"periods":{"type":"array","description":"Forecast periods in chronological order, soonest first, as issued by the forecast office. This is a time series, not a paged list - ask for more with periods or hours.","items":{"type":"object","additionalProperties":false,"required":["name","start_time","end_time","is_daytime","temperature_c","temperature_f","precipitation_probability_pct","wind_speed_range_kmh","wind_direction","short_forecast"],"properties":{"name":{"type":["string","null"],"description":"Period label such as Tonight or Tuesday; null for hourly periods."},"start_time":{"type":"string","description":"Period start as RFC 3339 with the local UTC offset NWS issues (for example 2026-08-18T08:00:00-04:00), always in that one format. A forecast period is a local-time concept, so the offset is kept rather than converted to UTC."},"end_time":{"type":"string","description":"Period end, same format as start_time."},"is_daytime":{"type":["boolean","null"],"description":"True when the National Weather Service marks the period as daytime, false when it marks it as night, null when the forecast omits the flag - null is not night."},"temperature_c":{"type":["number","null"],"description":"Forecast temperature in degrees Celsius (2 decimal places). Null when NWS omits the value or issues it with a unit this contract does not recognise - a number with no stated unit is never assumed to be Fahrenheit."},"temperature_f":{"type":["number","null"],"description":"The same forecast temperature in degrees Fahrenheit - the scale NWS issues for US forecasts. Null under the same conditions as temperature_c."},"precipitation_probability_pct":{"type":["number","null"],"description":"Probability of precipitation for the period as a percentage; null when the forecast office does not give one."},"wind_speed_range_kmh":{"type":["object","null"],"additionalProperties":false,"required":["min","max"],"description":"Wind speed range in kilometres per hour, parsed from the text phrase NWS issues (\"3 to 7 mph\" gives min 4.83 / max 11.27; \"10 mph\" gives min = max = 16.09). Null when the phrase is not one this contract parses - never a guessed number. A forecast wind is issued as a range, which is why this is an object and why the name says range; the measured wind in weather.us.observation is a single wind_speed_kmh number, so the two are never confused across the family.","properties":{"min":{"type":"number","description":"Lower bound of the forecast wind speed in km/h (2 decimal places)."},"max":{"type":"number","description":"Upper bound in km/h; equal to min when NWS issues a single speed rather than a range."}}},"wind_direction":{"type":["string","null"],"description":"Compass direction the wind blows FROM, as issued by NWS (for example NW)."},"short_forecast":{"type":["string","null"],"description":"Short forecast phrase issued by NWS, for example \"Partly Sunny\"."},"temperature_trend":{"type":["string","null"],"description":"NWS trend note such as rising or falling; usually null. Returned only when detail=full."},"dewpoint_c":{"type":["number","null"],"description":"Dewpoint in degrees Celsius (2 decimal places). Hourly periods only, and returned only when detail=full."},"humidity_pct":{"type":["number","null"],"description":"Relative humidity as a percentage (2 decimal places). Hourly periods only, and returned only when detail=full."},"detailed_forecast":{"type":["string","null"],"description":"Detailed narrative issued by NWS; null for hourly periods. Returned only when detail=full - it restates the structured fields in prose."},"icon":{"type":["string","null"],"description":"NWS icon URL for the period. Returned only when detail=full."}}}}}},"weather_us_observation_output":{"type":"object","additionalProperties":false,"required":["station","observed_at","age_seconds","is_stale","cloud_layers"],"properties":{"station":{"type":"object","additionalProperties":false,"required":["id","name","distance_km"],"properties":{"id":{"type":"string","description":"NWS station identifier (for example KDCA)."},"name":{"type":["string","null"],"description":"Station name as published by NWS."},"distance_km":{"type":["number","null"],"description":"Great-circle distance in kilometres (2 decimal places) from the coordinate you asked about to the station's published position, computed by Eckari on a spherical earth. It is not the National Weather Service's own distance figure, which is measured from the forecast grid point rather than your point. Null when the station publishes no coordinates."}}},"observed_at":{"type":"string","description":"Time the observation was taken, as reported by the station (RFC 3339 UTC). This is not the request time."},"age_seconds":{"type":"integer","description":"Whole seconds between observed_at and the time this response was produced. Always inspect this before treating the reading as current.","minimum":0},"is_stale":{"type":"boolean","description":"True only when age_seconds exceeds 10800 (3 hours), which means the station has missed several reporting cycles. False does NOT mean the reading is current: most stations report every 20-60 minutes, so a reading with is_stale false can still be up to about an hour old. Read age_seconds to decide whether the observation is recent enough for your purpose. The observation is returned either way."},"text_description":{"type":["string","null"],"description":"Station's own summary phrase such as Mostly Cloudy."},"temperature_c":{"type":["number","null"],"description":"Air temperature in degrees Celsius (2 decimal places). Null when the station omits the value or its quality control rejected it (NWS qualityControl X = failed or Q = questionable)."},"temperature_f":{"type":["number","null"],"description":"The same air temperature in degrees Fahrenheit (2 decimal places), converted from temperature_c for US callers. Null whenever temperature_c is null."},"dewpoint_c":{"type":["number","null"],"description":"Dewpoint in degrees Celsius (2 decimal places). Null when the station omits the value or its quality control rejected it (NWS qualityControl X = failed or Q = questionable)."},"relative_humidity_pct":{"type":["number","null"],"description":"Relative humidity as a percentage (2 decimal places). Null when the station omits the value or its quality control rejected it (NWS qualityControl X = failed or Q = questionable)."},"wind_speed_kmh":{"type":["number","null"],"description":"Measured wind speed in kilometres per hour (2 decimal places) - a single value, unlike the forecast range weather.us.forecast returns. Null when calm, when the station omits the value, or when its quality control rejected it (NWS qualityControl X = failed or Q = questionable)."},"wind_direction_deg":{"type":["number","null"],"description":"Wind direction in degrees clockwise from true north, the direction the wind blows FROM. Null when variable, when the station omits the value, or when its quality control rejected it (NWS qualityControl X = failed or Q = questionable)."},"wind_gust_kmh":{"type":["number","null"],"description":"Wind gust in kilometres per hour. Null when the station omits the value or its quality control rejected it (NWS qualityControl X = failed or Q = questionable)."},"barometric_pressure_hpa":{"type":["number","null"],"description":"Station barometric pressure in hectopascals (2 decimal places) - the unit aviation and marine users read, equal to millibars. Null when the station omits the value or its quality control rejected it (NWS qualityControl X = failed or Q = questionable)."},"visibility_m":{"type":["number","null"],"description":"Horizontal visibility in metres. Null when the station omits the value or its quality control rejected it (NWS qualityControl X = failed or Q = questionable)."},"precipitation_last_hour_mm":{"type":["number","null"],"description":"Precipitation in the last hour in millimetres. Null when the station does not report it or its quality control rejected it (NWS qualityControl X = failed or Q = questionable)."},"cloud_layers":{"type":"array","description":"Reported cloud layers, lowest first, as published by the station. A clear-sky report (amount code SKC, CLR, NCD or NSC) is one entry with base_m null - there is no layer to measure.","items":{"type":"object","additionalProperties":false,"required":["amount","base_m"],"properties":{"amount":{"type":["object","null"],"additionalProperties":false,"required":["code","description"],"description":"METAR cloud amount, decoded. Null when the station reports no amount for the layer.","properties":{"code":{"type":"string","description":"METAR cloud amount code exactly as published - SKC, CLR, NCD, NSC, FEW, SCT, BKN, OVC or VV."},"description":{"type":["string","null"],"description":"Plain meaning of the code with its octa coverage, for example \"scattered (3-4 oktas)\". Null for a code outside the published table, which is then reported by code alone rather than guessed."}}},"base_m":{"type":["number","null"],"description":"Cloud base height above ground in metres. Null when there is no layer to measure - the amount code is SKC, CLR, NCD or NSC, for which automated stations still transmit a sentinel height (0 m, or the ceilometer's 12,000 ft reporting ceiling) that is not a cloud base - and null when the station reports no height."}}}}}}},"securitySchemes":{"eckariApiKey":{"type":"http","scheme":"bearer","description":"Eckari account API key (ek_test_… / ek_live_…) issued in the developer portal; usage is metered and billed in arrears."},"x402":{"type":"apiKey","in":"header","name":"PAYMENT-SIGNATURE","description":"x402 accountless payment. An unpaid request receives HTTP 402 with a PAYMENT-REQUIRED header; retry with PAYMENT-SIGNATURE."}}}}